# TODO: Translation updated at 2025-12-03 08:54

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:34
translate Chinese day14_docking_7adbb868:

    # "{i}Morocco{/i}. The port of Mogador is agonizingly close. The city's walls are straight, imposing, and precise—exactly like you've always imagined a castle might look."
    "{i}摩洛哥{/i}。莫加多尔港已近在咫尺。城墙笔直、雄伟而精确——正如你一直想象中城堡的模样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:36
translate Chinese day14_docking_62f251ed:

    # "The {i}Conway{/i} is near enough for you to see each wave, breaking against the cliffs, and your anxiety is growing increasingly difficult to manage."
    "{i}Conway{/i}离岸很近，近得你能看清每一道海浪拍碎在悬崖上，你的焦虑已愈发难以抑制。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:38
translate Chinese day14_docking_5e18f9ba:

    # "A sight you would have otherwise enjoyed, now just ties your stomach into a knot."
    "这本该让你赏心悦目的景象，此刻却只让你胃里打结。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:42
translate Chinese day14_docking_5e640f00:

    # "{i}Morocco{/i}. The port of Mogador is tantalizingly close. The city's walls are straight, imposing, and precise—exactly like you've always imagined a castle might look."
    "{i}摩洛哥{/i}。莫加多尔港已近在咫尺。城墙笔直、雄伟而精确——正如你一直想象中城堡的模样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:43
translate Chinese day14_docking_ca239d12:

    # "The {i}Conway{/i} is near enough for you to see each wave, breaking against the cliffs, and your excitement is growing increasingly difficult to contain."
    "{i}Conway{/i}离岸很近，近得你能看清每一道海浪拍碎在悬崖上，你的兴奋已愈发难以按捺。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:44
translate Chinese day14_docking_473b22b4:

    # "You're not the only one waiting. Arthur and two sailors took the jolly boat ashore to negotiate your entry into the port. You don't know how long that usually takes, but it {i}feels{/i} like an eternity."
    "这本该让你赏心悦目的景象，此刻却只让你胃里打结。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:45
translate Chinese day14_docking_65bd1943:

    # "For now, the ship is all but motionless, rocking gently at anchor. There is, as always, the usual work required to keep the {i}Conway{/i}... well... ship-shape."
    "眼下，船几乎静止不动，只在锚泊处轻轻摇晃。像往常一样，仍需要进行例行工作以维持{i}Conway{/i}……呃……井然有序。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:49
translate Chinese day14_docking_1ccda006:

    # "Though by now you are being excluded from almost everything. More passenger than sailor. But even as a passenger you can take part in the dealings of a sailing ships' most precious commodities."
    "不过到现在，你几乎被排除在所有事务之外了，更像乘客而非水手。但即便作为乘客，你也能参与帆船上最珍贵商品的交易。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:51
translate Chinese day14_docking_263f2b21:

    # "Rumor and speculation."
    "谣言与猜测。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:63
translate Chinese day14_docking_3124f9a1:

    # p "Ready to be back on dry land?"
    p "准备好重返陆地了吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:65
translate Chinese day14_docking_a0a8ad6e:

    # "The lizard just looks out at the town in the distance, only managing to tear himself away to face you after a brief silence."
    "蜥蜴只是眺望着远处的城镇，短暂沉默后，才勉强将目光转向你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:73
translate Chinese day14_docking_14306e5d:

    # j "Few things I'm looking forward more than it."
    j "没什么比这更让我期待的了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:75
translate Chinese day14_docking_d9990d6c:

    # p "That eager to see me go?"
    p "这么急着看我走？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:79
translate Chinese day14_docking_3ffbc013:

    # j "That's not how I meant it, I just meant to get firm ground under these claws again."
    j "我不是那个意思，我只是想再次让爪子踏在坚实的地面上。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:81
translate Chinese day14_docking_86d9c289:

    # p "What are they doing anyway?"
    p "他们到底在干什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:85
translate Chinese day14_docking_5f67f26c:

    # j "The ones who left for land?{w} Have you been to Morocco before?"
    j "那些上岸的人？{w}你以前来过摩洛哥吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:87
translate Chinese day14_docking_3c06df8e:

    # p "Well... no, of course not. Have you?"
    p "呃……没有，当然没有。你呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:89
translate Chinese day14_docking_50825aa4:

    # j "No. And I'm sure the captain would like the ship to be able to leave again."
    j "没有。而且我敢说船长希望这艘船还能再次启航。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:93
translate Chinese day14_docking_1e4a8266:

    # "He grins, and indicates a rocky island lying off the ship's bow."
    "他咧嘴一笑，指了指船头前方一座多岩的岛屿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:95
translate Chinese day14_docking_347d7ee2:

    # j "Which would be harder to do if we run aground."
    j "要是搁浅了，那可就更难了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:97
translate Chinese day14_docking_842efbe5:

    # p "Is that what they're doing?{w} Finding a solution for it... I don't know maps or something?"
    p "他们就是在干这个？{w}在想办法……用地图还是什么来解决？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:99
translate Chinese day14_docking_d14d5956:

    # j "Maybe! Perhaps a local guide to get us around any hidden shoals."
    j "也许吧！可能找个本地向导带我们绕过暗滩。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:101
translate Chinese day14_docking_53682045:

    # j "...Or maybe he's been captured by pirates. I heard this used to be a pirate haven."
    j "……或者也许他被海盗抓了。我听说这里以前是海盗窝。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:103
translate Chinese day14_docking_4e9663b2:

    # "You're not quite certain how serious you're supposed to take him."
    "你不确定该把他的话当真到什么程度。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:106
translate Chinese day14_docking_f86fcca4:

    # j "{cps=5000}...Or maybe he's been captured by pirates. I heard this used to be a pirate haven.{/cps}" nointeract
    j "{cps=5000}……或者也许他被海盗抓了。我听说这里以前是海盗窝。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:112
translate Chinese day14_docking_b714f1a4:

    # j "You're calling me a liar?"
    j "你说我撒谎？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:113
translate Chinese day14_docking_48b934b2:

    # p "I'm saying that's the kind of thing you'd definitely say if you {i}were{/i} making up a story,{w} and nobody told me to learn how to fire a cannon or anything."
    p "我是说，如果你{i}真的{/i}在编故事，你肯定就会说这种事，{w}而且又没人让我学开炮什么的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:118
translate Chinese day14_docking_3b0fa73a:

    # j "Oh, ye of little faith. Hey! Torres!"
    j "哦，你这小信的人哪！Hey! Torres!（引自马太福音14：31，意在调侃主角对自己缺乏信任）"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:119
translate Chinese day14_docking_9e710d9d:

    # "He beckons the falcon over and, after a moment of reluctance, Torres joins you."
    "他招手叫猎鹰过来，Torres不情愿地迟疑片刻，还是加入了你们。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:124
translate Chinese day14_docking_463dfd54:

    # t "What?"
    t "什么问题？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:125
translate Chinese day14_docking_9d4931c7:

    # j "Isn't this pirate territory?"
    j "这里不是海盗的地盘吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:126
translate Chinese day14_docking_17d3c8dc:

    # t "It was, yes. Why?"
    t "以前是，没错。怎么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:127
translate Chinese day14_docking_87475b5d:

    # j "[name] doesn't believe me."
    j "[name]不信我。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:128
translate Chinese day14_docking_a4396a94:

    # t "[name] is new to the water. Everyone south of the Guadalquivir knows the corsairs."
    t "[name]是航海新手。瓜达尔基维尔河以南的人都知道那些北非海盗。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:129
translate Chinese day14_docking_2c38fd5c:

    # t "They raided Cadiz, my home—one of the biggest ports in all of Spain."
    t "他们袭击过加的斯，我的家乡——整个西班牙最大的港口之一。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:130
translate Chinese day14_docking_df1c58fe:

    # p "I... I had no idea..."
    p "我……我完全不知道……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:131
translate Chinese day14_docking_814c778f:

    # t "We defeated them, you know. But we stay vigilant, too. Keep our eyes on the horizon, in case they approach."
    t "我们打败了他们，你知道的。但我们也保持警惕，时刻盯着海平面，以防他们靠近。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:132
translate Chinese day14_docking_5cb57202:

    # p "Still?"
    p "现在还是？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:133
translate Chinese day14_docking_4f5a9fcc:

    # t "A little. If you visit, or just sail along the coast of Andalucia, you'll see all the {i}torres{/i} we built. The watchtowers."
    t "有一点。如果你去拜访，或者只是沿着安达卢西亚海岸航行，你会看到我们建造的所有{i}torres{/i}（西班牙语：塔）。是瞭望塔。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:134
translate Chinese day14_docking_0bffe1ae:

    # p "Torres. I see."
    p "Torres。我明白了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:135
translate Chinese day14_docking_60901cbe:

    # "The falcon gives a wink at your dawning realization."
    "猎鹰对恍然大悟的你wink了一下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:136
translate Chinese day14_docking_bf84ddf2:

    # t "He wasn't kidding, this one."
    t "他这次可不是在开玩笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:137
translate Chinese day14_docking_3e94ba91:

    # j "Told ya."
    j "早告诉过你了嘛。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:142
translate Chinese day14_docking_a5e938c5:

    # "After Torres returns to work, you shake your head, thinking about living under the threat of pirate raids—of all things!"
    "托雷斯回去工作后，你摇摇头，想着生活在海盗袭击的威胁下——真是的！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:143
translate Chinese day14_docking_6221da4f:

    # p "Sorry for doubting you."
    p "抱歉怀疑你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:145
translate Chinese day14_docking_a522bef0:

    # "Or perhaps you'll become one of the pirates."
    "或者也许你会成为海盗之一。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:146
translate Chinese day14_docking_f84e7adf:

    # "Swashbuckling, wielding a blade and pistol to take your due from ill-prepared ships."
    "耀武扬威，手持刀剑和手枪，从毫无防备的船只上夺取你应得之物。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:147
translate Chinese day14_docking_b8db6908:

    # "Now that'd be something!"
    "那才叫带劲！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:155
translate Chinese day14_docking_2d4ffcdd:

    # j "Oh, ye of little faith. Hey! Perce!"
    j "哦，你这小信的人哪！Hey! Torres!（引自马太福音14：31，意在调侃主角对自己缺乏信任）"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:159
translate Chinese day14_docking_acd85aae:

    # "He beckons the jackal over. Perce is obviously skeptical, but rolls his eyes and joins you."
    "他招手叫豺狼过来。Perce显然很怀疑，但还是翻了个白眼，加入了你们。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:164
translate Chinese day14_docking_a6aa469c:

    # pb "What do you want?"
    pb "你想干嘛？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:165
translate Chinese day14_docking_9d4931c7_1:

    # j "Isn't this pirate territory?"
    j ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:169
translate Chinese day14_docking_e0182c2c:

    # pb "Why? You're worried?"
    pb "怎么？你在发愁吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:173
translate Chinese day14_docking_b8a4a45f:

    # j "{i}I'm{/i} not. I was just telling [name]. He didn't believe me that there used to be pirates on this coast."
    j "{i}我{/i}没发什么愁。我只是在告诉[name]。我说这片海岸以前有海盗他不信。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:179
translate Chinese day14_docking_fc053810:

    # "Perce looks between the two of you. You give him the kind of shrug that you figure indicates the healthy skepticism Julian warrants."
    "Perce的目光在你们俩之间转了转。你耸耸肩，权当表示对Julian那套说辞理应保持合理怀疑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:180
translate Chinese day14_docking_5f0d9298:

    # pb "Of course."
    pb "当然"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:181
translate Chinese day14_docking_2eee97e1:

    # p "There were?"
    p "真有？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:182
translate Chinese day14_docking_91309a94:

    # pb "Sure. Mostly around Tunisia, but down here, too. Barbarossa, y'know? Corsairs."
    pb "当然。主要在突尼斯附近，但这边也有。红胡子，知道吗？那些北非海盗。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:185
translate Chinese day14_docking_ec626389:

    # j "See? They used to be notorious."
    j "看吧？他们以前可是臭名昭著。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:188
translate Chinese day14_docking_04991f9d:

    # pb "Naw. Still are. {p}There was the {i}Swift{/i}—knew somebody on her.{w} And the {i}Eliza{/i}, two years ago. Thousand-ton ship, East India Company..."
    pb "不。现在还是。
  {p}比如{i}迅捷号{/i}——我认识船上的人。{w}还有两年前的{i}伊丽莎号{/i}。千吨大船，东印度公司的……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:196
translate Chinese day14_docking_bc4e070c:

    # "He speaks with the tone of someone who has spent enough time at sea to know scores of lost ships, and what happened to them. Your ears draw back, and you glance towards a sun-drenched coast that suddenly seems less welcoming."
    "他的语气像是那种在海上待得够久、知道无数沉船及其遭遇的人。你的耳朵向后缩了缩，瞥向阳光普照的海岸，那里突然显得不那么友好了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:197
translate Chinese day14_docking_33b1d209:

    # p "They... sank it?"
    p "他们……把它击沉了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:198
translate Chinese day14_docking_15f44959:

    # pb "Took the crew. Ransomed anyone worthwhile an' kept the rest. That was actually just off the coast, here, now that I think of it..."
    pb "抓了船员。有价值的勒索赎金，剩下的就留下。其实就在这附近海岸，现在想想……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:207
translate Chinese day14_docking_5fd0bb8f:

    # p "Really? Here?"
    p "真的？这里？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:209
translate Chinese day14_docking_6e3d905d:

    # pb "Used to have galleys, but now they got big second-raters. Eighty guns, at least. Maybe a hundred."
    pb "以前用的是桨帆船，但现在他们有了大型二等舰。至少八十门炮，也许一百门。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:210
translate Chinese day14_docking_d013f67f:

    # "Again it occurs to you that, were 'piracy' a serious threat, a merchant ship would not be sailing alone into such waters. Nor does the jackal's growing smirk lend him much credibility."
    "你再次想到，如果“海盗”真是严重威胁，商船就不会独自驶入这片水域了。而且豺狼那越来越得意的假笑也让他没什么可信度。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:214
translate Chinese day14_docking_44d3b02f:

    # j "Fine. Perce is full of shit."
    j "好吧。Perce满嘴胡扯。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:218
translate Chinese day14_docking_5c1bb575:

    # pb "Hey, you asked."
    pb "嘿，是你问的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:224
translate Chinese day14_docking_6ade1665:

    # "Julian watches him go, shaking his head."
    "Julian看着他离开，摇了摇头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:228
translate Chinese day14_docking_94528f1c:

    # j "That was my mistake. But I'm serious, it {i}used{/i} to be. Barbarossa, that's real. Just... not now."
    j "那是我的错。但我是认真的，以前{i}确实{/i}有。红胡子，那是真的。只是……不是现在。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:229
translate Chinese day14_docking_985a8342:

    # p "So I don't have to worry."
    p "所以我不用担心了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:230
translate Chinese day14_docking_4932fce7:

    # p "Can't join them either, though"
    p "不过也没法加入他们了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:235
translate Chinese day14_docking_38f7a726:

    # "He just laughs."
    "他只是笑了笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:237
translate Chinese day14_docking_b277b975:

    # j "No. Probably not."
    j "不。大概不行。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:242
translate Chinese day14_docking_f8c1bdb3:

    # j "You've never heard of the Barbary pirates? The Barbary Coast wasn't safe to travel until... well, if you're flying the wrong flag, it's {i}still{/i} not always safe."
    j "你没听说过巴巴里海盗吗？巴巴里海岸直到……嗯，可以说如果你挂错了旗，现在{i}也{/i}不总是安全的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:243
translate Chinese day14_docking_e0d16914:

    # p "Are we flying the right flag?"
    p "我们挂对旗了吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:245
translate Chinese day14_docking_6346213b:

    # j "Use your head, will you? We'd hardly be here, politely knocking at the front door if we were."
    j "动动脑子，行吗？要是挂错了，我们才不会在这儿，彬彬有礼地敲前门呢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:249
translate Chinese day14_docking_8cd063c4:

    # j "They probably won't bother us. But how are you with a cutlass?"
    j "他们大概不会找我们麻烦。但你用弯刀怎么样？你用弯刀的水平怎么样？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:255
translate Chinese day14_docking_f748b503:

    # "He grins, and pantomimes swinging a sword with dramatic flair."
    "他咧嘴一笑，夸张地比划着挥剑的动作。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:256
translate Chinese day14_docking_2569bdbb:

    # p "Hey, this ship doesn't want me anymore, so I certainly won't die heroically trying to defend it."
    p "嘿，这艘船已经不想要我了，所以我肯定不会为了保卫它而英勇牺牲。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:258
translate Chinese day14_docking_9072645b:

    # p "If anything you should be careful that I won't join the pirates."
    p "真要我说，你该小心我不会加入海盗。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:260
translate Chinese day14_docking_145641bb:

    # j "Who says I wouldn't either?"
    j "谁说我就不会呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:262
translate Chinese day14_docking_28f1f419:

    # "A cry of \"boat, ho!\" from the lookout perks your ears. You can't help but feel your heartbeat briefly quicken as the moment of your unwanted departure draws ever nearer."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:280
translate Chinese day14_docking_46b7efaa:

    # "As the small craft approaches you realize that a fourth figure has joined the sailors from the {i}Conway{/i}."
    "小船靠近时，你意识到{i}Conway{/i}的水手中多出了第四个人影。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:282
translate Chinese day14_docking_880b2b5b:

    # "Samuel is making [his] way over to the davits, which the crew have swung out in preparation."
    "Samuel 正朝吊艇架走去——船员们已将它摆出，准备就绪。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:303
translate Chinese day14_docking_6545d87c:

    # p "You've docked before, right?"
    p "你以前靠过码头，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:305
translate Chinese day14_docking_feceea7a:

    # w "What? Of course. I wasn't born on the {i}Conway{/i}."
    w "什么？当然。我又不是生在{i}Conway{/i}上的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:306
translate Chinese day14_docking_5cc9230b:

    # p "Well... I know, I know. I just..."
    p "呃……我知道，我知道。我只是……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:310
translate Chinese day14_docking_d87f0bab:

    # w "If you're going to ask a question, at least {i}ask{/i} it."
    w "如果你要问问题，至少得{i}问{/i}出来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:315
translate Chinese day14_docking_3b2f4846:

