# game/script morocco part1.rpy:662
translate Chinese day14_docking_96c4378c_1:

    # p "You think that it's different?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:663
translate Chinese day14_docking_2b2f85c4_1:

    # w "I suppose \"I don't know\" means something different than I always thought it did..."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:664
translate Chinese day14_docking_71e686ab_1:

    # p "Fine. {p}I'm just eager to see what the city is like. You're not?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:665
translate Chinese day14_docking_9013ecda_1:

    # w "A harbor. Buildings. People."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:667
translate Chinese day14_docking_d7edb6e1_1:

    # p "People who don't know you."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:668
translate Chinese day14_docking_18945e29_1:

    # w "Probably not."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:669
translate Chinese day14_docking_b7e34a72_1:

    # p "Will you stay?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:673
translate Chinese day14_docking_e2989b11_1:

    # w "In Mogador?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:677
translate Chinese day14_docking_15f923da_1:

    # w "First, no.{w} Not that it's any of your business.{p}And second, I would not tell you even if I was planning on jumping ship."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:681
translate Chinese day14_docking_c3729c10_1:

    # p "You might. I {i}would{/i} miss you."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:682
translate Chinese day14_docking_762f34e1_1:

    # w "Don't."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:683
translate Chinese day14_docking_b37b4ed8_1:

    # p "Maybe I should try owing you money."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:684
translate Chinese day14_docking_2dcb61e8_1:

    # w "I said-"
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:685
translate Chinese day14_docking_e88a0767_1:

    # p "Sorry."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:689
translate Chinese day14_docking_51d60a47_1:

    # "Wolf shakes his head, setting his muzzle and staring out at the breaking waves. At length, you hear him grunt quietly."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:690
translate Chinese day14_docking_1a4e7fc6_1:

    # w "There's your answer."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:691
translate Chinese day14_docking_e68155d5_1:

    # p "Answer? To what?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:693
translate Chinese day14_docking_ce105843_1:

    # p "A whole new group of them for you to ignore, even."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:698
translate Chinese day14_docking_dc639614_1:

    # "Wolf's thin, dark smile is one you're all too familiar with, by now. But at least he's not glaring at you."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:699
translate Chinese day14_docking_954b559b_1:

    # w "It's useful to stay in practice."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:700
translate Chinese day14_docking_63a7bb5c_1:

    # p "You might find something to enjoy, you know. When we get there. {p} If we get there."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:702
translate Chinese day14_docking_20f28a75_1:

    # w "Right. Because my time with you is always so pleasant."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:703
translate Chinese day14_docking_3ff4c177_1:

    # p "Forget it. I don't know why I asked."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:704
translate Chinese day14_docking_7ee9dbcd_1:

    # w "You can sate your curiosity soon enough."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:705
translate Chinese day14_docking_ab9d3ae4_1:

    # p "Hmm?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:706
translate Chinese day14_docking_db7eeff1_1:

    # w "That's the jolly boat, isn't it?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:724
translate Chinese day14_docking_f2f7a28e_1:

    # "So it is. And, as it comes closer, you can see that a fourth figure has joined the sailors from the {i}Conway{/i}. Samuel is already making [his] way over to the davits, which the crew are swinging out in preparation."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:737
translate Chinese day14_docking_6cbcd4c3_1:

    # "You decide to see what's going on, even if you can already guess it'll mean being asked to help. Wolf shrugs, watching you go without following."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:748
translate Chinese day14_docking_e841530e:

    # "The maned wolf is leaning against the ship's railing, [his] head craned forward, watching the harbor. You have the impression that, for the moment, there's not much to do."
    "鬃狼正靠着船舷栏杆，[他]向前探着头，望着港口。你觉得眼下似乎没什么事可做。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:749
translate Chinese day14_docking_52f60c5a:

    # p "What's going on?"
    p "发生什么事了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:750
translate Chinese day14_docking_7b5cd015:

    # "[He] turns away from the view, then glances behind [his] shoulder to confirm that's what you're asking about."
    "[他]从景色中转过身来，然后回头瞥了一眼，以确认你问的是这个。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:755
translate Chinese day14_docking_4a97d7df:

    # s "You mean, why are we drifting?"
    s "你是想问，我们为什么还漂着？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:756
translate Chinese day14_docking_4cfdbca0:

    # p "Yes. I thought perhaps we were waiting for the tide, but..."
    p "是的。我原以为我们可能在等潮水，但是……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:757
translate Chinese day14_docking_d41f6d0e:

    # s "We're not. Mogador is a new port."
    s "不是。摩加多尔是个新港口。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:759
translate Chinese day14_docking_f1096d2a:

    # p "Oh, right. Trade used to go through Safi, didn't it?"
    p "哦，对。贸易以前是走萨菲港，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:763
translate Chinese day14_docking_be97adcb:

    # "Samuel looks at you curiously, then laughs."
    "Samuel好奇地看着你，然后笑了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:764
translate Chinese day14_docking_4d299ff4:

    # s "Look at ya, eh? An old salt already now."
    s "瞧瞧你，嗯？已经是个老水手了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:765
translate Chinese day14_docking_cc6f9ffe:

    # p "No, just something I overhead. Why does it matter that it's a new port?"
    p "不，只是我无意中听到的。为什么是新港口就很重要？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:767
translate Chinese day14_docking_7b5d073d:

    # p "So?"
    p "所以呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:771
translate Chinese day14_docking_d9577b16:

    # s "We're waiting on a pilot. Someone who can guide us through the harbor. It's not always as easy as get in and get out."
    s "我们在等引航员。一个能引导我们进港的人。进出港口并不总是那么简单。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:772
translate Chinese day14_docking_0cf6ff54:

    # p "Oh. I suppose that makes sense. I... I guess I thought you'd just follow another ship to see where they went."
    p "哦。我想这有道理。我……我原以为你们会跟着另一艘船，看他们往哪儿走。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:773
translate Chinese day14_docking_906651f9:

    # "[He] points to a few boats, sails partly unfurled, drifting lazily from between the town itself and the island."
    "[他]指向几艘船，它们半张着帆，懒洋洋地从城镇本身和岛屿之间漂过。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:774
translate Chinese day14_docking_f27b97f7:

    # s "Sure, one of those ones, it's different. A fishing boat, like, they don't draw much water. For us... I'd rather have a local guide. Takes a slew of time to find one, now, that's why they done put ashore already."
    s "当然了，其中那艘不一样。那是渔船，吃水浅。咱们的话...我宁愿找个本地向导。现在找向导可费时间了，所以他们才已经靠岸了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:775
translate Chinese day14_docking_db1f5e1a:

    # p "Why?"
    p "为什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:776
translate Chinese day14_docking_c7e853e2:

    # s "Why's it take time?"
    s "为什么这要花这么长时间？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:777
translate Chinese day14_docking_a0cdf6ca:

    # p "Yeah."
    p "没错"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:781
translate Chinese day14_docking_e9e077ea:

    # s "For a start, how's your Arabic?"
    s "首先，你的阿拉伯语怎么样？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:782
translate Chinese day14_docking_dcefe29d:

    # p "More or less non-existent."
    p "基本不会。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:783
translate Chinese day14_docking_5067e660:

    # s "There ya go. It's one thing to know ones name, but asking about the depth under our keel?{w} The material of the ground to avoid dragging our anchor?"
    s "这不就对了。知道人名是一回事，但问我们龙骨下的水深？{w} 问海底的底质以防拖锚？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:784
translate Chinese day14_docking_28eb979d:

    # s "Different thing."
    s "那是另一回事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:788
translate Chinese day14_docking_6b0c7666:

    # s "Someone will speak English. Or French, or Portuguese, maybe. Not me, to be sure. Not Arthur, either, but... see?"
    s "总会有人说英语。或者法语，或者葡萄牙语，也许。肯定不是我。也不是Arthur，但是……看到了吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:789
translate Chinese day14_docking_7951b481:

    # p "See what?"
    p "看什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:790
translate Chinese day14_docking_558635c4:

    # s "He's coming back."
    s "他回来了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:802
translate Chinese day14_docking_6a977e9a:

    # "Following the direction [he] points, you can just make out the jolly boat. A fourth figure has joined the sailors from the {i}Conway{/i}."
    "顺着他指的方向，你刚好能辨认出小艇。{i}Conway{/i}的水手中又多了一个身影。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:815
translate Chinese day14_docking_c9f89f3a:

    # "Curious, you follow Samuel when the maned wolf heads to the railing to see what's going on. The davits have already been swung out, and you realize your proximity means you're going to be asked to help with them."
    "出于好奇，当鬃狼走向栏杆去看发生了什么时，你跟着去了。吊艇架已经摆出来了，你意识到自己站得这么近，你大概会被叫去帮忙。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:817
translate Chinese day14_docking_d88f8dd1:

    # "Sure enough, no sooner do you hear Arthur ordering the jolly boat hoisted back aboard than one of the crew motions towards the ropes."
    "果然，没过多久，你听到Arthur命令将小艇吊回船上，然后一名船员朝绳索示意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:819
translate Chinese day14_docking_5062565f:

    # sailmullein "Make yourself useful and help grab the falls, why don't you?"
    sailmullein "别闲着，帮忙抓住吊索，怎么样？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:827
translate Chinese day14_docking_77a6679a:

    # "The demand is directed at Julian, who leisurely makes his way over to the right davit to help three other sailors."
    "这个要求是针对Julian的，他悠闲地走到右边的吊艇架，去帮另外三名水手。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:834
translate Chinese day14_docking_e95e8b02:

    # "The demand is directed at Wolf, who promptly makes his way over to the right davit to help three other sailors."
    "这个要求是针对Wolf的，他立刻走到右边的吊艇架，去帮另外三名水手。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:836
translate Chinese day14_docking_4acc4d86:

    # "Samuel directs them with [his] paws, keeping the two teams hauling at the same speed lest the boat tips over."
    "Samuel用[他]的爪子指挥着他们，让两队人以同样的速度拉拽，以防小艇倾覆。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:838
translate Chinese day14_docking_312b004a:

    # p "Should I help?"
    p "我应该帮忙吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:840
translate Chinese day14_docking_3b95dc3c:

    # "Samuel perks up from [his] task and returns a quick shake of the head before elaborating."
    "Samuel从[他]的任务中回过神来，迅速摇了摇头，然后才详细解释。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:842
translate Chinese day14_docking_5f1171c0:

    # s "I'm sorry. Orders, [name]."
    s "抱歉。这是命令，[name]。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:844
translate Chinese day14_docking_76db137c:

    # "You understand—and don't want Samuel to go against them just for your sake—though it stings no less to hear it."
    "你明白——而且不想让Samuel为了你违背命令——尽管听到这个还是同样刺痛。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:846
translate Chinese day14_docking_d62f3b3a:

    # "It does look like hard work, but you've done worse already. You lean over to get a better vantage point to see the newcomer. He's a cheetah, dressed in light, flowing robes."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:852
translate Chinese day14_docking_4964bfe5:

    # "You join three other sailors on the right davit. Samuel directs you with [his] paws, keeping the two teams hauling at the same speed lest you tip the boat over."
    "你加入了右边吊艇架上的另外三名水手。Samuel用[他]的爪子指挥着你，让两队人以同样的速度拉拽，以防你们把小艇弄翻。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:853
translate Chinese day14_docking_f84c219b:

    # "It's hard work, but at least you're close enough to see the newcomer. He's a cheetah, dressed in light, flowing robes."
    "这活儿很累，但至少你离得够近，能看到新来的人。他是一只猎豹，穿着轻薄飘逸的长袍。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:854
translate Chinese day14_docking_c173a41e:

    # "You imagine he must not be a sailor. Even in a strange new land like Morocco, those kind of loose-fitting clothes are just asking to be caught up in a block or blown into his face under a stiff wind."
    "你猜想他肯定不是水手。即使在摩洛哥这样陌生新奇的地方，那种宽松的衣服也容易在滑轮上挂住，或者被强风吹到脸上。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:855
translate Chinese day14_docking_8b63767a:

    # "A simple merchant? A government official? Nobility, perhaps?"
    "一个普通的商人？政府官员？也许是贵族？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:856
translate Chinese day14_docking_82ff8fb5:

    # a "Mr. O'Connor!"
    a "O'Connor先生！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:863
translate Chinese day14_docking_77136a6b:

    # "Arthur steps aboard first after Julian has secured the falls and the jolly boat is stable. The maned wolf comes to attention. Reflexively, so do you. After all, what if the cheetah {i}is{/i} a Moroccan prince?"
    "在Julian固定好吊索、小艇也稳定下来后，Arthur第一个登上甲板。鬃狼立正站好。你也下意识地照做了。毕竟，万一那只猎豹{i}真是{/i}摩洛哥王子呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:865
translate Chinese day14_docking_7ead5f48:

    # "You don't want to leave a bad first impression in what will be your new temporary home."
    "你不想在这个即将成为你临时新家的地方留下糟糕的第一印象。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:868
translate Chinese day14_docking_80b4212e:

    # "Arthur steps aboard first after Wolf has secured the falls and the jolly boat is stable. The maned wolf comes to attention. Reflexively, so do you. After all, what if the cheetah {i}is{/i} a Moroccan prince?"
    "在Wolf固定好吊索、小艇也稳定下来后，Arthur第一个登上甲板。鬃狼立正站好。你也下意识地照做了。毕竟，万一那只猎豹{i}真是{/i}摩洛哥王子呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:870
translate Chinese day14_docking_7ead5f48_1:

    # "You don't want to leave a bad first impression in what will be your new temporary home."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:874
translate Chinese day14_docking_e89d1eac:

    # "Arthur steps aboard first after you've secured the falls and the jolly boat is stable. The maned wolf comes to attention. Reflexively, so do you. After all, what if the cheetah {i}is{/i} a Moroccan prince?"
    "在你固定好吊索、小艇也稳定下来后，Arthur第一个登上甲板。鬃狼立正站好。你也下意识地照做了。毕竟，万一那只猎豹{i}真是{/i}摩洛哥王子呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:875
translate Chinese day14_docking_491ca647:

    # s "Yes, sir?"
    s "是，长官？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:884
translate Chinese day14_docking_8006593d:

    # "His clothing presents no hindrance when the cheetah makes his graceful way over the gunwale. Arthur gestures towards him in introduction."
    "当猎豹的衣着并未妨碍他优雅地越过船舷。Arthur朝他做了个手势，介绍道。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:885
translate Chinese day14_docking_70b911b2:

    # a "Aryte Abu al-Barakat is our pilot. I've assured him we're in perfect health and don't need to be quarantined."
    a "阿里亚特·阿布·巴拉卡特是我们的引航员。我已经向他保证我们非常健康，不需要隔离。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:891
translate Chinese day14_docking_e6676ab3:

    # s "Well, that's true. Look at this one."
    s "嗯，这倒是真的。看看这个小子。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:892
translate Chinese day14_docking_f79c32ad:

    # "Arthur's expression, when Sam draws his attention to you, reminds you that you're standing at awkward attention, yourself, despite not having been addressed."
    "当Sam把注意力引向你时，Arthur的表情提醒了你，尽管没被点名，你自己也正尴尬地立正站着。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:893
translate Chinese day14_docking_d25cd126:

    # "You relax, also awkwardly, hoping you nonetheless convey the impression of a healthy young sailor."
    "你也尴尬地放松下来，希望自己仍然能给人留下一个健康年轻水手的印象。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:895
translate Chinese day14_docking_561cdb49:

    # a "...Quite."
    a "……确实。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:898
translate Chinese day14_docking_c0673760:

    # s "Quarantines around here? Are they expecting the plague? But... that's true, yes, we're all healthy here."
    s "这附近有隔离区域吗？他们在防备瘟疫吗？但是……没错，是的，我们这里的都很健康。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:899
translate Chinese day14_docking_bd274b0c:

    # a "Indeed."
    a "的确。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:904
translate Chinese day14_docking_743ded9d:

    # a "Now, that means we can weigh anchor and head for our berth at once. There is a complication."
    a "现在，这意味着我们可以起锚，立刻前往我们的泊位。不过有个情况比较复杂。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:905
translate Chinese day14_docking_836e4ff1:

    # s "Sir?"
    s "长官？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:906
translate Chinese day14_docking_429f065c:

    # a "Normally, we'd pass north of Mogador Island to enter the port. But Aryte believes we should sail around the island, and approach from the south."
    a "通常，我们会经过莫加多尔岛北侧进入港口。但Aryte认为我们应该绕岛航行，从南面接近。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:907
translate Chinese day14_docking_d4f2f11f:

    # aryte "The wind today. Not as good. Maybe tomorrow, but..."
    aryte "今天的风。不太好。也许明天吧，但是……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:908
translate Chinese day14_docking_710f3cd4:

    # a "But we've got cargo waiting to be loaded."
    a "但是我们有货物等着装船。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:909
translate Chinese day14_docking_0e97b87e:

    # aryte "And, as we say: time is golden."
    aryte "而且，正如我们常说的：时间就是金钱。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:910
translate Chinese day14_docking_c3b67e02:

    # a "The charts we acquired before leaving show the southern span to be rocky, and shallow enough to walk across at low tide."
    a "我们出发前获取的海图显示，南面海域礁石密布，而且退潮时浅得可以步行通过。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:911
translate Chinese day14_docking_a88737a0:

    # a "And I don't know about you, but in my calculations, a grounded ship is the largest pile of coins sinking to the depths of the ocean."
    a "我不知道你们怎么想，但按我的计算，搁浅的船就是沉入海底的最大金币堆。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:912
translate Chinese day14_docking_2ec9a429:

    # aryte "Need not fear it, sir."
    aryte "不必担心，长官。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:913
translate Chinese day14_docking_65555207:

    # aryte "Before, yes. But not now. Even for you."
    aryte "以前或许如此。但现在不会了。即使对您来说也一样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:914
translate Chinese day14_docking_270216ee:

    # aryte "You'll have one foot. Two perhaps."
    aryte "您会有一英尺的吃水。也许两英尺。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:915
translate Chinese day14_docking_2248fbb4:

    # a "Aryte tells us that the shoals have been dredged. The channel {i}is{/i} narrow. All the same, I'm convinced we can manage it."
    a "Aryte告诉我们，浅滩已经疏浚过了。航道{i}确实{/i}狭窄。尽管如此，我确信我们能应付。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:916
translate Chinese day14_docking_21c6d56b:

    # s "Yes, sir."
    s "是的，长官。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:917
translate Chinese day14_docking_38190915:

    # aryte "No doubt, Mr. Hudson. You trust your crew?"
    aryte "毫无疑问，哈德森先生。你信任你的船员吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:919
translate Chinese day14_docking_abda2b52:

    # "A confident smile spreads across Arthur's face."
    "Arthur脸上绽开一个自信的微笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:920
translate Chinese day14_docking_78119c0c:

    # a "They're the best I've had the pleasure of sharing the deck with."
    a "他们是我有幸同船共事过的最好的船员。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:921
translate Chinese day14_docking_806ea6eb:

    # aryte "Then is no problem. They get you in safely."
    aryte "那就没问题了。他们会把你们安全送进去的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:922
translate Chinese day14_docking_59c6b11a:

    # aryte "Keep steady. No rush. Pay attention."
    aryte "保持稳定。别着急。注意看。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:924
translate Chinese day14_docking_ec3978de:

    # a "You heard the man. I need you to move smartly, but I know I get nothing less from you, Mr. O'Connor."
    a "你们都听到了。我需要你们动作利索点，但我知道你们绝不会让我失望，O'Connor先生。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:925
translate Chinese day14_docking_6c4ae20a:

    # s "As if I was your right arm, sir."
    s "就像您的右臂一样可靠，长官。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:926
translate Chinese day14_docking_90aa98c0:

    # a "Good lad. Aryte: this way, please, to the helm."
    a "好小子。Aryte：请这边走，去舵轮那里。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:957
translate Chinese day14_docking_ab37abb7:

    # "Once he's gone, Samuel summons the crew around [him] with an expansive wave of [his] long arm."
    "他一离开，Samuel便挥动长臂，把船员们召集到身边。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:963
translate Chinese day14_docking_84595784:

    # s "Listen up! We're going to weigh anchor and round that fuckin' island there. That rocky, unfamiliar island. Do you follow me?"
    s "都听好了！我们要起锚绕过那座该死的岛。那座布满礁石、陌生的岛。都明白了吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:964
translate Chinese day14_docking_be802a58:

    # "Not a sound comes from the crowd, just a uniform nod."
    "人群中鸦雀无声，只有整齐划一的点头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:965
translate Chinese day14_docking_d9ede2ed:

    # s "Good. You'll do exactly as I say, exactly as I say it. I won't even threaten the lash."
    s "很好。你们要完全按我说的做，完全照我说的做。我甚至懒得用鞭刑威胁你们。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:971
translate Chinese day14_docking_cf84f4df:

    # "The maned wolf favors the sailors with a fanged grin."
    "鬃狼朝水手们咧开嘴，露出尖牙笑了笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:973
translate Chinese day14_docking_d80d2371:

    # "You feel the urge to ask again. You {i}want{/i} to help.{w}{i}Want{/i} to be part of it all and round the ship to its destination."
    "你再次感到体内涌出一股询问的冲动。你{i}想要{/i}帮忙。{w}{i}想要{/i}参与其中，让船顺利抵达目的地。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:975
translate Chinese day14_docking_524a8b4c:

    # "But once again, you're just brushed aside to be a mere observer."
    "但又一次，你被轻轻推到一边，仅仅成为一名旁观者。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:979
translate Chinese day14_docking_c7a864ac:

    # "The maned wolf favors you and the other sailors with a fanged grin."
    "鬃狼朝你和其他水手咧开嘴，露出尖牙笑了笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:980
translate Chinese day14_docking_a90c5dd4:

    # s "Because if you mess this up, and we ground, it's a long swim back.{w} And if it's you who caused the grounding, then you better be able to swim for two, as I sure as shit will make you drag me all the way."
    s "因为如果你们搞砸了，导致搁浅，那我们就得游很长一段路回去。{w}罪魁祸首最好能游两个人的份量，因为老子绝对会让你一路拖着我。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:981
translate Chinese day14_docking_9f0f622f:

    # s "Now, we're on a close reach and I expect Arthur will be wanting to keep most of the sails furled."
    s "现在，我们正迎风航行，我估计Arthur会想把大部分船帆都收起来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:982
translate Chinese day14_docking_ee472831:

    # s "So we're going to divide up and mind the ones we {i}are{/i} using. Stay focused."
    s "所以我们要分工，看好我们{i}正在{/i}用的那些帆。保持专注。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:985
translate Chinese day14_docking_964d0e7f:

    # s "Now then. Wolf, I want you to take the spanker. You and... ah, pick someone."
    s "那么。Wolf，我要你去管后桅纵帆。你和……啊，挑个人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:986
translate Chinese day14_docking_6c8ac2e4:

    # "Wolf's muzzle works wordlessly as he considers his options. Finally, with a light shake of his head, he points to Julian."
    "Wolf的嘴无声地动了动，权衡着选择。最终，他轻轻摇了摇头，指向Julian。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:995
translate Chinese day14_docking_c3bc6667:

    # w "Come on, then."
    w "那就来吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:996
translate Chinese day14_docking_0c6a7a93:

    # j "Me? You want {i}me{/i} to help {i}you{/i}?"
    j "我？你想让{i}我{/i}帮{i}你{/i}？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:998
translate Chinese day14_docking_6b18594c:

    # w "Don't make me regret my words."
    w "别让我后悔说了这话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1011
translate Chinese day14_docking_1d2012c3:

    # j "Aye, sir."
    j "是，长官。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1015
translate Chinese day14_docking_93084d4a:

    # "You follow the two to the stern and its only a minute or so before Samuel's voice carries back to you."
    "你跟着两人走向船尾，只过了一分钟左右，Samuel的声音就传了过来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1017
translate Chinese day14_docking_a19d36b5:

    # s "Wolf! Sheet in the spanker!"
    s "Wolf!！收紧后桅纵帆的帆脚索！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1018
translate Chinese day14_docking_5bae0d2b:

    # "Wolf takes the lead and Julian follows suit, taking hold of the rope and pulling it as taut as he can."
    "Wolf带头，Julian跟着照做，抓住绳索，用尽全力拉紧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1019
translate Chinese day14_docking_0531528a:

    # "You look up into the sail. The wind is stiffer than you'd expected, and it's noticeable fighting their efforts. Wolf stops to secure the rope to its cleat and Julian braces himself with all his might."
    "你抬头看向船帆。风比你预想的更猛，明显在与他们的努力抗衡。Wolf停下来把绳索系在系缆桩上，Julian则用尽全力稳住自己。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1020
translate Chinese day14_docking_989a0e5b:

    # "But it's still luffing."
    "但它还在飘动。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1021
translate Chinese day14_docking_312b004a_1:

    # p "Should I help?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1023
translate Chinese day14_docking_4309ad3a:

    # w "No."
    w "没有"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1025
translate Chinese day14_docking_44cc169a:

    # w "Ain't risking being reprimanded.{w} Julian! Now!"
    w "我可不想挨骂。{w}Julian！就现在！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1028
translate Chinese day14_docking_aca8e887:

    # j "No need."
    j "不必。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1030
translate Chinese day14_docking_c6b3f87b:

    # j "We got this.{w} Just a bit..."
    j "我们能搞定。{w}就差一点……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1032
translate Chinese day14_docking_52157858:

    # "You see his claws dig into the planks as he leans into the pull with his full weight again."
    "你看到他的爪子抠进木板，再次用全身的重量投入拉拽。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1035
translate Chinese day14_docking_7b60f631:

    # "Their effort finally pays off and the sail fills out nicely."
    "他们的努力终于得到回报，船帆漂亮地鼓满了风。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1036
translate Chinese day14_docking_3123dd05:

    # p "Looks like you'll be busy the entire way."
    p "看来这一路上你们都有得忙了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1037
translate Chinese day14_docking_3c7f4a0a:

    # "With her bow pointed against the wind, {i}Conway{/i}'s mainsails are useless. Her course relies on the fore-and-aft sails, and the skill of the crew steering her."
    "船首迎风时，{i}Conway{/i}的主帆毫无用处。她的航程依赖于纵帆，以及掌舵船员的技术。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1038
translate Chinese day14_docking_3fbda247:

    # j "It could be worse."
    j "情况可能更糟。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1039
translate Chinese day14_docking_6f158507:

    # p "Could it?"
    p "是吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1040
translate Chinese day14_docking_910690ee:

    # p "I'm certainly not envious of how you two will feel tomorrow."
    p "我一点也不羡慕你们俩明天会是什么感觉。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1044
translate Chinese day14_docking_1d8bae3a:

    # j "Well, for one, we're not rowing."
    j "嗯，至少我们不用划桨。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1045
translate Chinese day14_docking_78ec244f:

    # p "{i}You{/i} are not rowing. I doubt they would even let me touch an oar."
    p "{i}你{/i}是不用划桨。我怀疑他们甚至不会让我碰船桨。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1046
translate Chinese day14_docking_a18f5083:

    # p "So it's all the same to me."
    p "所以对我来说都一样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1050
translate Chinese day14_docking_e7f3dd60:

    # j "They just want to avoid a disgruntled sailor causing damage or endangering the crew."
    j "他们只是想避免心怀不满的水手造成破坏或危及船员。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1051
translate Chinese day14_docking_69af5678:

    # p "Which is ridiculous.{w} I don't hate you all just because of what happened, and the last thing I want is to put you in danger."
    p "这太可笑了。{w}我不会因为发生过的事就憎恨你们所有人，我最不想做的就是让你们陷入危险。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1052
translate Chinese day14_docking_128e4cde:

    # j "Well, but they don't know that."
    j "嗯，但他们不知道啊。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1053
translate Chinese day14_docking_6fdd1337:

    # "The {i}Conway{/i} makes its way south. The island of Mogador drifts inexorably off the ship's port side. There isn't much activity on it."
    "{i}Conway{/i}向南航行。莫加多尔岛在船的左舷侧不可阻挡地缓缓后退。岛上没什么动静。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1054
translate Chinese day14_docking_0b3be88d:

    # "Indeed, you're not sure it's inhabited at all. You can see the ruins of a few buildings, either deliberately dismantled or simply worn down by centuries of use and weather."
    "确实，你甚至不确定那里是否有人居住。你能看到几座建筑的废墟，要么是被人为拆除的，要么只是历经几个世纪的使用和风吹雨打而变得破败而已。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1055
translate Chinese day14_docking_43a68db4:

    # "You wonder how old your own village was. You'd never really thought about it before. It was timeless, in its own way, although none of the buildings had anything like the same kind of ancient, imposing character as these ruins."
    "你想知道自己的村庄有多古老。你以前从未真正想过这个问题。它自有一种永恒的意味，尽管村里的建筑没有一座像这些废墟一样具有那种古远而又威严的气质。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1056
translate Chinese day14_docking_474f836d:

    # "That kind of adventure is worth a bit of soreness."
    "那种冒险经历值得忍受一点酸痛。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1059
translate Chinese day14_docking_990fcd52:

    # "A flapping sound, steadily growing louder, summons your thoughts away from that conclusion. It's drawn Wolf's attention, too."
    "一阵拍打声正变得越来越响，将你的思绪从那念头上拽开。这也引起了Wolf的注意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1060
translate Chinese day14_docking_23447ce4:

    # w "It's luffing again. We need to adjust the sheet."
    w "它又飘动了。我们需要调整帆脚索。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1064
translate Chinese day14_docking_45306340:

    # p "You sound like a proper tar by now."
    p "你现在听起来像个十足的老水手了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1065
translate Chinese day14_docking_da67de94:

    # w "I've just been paying attention."
    w "我只是在用心观察。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1070
translate Chinese day14_docking_5f39ae85:

    # "The spanker is no longer filled out; the edges of the sail are beginning to flutter and snap. Julian steps over, takes a deep breath, and takes a hold of the sheet."
    "后桅纵帆不再鼓满风；帆的边缘开始飘动拍打。Julian走过去，深吸一口气，抓住了帆脚索。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1073
translate Chinese day14_docking_45ea52f3:

    # "Working together, the two hold the sail taut. Even just watching them, it's easy to see how grueling of a process it is as the ship slowly changes course."
    "两人协力拉紧船帆。即使只是旁观，也能轻易看出这活儿有多吃力——船正缓缓转向。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1074
translate Chinese day14_docking_0e645419:

    # j "I'd almost rather be rowing."
    j "我几乎想说自己宁可去划桨了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1075
translate Chinese day14_docking_b4cc129f:

    # w "No you wouldn't."
    w "不，你不会的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1076
translate Chinese day14_docking_167b483e:

    # j "You know me too well, I wouldn't."
    j "你太了解我了，我不会的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1079
translate Chinese day14_docking_9897b25f:

    # k "Hey!"
    k "嘿！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1084
translate Chinese day14_docking_b54a5d30:

    # "Konrad, who has been keeping an eye on the proceedings, is now making his way towards you."
    "Konrad——他一直在关注进展，现在正朝你走来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1085
translate Chinese day14_docking_75b715d5:

    # k "Get ready to haul in that sail."
    k "准备好收帆。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1086
translate Chinese day14_docking_fee8fe34:

    # w "Haul it, or sheet it out?"
    w "收帆，还是松帆？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1087
translate Chinese day14_docking_015e226c:

    # k "Brail it up. We're going to wear."
    k "用收帆索卷起来。我们要调转船头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1088
translate Chinese day14_docking_7dcf718e:

    # w "What?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1089
translate Chinese day14_docking_daf29348:

    # "A barked call from Samuel preempts any explanation."
    "Samuel一声厉喝，打断了任何解释。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1090
translate Chinese day14_docking_cb8e4505:

    # s "Wolf! You two, stand by to haul in the spanker!"
    s "Wolf!！你们两个，待命准备收起后桅纵帆！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1091
translate Chinese day14_docking_001dd11b:

    # w "Got it!"
    w "明白！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1092
translate Chinese day14_docking_8e608215:

    # "Wolf shouts back, although he doesn't seem to know what's going on any more than you do. A moment later, Arthur's voice rings out."
    "Wolf大声回应，尽管他似乎和你一样不太清楚状况。片刻之后，Arthur的声音响起。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1093
translate Chinese day14_docking_7a585915:

    # a "Helm, hard astarboard!"
    a "舵手，右满舵！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1094
translate Chinese day14_docking_02eedbdc:

    # s "Now, Wolf!"
    s "就是现在，Wolf!"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1096
translate Chinese day14_docking_aa654108:

    # "Konrad watches them haul away for a few seconds before the lynx grunts and joins in, grabbing hold of the stout rope himself. With three of them on the task, it goes relatively smoothly."
    "Konrad看着他们拉了几秒钟，然后猞猁咕哝了一声，也加入进来，抓住了粗壮的绳索。有三个人一起干，进展相对顺利。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1097
translate Chinese day14_docking_ebf98bfa:

    # sail "Hard over, aye, sir!"
    sail "满舵，明白，长官！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1098
translate Chinese day14_docking_b4e68204:

    # "By the time you hear that acknowledgment, the sail has mostly been furled."
    "当你听到这声确认时，船帆的大部分已经被收卷起来了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1100
translate Chinese day14_docking_9b1e6a14:

    # k "Make me take a bloody line, eh?"
    k "让我来拉这该死的绳子，嗯？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1101
translate Chinese day14_docking_9cf53c46:

    # j "You sort of volunteered."
    j "你差不多是自告奋勇的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1103
translate Chinese day14_docking_29737d58:

    # k "We're wearing ship. Crossin' the direction of the wind. Sail snaps from this way t'that way..."
    k "我们在调转船头。改变航向穿过风向。船帆会从这边猛地甩到那边……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1104
translate Chinese day14_docking_c0813dbd:

    # "He pantomimes that with a crisp flick of his paw."
    "他用爪子干脆利落地比划了一下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1105
translate Chinese day14_docking_e415c01e:

    # k "Wind like this? Well, they ain't gonna make me clean you off the deck, but Sam'd be right pissed if I bollocksed up his new landsmen..."
    k "而这种程度的风？倒不会让我把你从甲板上赶下去，但如果我把Sam的新水手弄惨了，他肯定会大发雷霆……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1106
translate Chinese day14_docking_28f91304:

    # k "And your thick skulls might put a hole in something. Then I'd be busy patchin' us up instead of enjoying Mogda... however the hell you say it again.{w} Morocco."
    k "就你们那几颗榆木脑袋，说不定会把哪儿撞个窟窿。到时候我就得忙着补船，没法享受莫加……那鬼地方叫啥来着？{w}摩洛哥。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1111
translate Chinese day14_docking_06bb6c3d:

    # "Sure enough, you can feel the wind change direction as the {i}Conway{/i} turns to port, rounding the island and coming about on a northerly tack."
    "果然，当{i}Conway{/i}向左舷转向，绕过岛屿并转为改向北航行时，你能感觉到风向改变了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1112
translate Chinese day14_docking_fbf3e56a:

    # s "Keep the spanker furled. Wolf, Julian—get yer arses forward. We might need you."
    s "后桅纵帆保持收卷状态。Wolf跟Julian滚到前面去，那儿可能会需要你们。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1125
translate Chinese day14_docking_2dba27dc:

    # "Konrad returns to his post while Julian and Wolf tie off the halyards, after which you make your way over to where the rest of the crew is working the staysails and jibs, albeit more calmly now that the turn is finished."
    "Konrad回到了他的岗位，而在Julian和Wolf系好升降索后，你也走向其他船员操作支索帆和前桅帆的地方，不过现在转向已完成，他们的动作更从容了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1128
translate Chinese day14_docking_964d0e7f_1:

    # s "Now then. Wolf, I want you to take the spanker. You and... ah, pick someone."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1129
translate Chinese day14_docking_f3431951:

    # "Wolf's muzzle works wordlessly as he considers his options. Finally, with a light shake of his head, he points to you."
    "Wolf的嘴无声地动了动，考虑着选择。最终，他轻轻摇了摇头，指向你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1133
translate Chinese day14_docking_c3bc6667_1:

    # w "Come on, then."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1134
translate Chinese day14_docking_c9614ac5:

    # "You allow yourself to feel at least a little bit of self-confidence returning."
    "你放任自己找回了一丝自信。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1135
translate Chinese day14_docking_a3cfe3d7:

    # p "Me? You want {i}me{/i} to help?"
    p "我？你想让{i}我{/i}帮忙？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1148
translate Chinese day14_docking_4acce569:

    # w "Someone who is worried about their past mistakes is someone who will be doing their best."
    w "一个为自己过去错误而担忧的人，会尽力做到最好。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1149
translate Chinese day14_docking_2df15507:

    # p "Well, I suppose that's still-"
    p "嗯，我想那还是——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1155
translate Chinese day14_docking_dd4a3ace:

    # w "To help.{w} Not for conversation."
    w "来帮忙。{w}你不是来聊天的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1156
translate Chinese day14_docking_369292be:

    # "You bite your tongue and follow Wolf to the stern. You're only there a minute or so before Samuel's voice carries back to the two of you."
    "你咬紧牙关，跟着Wolf走向船尾。你刚到那里大约一分钟，Samuel的声音就传到了你俩的耳中。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1158
translate Chinese day14_docking_a19d36b5_1:

    # s "Wolf! Sheet in the spanker!"
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1159
translate Chinese day14_docking_45e6f236:

    # "You follow Wolf's lead, taking hold of the rope and pulling it as taut as you can."
    "你学着Wolf的动作，抓住绳索并尽你所能将其拉紧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1160
translate Chinese day14_docking_8847693a:

    # "The wind is stiffer than you'd expected, fighting both of your best efforts. When Wolf stops to secure the rope to its cleat, you brace yourself with all your might."
    "风力比预想的更猛，抗衡着你们的全力。Wolf停下来将绳索系在系缆桩上时，你拼尽全力稳住自己。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1162
translate Chinese day14_docking_e77b2e66:

    # "But it's enough. The sail fills out nicely."
    "但这已经足够了——船帆顺利地鼓满了风。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1163
translate Chinese day14_docking_870fdcec:

    # p "It's going to be like this the whole way, isn't it?"
    p "这一路上都会是这样，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1164
translate Chinese day14_docking_3c7f4a0a_1:

    # "With her bow pointed against the wind, {i}Conway{/i}'s mainsails are useless. Her course relies on the fore-and-aft sails, and the skill of the crew steering her."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1165
translate Chinese day14_docking_c4697bc3:

    # w "It could be worse."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1166
translate Chinese day14_docking_b2ca1acb:

    # "As it is, you can almost feel tomorrow morning's ache in your muscles already."
    "事实上，你现在几乎就能感觉到明天早晨肌肉的酸痛了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1167
translate Chinese day14_docking_6f158507_1:

    # p "Could it?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1168
translate Chinese day14_docking_d8661ecd:

    # w "We're not rowing."
    w "我们不是在划船。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1169
translate Chinese day14_docking_6fdd1337_1:

    # "The {i}Conway{/i} makes its way south. The island of Mogador drifts inexorably off the ship's port side. There isn't much activity on it."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1170
translate Chinese day14_docking_0b3be88d_1:

    # "Indeed, you're not sure it's inhabited at all. You can see the ruins of a few buildings, either deliberately dismantled or simply worn down by centuries of use and weather."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1171
translate Chinese day14_docking_43a68db4_1:

    # "You wonder how old your own village was. You'd never really thought about it before. It was timeless, in its own way, although none of the buildings had anything like the same kind of ancient, imposing character as these ruins."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1172
translate Chinese day14_docking_474f836d_1:

    # "That kind of adventure is worth a bit of soreness."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1175
translate Chinese day14_docking_990fcd52_1:

    # "A flapping sound, steadily growing louder, summons your thoughts away from that conclusion. It's drawn Wolf's attention, too."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1176
translate Chinese day14_docking_dbde3bae:

    # w "It's luffing. We need to adjust the sheet."
    w "它在飘动。我们需要调整帆脚索。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1178
translate Chinese day14_docking_45306340_1:

    # p "You sound like a proper tar by now."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1179
translate Chinese day14_docking_da67de94_1:

    # w "I've just been paying attention."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1180
translate Chinese day14_docking_81f531a9:

    # "The spanker is no longer filled out; the edges of the sail are beginning to flutter and snap. You take a deep breath, steel yourself, and take hold of the sheet."
    "后桅纵帆不再饱满；帆缘开始扑动翻卷。你深吸一口气，稳住心神，握紧了了帆脚索。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1182
translate Chinese day14_docking_942462d0:

    # "Working together, the two of you hold the sail taut: a grueling, continuous process as the ship's course changes."
    "你们俩合力将帆拉紧：随着船改变航向，这是一场艰苦且持续的角力。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1183
translate Chinese day14_docking_dfc4967e:

    # "Wolf catches your eye, and your gritted teeth. His expression, too, is tense with exertion."
    "Wolf注意到你的眼神，还有你紧咬的牙关。他的表情也因用力而紧绷。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1184
translate Chinese day14_docking_b61cbac2:

    # p "I'd almost rather be rowing."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1185
translate Chinese day14_docking_b4cc129f_1:

    # w "No you wouldn't."
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1188
translate Chinese day14_docking_9897b25f_1:

    # k "Hey!"
    k ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1191
translate Chinese day14_docking_b54a5d30_1:

    # "Konrad, who has been keeping an eye on the proceedings, is now making his way towards you."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1192
translate Chinese day14_docking_75b715d5_1:

    # k "Get ready to haul in that sail."
    k ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1193
translate Chinese day14_docking_fee8fe34_1:

    # w "Haul it, or sheet it out?"
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1194
translate Chinese day14_docking_015e226c_1:

    # k "Brail it up. We're going to wear."
    k ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1195
translate Chinese day14_docking_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1196
translate Chinese day14_docking_daf29348_1:

    # "A barked call from Samuel preempts any explanation."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1197
translate Chinese day14_docking_cb8e4505_1:

    # s "Wolf! You two, stand by to haul in the spanker!"
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1198
translate Chinese day14_docking_001dd11b_1:

    # w "Got it!"
    w ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1199
translate Chinese day14_docking_8e608215_1:

    # "Wolf shouts back, although he doesn't seem to know what's going on any more than you do. A moment later, Arthur's voice rings out."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1200
translate Chinese day14_docking_7a585915_1:

    # a "Helm, hard astarboard!"
    a ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1201
translate Chinese day14_docking_02eedbdc_1:

    # s "Now, Wolf!"
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1203
translate Chinese day14_docking_6e40fb8f:

    # "Konrad watches you haul away for a few seconds before the lynx grunts and joins in, grabbing hold of the stout rope himself. With three of you on the task, it goes relatively smoothly."
    "Konrad这只猞猁看着你们拉了没几秒，就咕哝了一声也加入了进来，抓住了那根粗绳索。有你们三个人一起，事情进行得相对顺利了些。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1204
translate Chinese day14_docking_ebf98bfa_1:

    # sail "Hard over, aye, sir!"
    sail ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1205
translate Chinese day14_docking_2fa8eb02:

    # "By the time you hear that acknowledgment, you have the sail mostly furled."
    "当你们听到那声确认时，你们已经差不多把帆卷好了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1207
translate Chinese day14_docking_9b1e6a14_1:

    # k "Make me take a bloody line, eh?"
    k ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1208
translate Chinese day14_docking_438fc3a7:

    # p "You sort of volunteered."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1210
translate Chinese day14_docking_29737d58_1:

    # k "We're wearing ship. Crossin' the direction of the wind. Sail snaps from this way t'that way..."
    k ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1211
translate Chinese day14_docking_c0813dbd_1:

    # "He pantomimes that with a crisp flick of his paw."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1212
translate Chinese day14_docking_e415c01e_1:

    # k "Wind like this? Well, they ain't gonna make me clean you off the deck, but Sam'd be right pissed if I bollocksed up his new landsmen..."
    k ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1213
translate Chinese day14_docking_28f91304_1:

    # k "And your thick skulls might put a hole in something. Then I'd be busy patchin' us up instead of enjoying Mogda... however the hell you say it again.{w} Morocco."
    k ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1218
translate Chinese day14_docking_06bb6c3d_1:

    # "Sure enough, you can feel the wind change direction as the {i}Conway{/i} turns to port, rounding the island and coming about on a northerly tack."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1219
translate Chinese day14_docking_1b0d8a0f:

    # s "Keep the spanker furled. Wolf, [name]—get yer arses forward. We might need you."
    s "保持后桅帆收卷。Wolf，[name]滚到前面去，那儿可能会需要你们。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1230
translate Chinese day14_docking_b6cd94d7:

    # "Konrad returns to his post while you and Wolf tie off the halyards and make your way over to where the rest of the crew is working the staysails and jibs, albeit more calmly now that the turn is finished."
    "Konrad回到了他的岗位，而在Julian和你系好升降索后，你也走向其他船员操作支索帆和前桅帆的地方，不过现在转向已完成，他们的动作更从容了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1233
translate Chinese day14_docking_0722139c:

    # s "Wolf, I want you to take the spanker. You and... ah, grab someone who looks stocky. [name] and Julian, get forward. We'll need men on the jibs."
    s "Wolf，我要你负责后桅帆。你和……呃，找个看起来结实的家伙。[name]和Julian到前面去。我们需要人手操作前桅帆。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1234
translate Chinese day14_docking_5d5dac8b:

    # p "Aye."
    p "没错"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1240
translate Chinese day14_docking_668d1c77:

    # "There are a dozen sailors already manning the lines. At your approach, one of them lets go of his, indicating for the two of you to take over while he finds a different sail to mind."
    "已经有十几个水手在操控绳索了。你们走近时，其中一个水手放开了他手里的绳索，示意你们俩接手，而他则找到了另一面帆照看。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1241
translate Chinese day14_docking_503815e8:

    # j "This should be fun."
    j "这应该会很有趣。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1242
translate Chinese day14_docking_43cc34db:

    # p "Really?"
    p "认真的？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1251
translate Chinese day14_docking_6e4f7575:

    # j "Sam said we're on a close reach. You can feel it, right?"
    j "Sam说咱们现在是抢风航行。你能感觉到对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1252
translate Chinese day14_docking_93be50a0:

    # p "No?"
    p "没有？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1253
translate Chinese day14_docking_fbf0bcf8:

    # j "The wind. We're mostly sailing into it, so the mainsails aren't worth a damn. It's all the work of the fore-and-aft sails. Gotta keep them nice and trimmed."
    j "这风。我们基本上是在迎风航行，所以主帆屁用没有。全靠这些纵帆了。我们得让它们保持良好状态并调整好。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1254
translate Chinese day14_docking_cac0bdd6:

    # p "So... 'fun,' or a lot of work?"
    p "所以……是“有趣”，还是有很多活儿？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1258
translate Chinese day14_docking_86af09da:

    # j "Well, it's fun on a smaller ship."
    j "嗯，船要是笑点就会很有趣。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1259
translate Chinese day14_docking_ff90ae9f:

    # "As he talks, he slips the line off its cleat, and you help the lizard pull the line taut. When he's satisfied, he ties it off again."
    "他一边说着，一边把绳索从系索栓上解下，你帮助这个蜥蜴把绳索拉紧。他满意后，再次将其系好。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1260
translate Chinese day14_docking_52ae49a0:

    # j "On a ship like this, at least it's something to do. Arthur must really trust Samuel, though. And his pilot. Honestly, I was expecting us to row in."
    j "在这种船上，这好歹算是点活。不过，Arthur一定非常信任Samuel。还有他的领航员。说实话，我本以为我们要划进去呢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1264
translate Chinese day14_docking_8b66f36e:

    # p "I'll take it. I'd rather not try to row a ship this size."
    p "我乐意这样。我可不想划这么大条船。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1265
translate Chinese day14_docking_750f5cb1:

    # j "Not the {i}Conway{/i}. You get some men in the boats and have them tow us in. I've seen that done plenty. Or you tell 'em to row out so they can secure the kedge anchor and pull yourself in that way. Or- "
    j ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1266
translate Chinese day14_docking_0064b745:

    # sail "{alpha=0.5}Do you ever shut up?{/alpha}"
    sail "{alpha=0.5}你有过闭嘴的时候吗？{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1267
translate Chinese day14_docking_309ab05e:

    # p "He doesn't. Not really."
    p "他没有。真的没有。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1271
translate Chinese day14_docking_c4ad6a44:

    # "Julian gives the sailor a wink, and a grin that the other man pointedly fails to return."
    "Julian朝那水手眨了眨眼，咧嘴一笑，而对方则刻意地没有回应这个笑容。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1275
translate Chinese day14_docking_eb45dc02:

    # j "{i}Anyway{/i}, it's always a lot of work. So: this is better than that, right? The jib's luffing. Let's sheet it in again."
    j "{i}总之{/i}，总是有很多活儿干。所以：这样比我说的那样好，是吧？前桅帆在飘动。我们再来收紧帆脚索吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1277
translate Chinese day14_docking_7364e32e:

    # "As the ship's course changes, the wind has stopped filling the jib sail; the edges are fluttering and cracking stiffly. You help Julian tighten the sheet until the flapping stops."
    "随着船的航向改变，风不再吹满前桅帆；帆的边缘僵硬地飘动并噼啪作响。你帮助Julian收紧帆脚索，直到飘动停止。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1278
translate Chinese day14_docking_41c5d3dd:

    # p "Look at that..."
    p "看那边……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1279
translate Chinese day14_docking_f20e3de6:

    # "The island of Mogador drifts past off the ship's port side. It seems uninhabited, or mostly so, but rubble marks the remains of some old structures—a fortress, maybe?—ravaged by what must be centuries of weather."
    "莫加多尔岛从船的左舷侧缓缓滑过。它似乎无人居住，或者大部分地区是如此，但废墟标志着一些古老建筑的遗迹——也许那是一座堡垒？——想必是被几个世纪的风雨摧毁了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1280
translate Chinese day14_docking_9ea464c9:

    # p "I wonder how old that is. The oldest building in my village must be... the church, I guess. Nothing like that."
    p "我在想那有多古老。我村子里最古老的建筑一定是……教堂吧。没有像那栋那样古老的建筑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1281
translate Chinese day14_docking_d3ec5541:

    # sail "{alpha=0.5}Do {i}you{/i} ever shut up? Good God.{/alpha}"
    sail "{alpha=0.5}{i}你{/i}有过闭嘴的时候吗？老天爷啊。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1282
translate Chinese day14_docking_1dd4185e:

    # j "No."
    j ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1283
translate Chinese day14_docking_0685e846:

    # p "It's my first time seeing a new country. First time leaving home."
    p "这是我第一次见到一个新的国家。是我第一次离开家。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1284
translate Chinese day14_docking_ba143cc7:

    # sail "{alpha=0.5}Never would've guessed.{/alpha}"
    sail "{alpha=0.5}真是一点都看不出来呢。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1286
translate Chinese day14_docking_705bda2b:

    # j "If I remember correctly then the Portuguese used to control the island. I think that's what that fort is. Was. It wasn't the king's doing."
    j "如果我没记错的话，葡萄牙人过去控制着这个岛。我想那就是那个堡垒的故事——应该说曾经是。那不是国王做的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1287
translate Chinese day14_docking_7ad80a51:

    # j "Read about it in a book that I managed to find in my father's library. Wanted to know what I'm getting into."
    j "这是我在父亲书房里找到的一本书上读到的——我那时想知道自己将要面对什么。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1289
translate Chinese day14_docking_846573d6:

    # "The sense of history is awe-inspiring. Despite the sailor's skepticism, there's something almost overwhelming about seeing the island, and the cliffs, and the hint of the city beyond."
    "历史的厚重感令人敬畏。尽管那名水手持怀疑态度，但看到岛屿、悬崖和远处城市的隐约轮廓，仍有一种难以言喻的震撼。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1290
translate Chinese day14_docking_f3b81462:

    # "You've made it. Soon enough, you'll be setting foot in foreign lands. Has any [family_name] ever been to Morocco? You very much doubt it. Just a little bit longer now."
    "你做到了。很快，你就要踏上异国的土地了。[family_name]家族有人来过摩洛哥吗？你非常怀疑这一点。而现在，只需要再坚持一小会儿了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1291
translate Chinese day14_docking_7a585915_2:

    # a "Helm, hard astarboard!"
    a ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1293
translate Chinese day14_docking_ebf98bfa_2:

    # sail "Hard over, aye, sir!"
    sail ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1294
translate Chinese day14_docking_dc57e48c:

    # "Well before the acknowledgment, the {i}Conway{/i} is already beginning to change course, the bowsprit tracing a steady leftward turn. Julian starts to unfasten the rope from its cleat."
    "在那声“确认”之前很久，{i}Conway{/i}就已经开始改变航向，船首斜桅划出一个稳定的左转弧线。Julian开始将绳索从系索栓上解开。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1295
translate Chinese day14_docking_220aedea:

    # j "Get ready to ease off on the sheet."
    j "准备好松开帆脚索。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1297
translate Chinese day14_docking_918f9ddd:

    # p "Yeah?"
    p "怎么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1302
translate Chinese day14_docking_39d80cd8:

    # j "It's called 'wearing.' We're going to turn across the wind, so the sail's going to move. We'll need to adjust it."
    j "这叫“顺风转向”。咱们要横穿风向，船帆会跟着动，我们得随时调整。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1303
translate Chinese day14_docking_282ef3df:

    # p "Alright."
    p "好吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1312
translate Chinese day14_docking_0c52971a:

    # "The other sailors are doing the same, taking their cues from the edges of the sails. Sure enough, you can feel the wind change direction as the {i}Conway{/i} completes its port turn, coming about on its northerly course."
    "其他水手也在做同样的事，根据帆的边缘变化采取行动。果然，当{i}Conway{/i}完成左舷转向，转为向北航向时，你能感觉到风向改变了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1314
translate Chinese day14_docking_61e3d7b1:

    # "Mogador, the city, lies directly ahead. The wind has the ship's sails filled out, although now that you're in the lee of the island it's a gentler, steady breeze."
    "摩加多尔城就在正前方。此刻船帆饱满，但因驶入岛屿背风处，风力已转为轻柔而平稳的微风。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1315
translate Chinese day14_docking_32fc4cda:

    # "The lee side of the islands is studded with ramparts, complete with what you're certain must be cannons. There are no soldiers, but it only adds to the exciting feeling that you're truly entering someplace new and different."
    "岛屿的背风面布满了防御墙，上面肯定还有大炮。虽没有士兵，但这只增添了你真正进入这一新奇之地的兴奋感。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1316
translate Chinese day14_docking_99e2c946:

    # "Your fellow crew seem to think so, too. There's a buzz of anticipation—their attention torn between the lines and taking in the activity of a bustling harbor town."
    "你的船员同伴们似乎也这么想。一股蕴含期待的低语声弥漫开来——他们的注意力在缆绳与热闹港镇之间来回游移。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1317
translate Chinese day14_docking_3f475e40:

    # pb "Bit fast. Must be five or six knots, now."
    pb "船速有点快了，现在得有五六节了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1319
translate Chinese day14_docking_c1a3d6d6:

    # "Perce, who must've been manning one of the staysails, mutters, looking over the side at the water running past. He raises his voice:"
    "Perce——想必刚在操纵某面支索帆——瞥着舷边流逝的海水咕哝道。他提高嗓门："

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1321
translate Chinese day14_docking_2e620297:

    # "Perce Blackborow, manning one of the jibs, is now looking forward, scowling faintly. He raises his voice:"
    "操作一面前桅帆的Perce Blackborow，现在正向前望着，微微皱着眉头。他提高了音量："

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1322
translate Chinese day14_docking_9cc4ac1f:

    # pb "You plannin' to beach her, Sam?"
    pb "你打算让她搁浅吗，Sam？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1326
translate Chinese day14_docking_9e2285a3:

    # s "We're fine, Perce."
    s "不会有事的，Perce。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1327
translate Chinese day14_docking_ddf1ffd0:

    # pb "Get ready to reef the stays."
    pb "准备好缩帆。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1331
translate Chinese day14_docking_44dc66fd:

    # s "Belay that, now. 'Til Mr. Hudson says otherwise."
    s "现在，停下。直到Hudson先生有新的指示。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1332
translate Chinese day14_docking_863c2bf6:

    # "The jackal glowers, staring pointedly at the water as if he can already sense an impending catastrophe. All you hear from Arthur is a few corrections to the helm, keeping you in the shipping channel."
    "豺狼怒目而视，刻意地盯着海水，仿佛他已察觉到一场灾难迫在眉睫。你从Arthur那里听到的只有几句对舵轮的修正指令，让船保持在航道中。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1334
translate Chinese day14_docking_3c164f31:

    # "The order to haul in the sails comes as you leave the lee of the island and the {i}Conway{/i} turns back into the wind. The ship loses speed remarkably quickly, at that point, coasting towards an open space that must be the berth you've been assigned."
    "当你们离开岛屿的背风面，{i}Conway{/i}重新转向迎风时，收帆的命令传来。此时，船的速度明显迅速降低，滑向一片空旷的水域，那一定是指派给你们的泊位。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1336
translate Chinese day14_docking_6f0834d6:

    # s "Now, then. Who's got good aim?"
    s "那么，现在。谁瞄得准？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1347
translate Chinese day14_docking_cd1e3395:

    # j "What, Sam, like you don't?"
    j "搞什么，Sam，说的好像你瞄得不准似的？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1352
translate Chinese day14_docking_c870cdeb:

    # w "Not going to let us see you do it?"
    w "不打算让我们看你露一手？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1355
translate Chinese day14_docking_9e8c9dcd:

    # s "Just want to give someone else a try."
    s "只是想给别人一个机会试试。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1357
translate Chinese day14_docking_c9642479:

    # s "Besides, my arm's tired."
    s "再说了，我胳膊累了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1372
translate Chinese day14_docking_b6014e42:

    # "Julian rolls his eyes, but when the maned wolf hands him a lump of metal he takes it without further protest. As the {i}Conway{/i}'s forward movement slows, Sam leans forward with anticipation."
    "Julian翻了个白眼，但当鬃狼递给他一块金属疙瘩时，他没有再抗议就接了过去。随着{i}Conway{/i}的前进速度减慢，Sam满怀期待地探身向前。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1379
translate Chinese day14_docking_e1a32eed:

    # "Wolf takes the lump of metal that Samuel hands him without protest. As the {i}Conway{/i}'s forward movement slows, Sam leans forward with anticipation."
    "Wolf没有抗议，接过了Samuel递给他的那块金属疙瘩。随着{i}Conway{/i}的前进速度减慢，Sam满怀期待地探身向前。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1381
translate Chinese day14_docking_02ba7578:

    # s "Now. Give you a shilling if you hit one of them boys is waiting on the pier."
    s "现在。你要是能砸中码头上等着的哪个小子，我给你一先令。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1386
translate Chinese day14_docking_8e1e1c48:

    # j "You better keep that promise."
    j "你最好说话算话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1388
translate Chinese day14_docking_acc4b149:

    # s "Have I ever disappointed you like that?"
    s "我什么时候让你失望过？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1392
translate Chinese day14_docking_39256bf2:

    # j "How much time do we have? I'll start counting."
    j "我们有多少时间？我要开始数了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1396
translate Chinese day14_docking_a21cbcd0:

    # j "Just kidding. Now, watch and learn."
    j "开玩笑的。现在，看好了学着点。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1398
translate Chinese day14_docking_c0c24597:

    # "The lizard tosses the projectile, and you see that it's been tied to a length of lightweight hemp rope. It comes remarkably close to one of the men on the dock, but he steps back at the last moment."
    "蜥蜴扔出了那个抛射物，你这才看清它系着一段轻质麻绳。球几乎要砸中码头上一个男人，他却在最后一刻后退了一步。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1402
translate Chinese day14_docking_91f79fbf:

    # j "Hey!..."
    j "嘿！……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1404
translate Chinese day14_docking_2efae53c:

    # j "Dodging?!...{w} you're in cahoots with them aren't you, Sam?!{w} Denying me my riches. Ah, well. It's made fast. Ready?"
    j "躲开了？！……{w}你跟他们是串通好的吧，Sam？！{w}不让我发财。唉，好吧。系牢了。准备好了吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1410
translate Chinese day14_docking_c3b133e1:

    # w "Just aim for the head?"
    w "瞄准脑袋就行？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1412
translate Chinese day14_docking_327a50ea:

    # s "Sure."
    s "当然"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1414
translate Chinese day14_docking_96719c10:

    # w "I'll hold you to it."
    w "我可记着你的话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1415
translate Chinese day14_docking_002ecfda:

    # "Wolf tosses the projectile, and you see that it's been tied to a length of lightweight hemp rope. It comes remarkably close to one of the men on the dock, but he steps back at the last moment."
    "Wolf扔出了那个抛射物，你这才看清它系着一段轻质麻绳。球几乎要砸中码头上一个男人，他却在最后一刻后退了一步。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1419
translate Chinese day14_docking_917fd1f8:

    # "He simply breathes out a sharp exhale to manifest his disappointment."
    "他只是重重地呼出一口气，以表达他的失望。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1421
translate Chinese day14_docking_5cd8c7a2:

    # w "There goes my drinking money."
    w "我的酒钱没了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1423
translate Chinese day14_docking_2fa4e44b:

    # s "Next time."
    s "下次吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1426
translate Chinese day14_docking_0a53a4e5:

    # "Another sailor steps forward, hooking a stouter rope onto the line and letting gravity carry it to the pier. When that rope is secured, too, Sam looks over to the capstan."
    "另一名水手走上前，将一根更粗的绳索钩在细绳上，让重力将其带到码头。当那根绳索也固定好后，Sam看向了绞盘。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1432
translate Chinese day14_docking_fff3a362:

    # s "Good, then. Haul away! You too, Jules."
    s "很好，那么。开始拉！你也来，Jules。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1437
translate Chinese day14_docking_7d31a81c:

    # s "Good, then. Haul away! You too, Wolf."
    s "很好，那么。开始拉！你也来，Wolf。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1441
translate Chinese day14_docking_d4abb9e9:

    # "Once the slack is taken up, it requires the effort of every sailor who can man the bars... but the capstan turns, slowly winding the rope back onto its drum."
    "一旦松弛的部分被收紧，就需要每个能操作绞盘杆的水手一起用力……但绞盘转动了，慢慢地将绳索卷回卷筒。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1442
translate Chinese day14_docking_c40445dc:

    # "{i}Very{/i} slowly."
    "{i}非常{/i}慢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1443
translate Chinese day14_docking_9e2fbf96:

    # s "Ease off, ease off..."
    s "松一松，松一松……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1444
translate Chinese day14_docking_382e5244:

    # "A moment later, Arthur shouts the same thing."
    "片刻之后，Arthur也喊出了同样的话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1445
translate Chinese day14_docking_25db8929:

    # a "Ease off, Samuel!"
    a "松一松，Samuel!"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1447
translate Chinese day14_docking_05f85def:

    # s "See?"
    s "看到了吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1448
translate Chinese day14_docking_b5cb1a3e:

    # "Five seconds of silence follow, and then ten."
    "随之而来的是五秒钟的沉默，然后是十秒。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1449
translate Chinese day14_docking_90b5d9da:

    # "And then, you feel a gentle thump. Sam perks [his] ears, leaning up and looking over the side of the ship."
    "接着，你感到一下轻微的撞击。Sam竖起[他的]耳朵，探身望向船舷外。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1451
translate Chinese day14_docking_bdf97f8a:

    # s "Well. Not bad at all, now. I knew some of ya were sailors."
    s "嗯。不赖嘛。我就知道你们有些人当过水手。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1453
translate Chinese day14_docking_4ba8133b:

    # "[He] shoots Perce a look, which the jackal returns frostily."
    "[他]瞥了Perce一眼，Perce冷冷地回瞪了他一眼。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1454
translate Chinese day14_docking_6f3bdef6:

    # s "Didn't beach her at all, so I didn't."
    s "根本没让她搁浅，所以我没有。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1458
translate Chinese day14_docking_e21b8510:

    # s "{cps=5000}Now, then. Who's got good aim?{/cps}" nointeract
    s "{cps=5000}那么，现在。谁瞄得准？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1461
translate Chinese day14_docking_6d58a63a:

    # "You're not sure what [he]'s got in mind, but Samuel has the respect of the officers, and you'd like to earn [his] respect in turn."
    "你不确定[他]有何打算，但Samuel深得长官们敬重，而你也渴望赢得[他]的认可。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1462
translate Chinese day14_docking_3ced1e09:

    # p "I might. I think I do."
    p "也许我可以。我想我能行。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1465
translate Chinese day14_docking_16e9e18d:

    # s "Is that so, then?"
    s "是这样吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1466
translate Chinese day14_docking_8c2f1719:

    # s "I appreciate the enthusiasm. Still gunning to make a good impression, eh?"
    s "我欣赏你的热情。还在努力想留下好印象，是吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1469
translate Chinese day14_docking_68bd8e0a:

    # "Grinning, [he] picks something off the deck and hands it to you. It's solid, and fairly hefty—a lump of bronze, perhaps, or maybe even lead."
    "[他]咧嘴一笑，从甲板上捡起一样东西递给你。那东西硬邦邦的，分量相当重——可能是一块青铜，甚至可能是铅块。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1470
translate Chinese day14_docking_756bb5b4:

    # s "You see them boys is waiting on the pier?"
    s "你看见码头上那些在等着的家伙了吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1471
translate Chinese day14_docking_061e5381:

    # p "Yes?"
    p "怎么了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1473
translate Chinese day14_docking_5c23f4fb:

    # s "When I tell you: hit the closest one, like."
    s "等我下令后，你就砸最近的那个。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1474
translate Chinese day14_docking_cc530cbb:

    # p "What? This is pretty heavy..."
    p "什么？这东西挺重的……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1475
translate Chinese day14_docking_5eab33de:

    # s "'Tis."
    s "没错。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1476
translate Chinese day14_docking_c5f6ee0f:

    # p "You want me to hit him?"
    p "你想让我砸他？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1484
translate Chinese day14_docking_89bbc221:

    # s "Sure. Miss, and ya gotta swim."
    s "当然。要是没砸中，你就得下去游泳。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1485
translate Chinese day14_docking_295c8910:

    # "The {i}Conway{/i} is nearly stopped, by now, and Samuel appears to be gauging the distance carefully. [He] opens [his] muzzle, holding up a paw and counting down slowly."
    "此刻，{i}Conway{/i}几乎停稳了，Samuel似乎在仔细估计距离。[他]张开嘴，举起一只爪子，慢慢地倒数。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1487
translate Chinese day14_docking_f1116fe4:

    # s "Do it."
    s "砸。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1488
translate Chinese day14_docking_e8201639:

    # "You wind up, take aim as best you can, and throw."
    "你抡起胳膊，尽力瞄准，然后把东西扔了出去。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1490
translate Chinese day14_docking_66d6c9fd:

    # "As the projectile arcs outward, you realize [he]'s fixed a length of lightweight hemp rope to it."
    "当投掷物在空中划出弧线时，你发现他在上面系了一截轻质的麻绳。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1491
translate Chinese day14_docking_40115299:

    # "For a brief, panicked moment you worry that you {i}might{/i} actually hit the man, but he steps back, and it lands heavily at his paws."
    "有那么一瞬间，你担心自己{i}可能{/i}真会砸中那个人，但他后退了一步，投掷物重重地落在了他的脚边。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1499
translate Chinese day14_docking_8f2b53e4:

    # sailmullein "What, Sam, like you don't?"
    sailmullein ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1505
translate Chinese day14_docking_9e8c9dcd_1:

    # s "Just want to give someone else a try."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1506
translate Chinese day14_docking_c9642479_1:

    # s "Besides, my arm's tired."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1519
translate Chinese day14_docking_40419070:

    # "The sailor rolls his eyes, but when the maned wolf hands him a lump of metal he takes it without further protest. As the {i}Conway{/i}'s forward movement slows, Sam leans forward with anticipation."
    "那名水手翻了翻白眼，但当鬃狼递给他一块金属时，他没再抗议就接了过去。随着{i}Conway{/i}向前移动的速度减缓，Sam满怀期待地向前探身。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1520
translate Chinese day14_docking_02ba7578_1:

    # s "Now. Give you a shilling if you hit one of them boys is waiting on the pier."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1524
translate Chinese day14_docking_9e7b7d8a:

    # "The sailor tosses the projectile, and you see that it's been tied to a length of lightweight hemp rope. It comes remarkably close to one of the men on the dock, but he steps back at the last moment."
    "水手扔出了投掷物，你看到它被系在一截轻质麻绳上。它离码头上其中一个人出奇地近，但对方在最后一刻后退了一步。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1528
translate Chinese day14_docking_70e9e638:

    # sailmullein "He dodged! Not very sporting, eh?{w} Ah, well. It's made fast. Ready?"
    sailmullein "他怎么躲开了！不太讲武德啊。{w} 唉，好吧。绳子已经系牢了。准备好了吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1529
translate Chinese day14_docking_0a53a4e5_1:

    # "Another sailor steps forward, hooking a stouter rope onto the line and letting gravity carry it to the pier. When that rope is secured, too, Sam looks over to the capstan."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1534
translate Chinese day14_docking_4a9272de:

    # s "Good, then. Haul away! You too, [name]."
    s "很好，那么。用力拉！你也来，[name]。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1538
translate Chinese day14_docking_d4abb9e9_1:

    # "Once the slack is taken up, it requires the effort of every sailor who can man the bars... but the capstan turns, slowly winding the rope back onto its drum."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1539
translate Chinese day14_docking_fcac0a4b:

    # "{i}Very{/i} slowly. Your paws fight for purchase on the deck."
    "你拉得{i}非常{/i}慢，用爪子用力抵住甲板以保持身形稳定。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1540
translate Chinese day14_docking_9e2fbf96_1:

    # s "Ease off, ease off..."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1542
translate Chinese day14_docking_382e5244_1:

    # "A moment later, Arthur shouts the same thing."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1543
translate Chinese day14_docking_25db8929_1:

    # a "Ease off, Samuel!"
    a ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1545
translate Chinese day14_docking_05f85def_1:

    # s "See?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1546
translate Chinese day14_docking_b5cb1a3e_1:

    # "Five seconds of silence follow, and then ten."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1547
translate Chinese day14_docking_90b5d9da_1:

    # "And then, you feel a gentle thump. Sam perks [his] ears, leaning up and looking over the side of the ship."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1549
translate Chinese day14_docking_bdf97f8a_1:

    # s "Well. Not bad at all, now. I knew some of ya were sailors."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1551
translate Chinese day14_docking_4ba8133b_1:

    # "[He] shoots Perce a look, which the jackal returns frostily."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1552
translate Chinese day14_docking_6f3bdef6_1:

    # s "Didn't beach her at all, so I didn't."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1556
translate Chinese day14_docking_69109550:

    # "Other lines are now being tossed overboard for the men on the docks to make fast. You step back, and take a deep breath."
    "其他缆绳现在也被抛下船，让码头上的工人们系牢。你后退一步，深吸了一口气。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1558
translate Chinese day14_docking_a327978e:

    # "Mogador."
    "摩加多尔。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1560
translate Chinese day14_docking_555c86ac:

    # "You're really feeling grain after inevitable grain of sand running through the hourglass now."
    "你现在真切地感觉到，沙漏里的沙粒正一粒接一粒、无可避免地流逝。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1562
translate Chinese day14_docking_b2b63d59:

    # "Will they dismiss you from the ship immediately?"
    "他们会立刻把你赶下船吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1564
translate Chinese day14_docking_68e50562:

    # "Or perhaps they just expect you to take that step and leave on your own. An opportunity to save a sailor's pride perhaps?"
    "或许他们只是期望你自己迈出那一步，主动离开。这也许是给一个水手保留尊严的机会？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1566
translate Chinese day14_docking_e86e42f9:

    # "No matter how, at the very least it'll happen in a spectacular looking place."
    "无论如何，至少这会发生在这个风光绝伦的地方。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1568
translate Chinese day14_docking_5252973d:

    # "Even if that is some cold comfort."
    "即使这只是一点微不足道的安慰。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1572
translate Chinese day14_docking_2e5c2f52:

    # "Other lines are now being tossed overboard for the men on the docks to make fast. It doesn't seem to require the attention of the full crew; you step back, and take a deep breath."
    "其他缆绳现在也被抛下船，让码头上的工人们系牢。这似乎不需要全体船员都关注；你后退一步，深吸了一口气。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1573
translate Chinese day14_docking_4ff74f27:

    # "For now, savoring the experience of your first foreign port, you lean forward and take your first proper look at the city."
    "现在，你向前探身，品味着首次抵达外国港口的体验，第一次好好打量这座城市。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1582
translate Chinese day14_docking_d8b9f4b9:

    # "It is unmistakably, thrillingly {i}different{/i}. The buildings, even the ones along the harbor, are made of some kind of stone, white and clean and straight-walled."
    "这里毫无疑问有种令人悸动的{i}不同{/i}。即使只是港口沿岸的建筑，也由某种石头砌成，全都洁白、干净而笔直。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1583
translate Chinese day14_docking_c132cb19:

    # "They seem to glow, in the midday sun. Later, you will think of marble-halled palaces. At the moment, their stark lines and radiant color turn your imagination to something more ethereal and dreamlike—a city made of bone, or sugarloaf..."
    "在正午的阳光下，它们仿佛在发光。你很快就会联想到大理石殿堂的宫殿。而此刻，它们简洁的线条和明亮的色彩让你的想象力转向更空灵梦幻的事物——一座用骨头，或者糖块建成的城市……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1587
translate Chinese day14_docking_e085747e:

    # "For the first time in a while you even feel... excited?"
    "这是许久以来，你头一回感到……兴奋？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1589
translate Chinese day14_docking_57a565c6:

    # "No...{w} not quite."
    "不……{w} 不完全是。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1591
translate Chinese day14_docking_3e85be60:

    # "But the idea that this is what you'll call you new home—even if temporarily—brings with it a certain allure."
    "但想到这就是你将称之为新家的地方——即使是暂时的——也让你感受到一种独特的吸引力。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1593
translate Chinese day14_docking_2a7707f2:

    # "Perhaps your fears were overblown?"
    "也许你的恐惧有些过头了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1597
translate Chinese day14_docking_fa8f70f8:

    # "The idea of exploring it—of even being able to set foot there!—has your heart racing. And while you're sure there will be plenty of work to do, you're just as certain you won't spend the {i}entire{/i} time standing watch."
    "探索它——哪怕只是能踏上那片土地！——这样的想法就已经让你的心跳加速。虽然你确信会有很多工作要做，但你同样确信自己不会把{i}所有{/i}时间都花在站岗上。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1598
translate Chinese day14_docking_d09a57c9:

    # "In just a short while, the ground beneath your paws will no longer be moving. There will be fresh food! You can fall asleep to something other than exhaustion and the sound of the rigging!"
    "再过一小会儿，你爪子下的地面就不再移动了，就会有新鲜的食物了！你就可以听着除了疲惫者发出的噪音和索具声响之外的声音入睡了！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1599
translate Chinese day14_docking_05db98ea:

    # "For the first time in two weeks, you can find yourself more than a stone's throw from the nearest other person... if you want."
    "两周以来，你终于能——若你愿意——不再离他人仅有一箭之遥了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1603
translate Chinese day14_docking_2d2d64cf:

    # "Perhaps a bit of solitude will do you good."
    "也许独处一会对你有好处。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1605
translate Chinese day14_docking_74dc759a:

    # "Watching the sunsets, looking out to sea, perhaps exploring the nearby towns."
    "看看日落，眺望大海，或许探索一下附近的城镇。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1607
translate Chinese day14_docking_886ab8cd:

    # "And eventually, finding your way home."
    "最终，找到回家的路。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1609
translate Chinese day14_docking_f5a12d42:

    # "It should at most be about a month before another ship comes through that can take you back to where you joined the {i}Conway{/i}. At least, that's what Arthur said."
    "最多再过一个来月，应该就会有另一艘船经过，可以带你回到你登上{i}Conway{/i}的地方。至少，Arthur是这么说的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1611
translate Chinese day14_docking_4e3c814e:

    # "Or maybe by then, you'll feel ready to try your luck on another vessel."
    "或者到那时，你已经准备好去另一艘船上碰碰运气了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1613
translate Chinese day14_docking_851f4c78:

    # "Either way, you've got some time to think about it."
    "无论怎样，你还有一些时间考虑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1615
translate Chinese day14_docking_5a448512:

    # "You linger for a while longer, watching the ship's bustle from a distance, but the sight only twists the knife deeper."
    "你又逗留了一会儿，远远看着船上忙碌的景象，但这景象只让心中的刺痛更深了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1617
translate Chinese day14_docking_73cdba57:

    # "All those hopes of sailing with them..."
    "所有那些与他们一同航行的希望……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1619
translate Chinese day14_docking_416a993e:

    # "Gone.{w} Just like that."
    "都没了。{w} 就这样没了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1621
translate Chinese day14_docking_6ef8e421:

    # "You should probably just pull out the splinter rather than keep picking at it."
    "也许你应该直接拔掉这根刺，而不是这样不停地拨弄它。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1636
translate Chinese day14_docking_546b0da7:

    # a "Mr. [family_name]."
    a "[family_name]先生。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1638
translate Chinese day14_docking_129a144c:

    # "Mr. Hudson stops in front of you, though you only look up once he speaks."
    "哈德森先生在你面前停下，不过直到他开口说话你才抬起头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1640
translate Chinese day14_docking_d27cd9f5:

    # p "Yes, sir? I assume you've come to escort me off the ship?"
    p "什么事，长官？我想您是来护送我下船的吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1642
translate Chinese day14_docking_706131e6:

    # a "Indeed. Orders from the Captain. You're to gather your belongings and disembark immediately."
    a "正是。这是船长的命令。你收拾好你的物品，立即下船。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1644
translate Chinese day14_docking_25e1e0a5:

    # "He pauses."
    "他停顿了一下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1646
translate Chinese day14_docking_fbed983a:

    # a "It's unfortunate that it had to come to this, but you must understand—the crew's safety is our first concern. We cannot take chances when there's suspicion of sabotage."
    a "很遗憾事情会发展到这一步，但你必须明白——船员的安全是我们的首要考虑。在怀疑有人蓄意破坏时，我们不能冒险。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1648
translate Chinese day14_docking_5fe569bd:

    # p "And yet, I'm allowed to wander the ship unsupervised?"
    p "尽管如此，你们却仍然允许我在船上自由走动，无人监督？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1652
translate Chinese day14_docking_c47f8994:

    # "His eyes narrow."
    "他眯起眼睛。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1654
translate Chinese day14_docking_f1314840:

    # a "Because, Mr. [family_name], we are an honorable ship. Where possible, we avoid drastic measures such as confinement."
    a "因为，[family_name]先生，我们是一艘有荣誉感的船。在可能的情况下，我们会避免采取禁闭这类极端措施。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1658
translate Chinese day14_docking_0b57646e:

    # a "We chose leniency. You were permitted to move freely, while the crew was instructed to keep an eye on you, and to ensure you don't involve yourself in ship operations"
    a "我们选择了宽大处理。允许你自由活动，同时指示船员留意你，并确保你不参与船只的操作。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1660
translate Chinese day14_docking_99d57a90:

    # "It still feels contradictory: freedom for someone they suspect of sabotage. But arguing with a stubborn man like him would do no good."
    "这仍然感觉矛盾：对一个他们怀疑搞破坏的人给予自由。但和像他这样固执的人争辩没有好处。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1662
translate Chinese day14_docking_9f408197:

    # a "I will escort you to your bunk to allow you to collect your belongings."
    a "我会护送你到你的铺位，让你收拾物品。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1666
translate Chinese day14_docking_2a9d579b:

    # a "Purely a matter of protocol, to ensure the integrity of the ship."
    a "这纯粹是流程，要以确保船体的完整性。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1668
translate Chinese day14_docking_8d138a2a:

    # p "Oh course..."
    p "当然……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1675
translate Chinese day14_docking_61f5e4c9:

    # "You're grateful that most of the crew is too busy discussing their plans for Mogador to really notice your walk of shame."
    "你庆幸大多数船员都忙着讨论他们在摩加多尔的计划，没怎么注意你这趟耻辱的离船之行。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1684
translate Chinese day14_docking_de7de445:

    # "Arthur walks close beside you, guiding you past the masts and rowboats, down below deck. The space feels eerily quiet—almost deserted compared to its usual liveliness."
    "Arthur紧挨着你走着，引导你穿过桅杆和救生艇，下到甲板下面。与平时的热闹相比，这里感觉异常安静——几乎空无一人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1686
translate Chinese day14_docking_7c5e6ad9:

    # "On any other day, the stillness might have felt like peace. Today, it's just a frigid hollow."
    "换作平日，这份静寂或许会让人感到安宁。但今天，它只是个冰冷的空洞。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1688
translate Chinese day14_docking_79bd9f78:

    # "The tables you ate at. The benches where you played games. Few souls use them right now."
    "你们用过餐的桌子。你们玩过游戏的条凳。此刻罕有人迹。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1690
translate Chinese day14_docking_c1784c32:

    # "Fewer still look up as you pass."
    "你经过时，抬头看的人更少。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1692
translate Chinese day14_docking_33fc4bee:

    # "You stop at the spot that marks your hammock."
    "你在标记你吊床的位置停下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1701
translate Chinese day14_docking_a87f3692:

    # "36."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1703
translate Chinese day14_docking_c0b23b45:

    # "Everything is neatly stowed away."
    "所有东西都已整齐地收好。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1705
translate Chinese day14_docking_290b1f50:

    # "You have already packed, and all you need to do is grab the bag with your things."
    "你已经打包完毕，只需拿起装着你物品的袋子。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1709
translate Chinese day14_docking_9d72db94:

    # "It isn't much."
    "东西不多。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1711
translate Chinese day14_docking_c5c4ec8f:

    # a "Is that all?"
    a "就这些？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1713
translate Chinese day14_docking_443dacdc:

    # p "It is."
    p "确实"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1724
translate Chinese day14_docking_a5275607:

    # s "[name]?"
    s "[name]?"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1734
translate Chinese day14_docking_a9a2ef32:

    # "Samuel steps forward, hand at the back of [his] neck. Awkward in the sullen quiet."
    "Samuel走上前，手放在后颈上。在这沉闷的寂静中显得有些尴尬。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1738
translate Chinese day14_docking_dbbecebf:

    # "Julian is there as well, he hangs back a little. Looking less confident in the first mate's presence."
    "Julian也在那儿，他稍微靠后站着。在大副面前显得不那么自信。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1740
translate Chinese day14_docking_807e3a26:

    # s "He's leaving?"
    s "他要走了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1748
translate Chinese day14_docking_3dced07b:

    # "You notice Julian waiting at the periphery, stepping forward once your eyes meet, and giving Arthur a deferential nod."
    "你注意到Julian在边上等待着，当你们目光相遇时，他走上前，恭敬地向Arthur点了点头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1750
translate Chinese day14_docking_1f8d23f4:

    # j "I assume he's been asked to leave the ship?"
    j "我猜他是被要求离船了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1752
translate Chinese day14_docking_4690c608:

    # "Arthur gives a curt nod."
    "Arthur迅速地点了下头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1756
translate Chinese day14_docking_a11ebd57:

    # s "If it's not an issue, sir, I'd like to say farewell."
    s "如果没问题的话，长官，我想和他道个别。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1760
translate Chinese day14_docking_3747f2b6:

    # j "Sir, in that case I would like to say goodbye to him."
    j "长官，那样的话，我想和他道个别。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1762
translate Chinese day14_docking_575aeac6:

    # j "Is that alright?"
    j "可以吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1766
translate Chinese day14_docking_dd21b078:

    # "Once again Arthur gives a simple nod in return, closing his eyes as he does so."
    "Arthur再次迅速地点了点头作为回应，同时闭上了眼睛。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1768
translate Chinese day14_docking_d276dddd:

    # a "Of course. Say your farewells."
    a "当然。去道别吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1778
translate Chinese day14_docking_d13d667a:

    # "A heavy steps hefts Arthur aside as Samuel steps closer."
    "Samuel走近时，沉重的脚步将Arthur挤到了一边。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1784
translate Chinese day14_docking_89540a60:

    # "As does Julian after a moment. Though more hesitant than Samuel."
    "片刻后，Julian也走了过来。虽然比Samuel更犹豫。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1788
translate Chinese day14_docking_b64a615b:

    # s "How're you holding up?"
    s "你还好吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1792
translate Chinese day14_docking_b7f8e666:

    # "The concern in [his] eyes is genuine. [He] fidgets with a piece of folded paper."
    "[他]眼中的关切是真挚的。[他]摆弄着一张折叠的纸。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1794
translate Chinese day14_docking_1c33eb1d:

    # p "So-so."
    p "还行吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1796
translate Chinese day14_docking_8e5eaedf:

    # s "About what I expected..."
    s "和我想的差不多……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1798
translate Chinese day14_docking_03006b6c:

    # "[He] sighs."
    "[他]叹了口气。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1800
translate Chinese day14_docking_8b72213f:

    # s "It's probably cold comfort, but I heard Mogador is a good place to be... For someone who is findin' themselves in your position."
    s "这话可能没什么用，但我听说摩加多尔是个好地方……对于处在像你这样境地的人来说。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1802
translate Chinese day14_docking_1c7279d2:

    # s "Rajeeyah mentioned that—since the Sultan wants it to be the port that operates as the gate to kingdom for European ships—that there is plenty of them coming through."
    s "Rajeeyah提到过——因为苏丹想把它打造成欧洲船只进入王国的门户港口——所以有很多船会经过这里。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1804
translate Chinese day14_docking_db0cb644:

    # s "It'll give you many opportunities to make your way back home."
    s "这会给你许多重返家乡的机会。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1806
translate Chinese day14_docking_662c9cb9:

    # p "If I even want to. I'm not sure yet."
    p "即使我这么想的话，我也还不确定。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1810
translate Chinese day14_docking_3095cb19:

    # s "If you want, yes."
    s "如果你想的话，当然了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1812
translate Chinese day14_docking_73a25ff3:

    # "A faint smile crosses [his] features."
    "[他]脸上掠过一丝淡淡的微笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1814
translate Chinese day14_docking_1dc07b2b:

    # s "They'll be hiring sailors too. You could keep working, if that's what you want."
    s "他们也会招募水手。如果你想继续工作，完全可以。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1816
translate Chinese day14_docking_a1d0e762:

    # s "And maybe we'll cross paths again."
    s "说不定我们还会再见面呢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1818
translate Chinese day14_docking_4a1cb08a:

    # s "With you as a proper tar then, aye?"
    s "到时候你就是一个真正的老水手了，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1820
translate Chinese day14_docking_5b80e92a:

    # "You can't answer. Your feel your voice would break if you tried."
    "你无法回答。你感觉只要一开口，声音就会哽咽。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1822
translate Chinese day14_docking_dad286d8:

    # "Samuel notices as well."
    "Samuel也察觉到了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1826
translate Chinese day14_docking_45922580:

    # s "I'd like that."
    s "我很期待那番景象。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1828
translate Chinese day14_docking_aa42146c:

    # "Your smile wobbles as you fight back the rising tide. "
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1830
translate Chinese day14_docking_d134ebdc:

    # "It was fine until now."
    "本来一直还好好的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1832
translate Chinese day14_docking_54b559a1:

    # "And now it very much isn't."
    "可现在完全不是那么回事了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1836
translate Chinese day14_docking_5e119cb6:

    # "You blink quickly, unwilling to wipe your eyes in front of him."
    "你快速眨了眨眼，不愿在他面前擦眼睛。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1843
translate Chinese day14_docking_8bcbe299:

    # "Samuel looks over [his] shoulder to glance back to Julian."
    "Samuel扭头瞥了一眼Julian。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1847
translate Chinese day14_docking_1f9f1fec:

    # s "Well? You gonna say anything, Jules? Why am I doin' all the talking, like?"
    s "喂？你不说点什么吗，Jules？怎么全是我在说啊？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1853
translate Chinese day14_docking_c7bca4ac:

    # j "I'm sorry... I'm just bad at goodbyes."
    j "对不起……我只是不擅长道别。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1855
translate Chinese day14_docking_208c5aca:

    # j "I just hope you'll be happy, wherever you end up, [name]."
    j "我只希望你能幸福，无论你最终身在何处，[name]。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1857
translate Chinese day14_docking_ab8eaf93:

    # p "Thank you, Julian. I enjoyed having you around."
    p "谢谢你，Julian。有你在身边我很开心。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1861
translate Chinese day14_docking_5404a70d:

    # j "Don't say things like that, I told you, I'm awful at goodbyes."
    j "别说这种话，我告诉过你，我最怕道别了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1863
translate Chinese day14_docking_76c32bf5:

    # "He manages to coax a laugh from you, shaky as it may be."
    "他还是把你逗笑了，尽管那笑声有些颤抖。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1865
translate Chinese day14_docking_c2d54385:

    # p "I will shut up then."
    p "那我就不说了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1867
translate Chinese day14_docking_c485e66f:

    # "Samuel finally holds out the folded paper [he]'s been fiddling with."
    "Samuel终于递出了他一直在摆弄的那张折叠的纸。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1869
translate Chinese day14_docking_33afd333:

    # "You take it, and your confused expression must be obvious enough for [him] to start explaining:"
    "你接过来，脸上的困惑一定很明显，于是他开始解释："

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1873
translate Chinese day14_docking_d2f67c3b:

    # s "Rajeeyah helped me write down some phrases you might need. They're written in Arabic, and each one is translated. So you can just point to them if you need to."
    s "Rajeeyah帮我写下了一些你可能需要的短语。是用阿拉伯语写的，每条都有翻译。所以你需要的时候指给人家看就行。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1877
translate Chinese day14_docking_ac263f45:

    # "You unfold the piece of paper a few times until you return it to its normal letter size. The translations begin with simple things: Your thank yous, and goodbyes and grow to more complex sentences, like asking for a bed for the night."
    "你把纸展开几次，直到它恢复成正常的信纸大小。翻译从简单的开始：感谢、道别，逐渐到更复杂的句子，比如请求借宿一晚。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1881
translate Chinese day14_docking_bc783ec9:

    # p "Sam, you're something else.{w} Thank you."
    p "Sam，你真是……{w}谢了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1883
translate Chinese day14_docking_37480cce:

    # s "Thank Rajeeyah. She did all the work. All I did was to just yell sentences at her."
    s "谢谢Rajeeyah吧。活儿都是她干的。我只是对着她嚷嚷那些句子而已。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1885
translate Chinese day14_docking_9ce06b9a:

    # p "But you're the one who thought of it."
    p "但想到这个点子的人是你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1889
translate Chinese day14_docking_eb6dd0b4:

    # "[He] scratches the back of [his] neck."
    "[他]挠了挠后颈。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1891
translate Chinese day14_docking_e4259d0f:

    # s "That I did. Perhaps I can take some of the praise."
    s "这倒没错。也许我能分走一点夸奖。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1895
translate Chinese day14_docking_a697f0b4:

    # s "Like Jules, I wish you nothin' but the best, man."
    s "和Jules一样，我只希望你一切顺利，伙计。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1899
translate Chinese day14_docking_dc57ff81:

    # s "I wish you nothing but the best, man."
    s "我只希望你一切顺利，伙计。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1901
translate Chinese day14_docking_93baee11:

    # p "Thank you, Sam. I couldn't have hoped for anyone better than you showing me the ropes."
    p "谢谢你，Sam。我真不敢奢望能有比你更好的人来带我入门了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1903
translate Chinese day14_docking_8e606a88:

    # s "Ah, don't say that. Plenty better salts than me 'round."
    s "啊，别这么说。这附近比我强的老水手多的是。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1907
translate Chinese day14_docking_fe408405:

    # p "I've yet to see them."
    p "我还没见到呢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1909
translate Chinese day14_docking_1e3be0bb:

    # s "Just means there is a lot for you yet to see."
    s "那只是说明你还有太多东西没见识过。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1911
translate Chinese day14_docking_1ee57f9d:

    # s "Out there, I mean."
    s "我是说，在外面的世界里。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1915
translate Chinese day14_docking_59ec3e76:

    # p "Thank you, you two. I mean it."
    p "谢谢你们俩。我是真心的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1919
translate Chinese day14_docking_a207fb6d:

    # p "Thank you, Sam. I mean it."
    p "谢谢你，Sam。我是真心的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1929
translate Chinese day14_docking_0ee44d76:

    # "A heavy steps hefts Arthur aside as Julian steps closer."
    "Julian走近，沉重的脚步把Arthur挤到一边。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1931
translate Chinese day14_docking_06d18dc1:

    # "He clasps one arm with the other, fingers worrying at the fabric of his sleeve. A slow breath escapes him."
    "他双手交叉抱臂，手指不安地摩挲着袖子的布料。他缓缓吐出一口气。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1933
translate Chinese day14_docking_af9fdf62:

    # j "God, I hate goodbyes."
    j "天啊，我讨厌道别。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1935
translate Chinese day14_docking_c9040ca5:

    # "It's not the opening you expected, and the blunt honesty of it draws an unexpected laugh from you."
    "这不是你预想的开场白，但这直白的坦诚却引出了你一声意想不到的笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1939
translate Chinese day14_docking_371124b2:

    # "Julian laughs too."
    "Julian也笑了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1941
translate Chinese day14_docking_119e816c:

    # j "No, really. I never know what to say, and I always end up..."
    j "不，说真的。我从来不知道该说什么，而且最后总是……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1945
translate Chinese day14_docking_86219908:

    # "He trails off with his gaze dropping to the ground."
    "他的话音渐弱，目光垂向地面。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1947
translate Chinese day14_docking_a92f1658:

    # j "Always close to..."
    j "总是差点就……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1949
translate Chinese day14_docking_28eb3e75:

    # p "Don't worry about what to say. I just appreciate that you came to find me at all."
    p "你一个字都不用再多说了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1951
translate Chinese day14_docking_d6450779:

    # p "You don't have to say a word more."
    p "你一个字都不用再多说了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1953
translate Chinese day14_docking_46653d66:

    # j "I just hope you'll be happy, wherever life takes you, [name]."
    j "我只希望你能幸福，无论命运将你带往何方，[name]。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1955
translate Chinese day14_docking_ea0e6e20:

    # p "Thank you, Julian."
    p "谢谢你，Julian。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1957
translate Chinese day14_docking_a8dfa401:

    # p "I've enjoyed having you around. Not to mention how much more boring the days will be without you."
    p "有你在身边我很开心。更不用说没有你日子会变得多无聊。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1961
translate Chinese day14_docking_07500323:

    # j "Don't—don't say things like that. I told you, I struggle with goodbyes."
    j "别——别说这种话。我告诉过你，我应付不来道别。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1963
translate Chinese day14_docking_76c32bf5_1:

    # "He manages to coax a laugh from you, shaky as it may be."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1967
translate Chinese day14_docking_81de07ce:

    # p "Then I'll stop talking."
    p "那我就不说了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1969
translate Chinese day14_docking_5a1c2f46:

    # "Julian's expression falters into something softer. Both grateful and sad, and for a moment, neither of you speak."
    "Julian的表情软化下来，交织着感激与哀伤。一时间，你们两人都沉默无言。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1971
translate Chinese day14_docking_c5c4ec8f_1:

    # a "Is that all?"
    a ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1973
translate Chinese day14_docking_700ac6fb:

    # "If silence could stop time, you'd let it. But life moves, and you force yourself to answer."
    "如果沉默能让时间停止，你会任由它如此。但生活总要继续，你强迫自己去接受。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1975
translate Chinese day14_docking_3651d6fc:

    # a "Very well, follow me Mr. [family_name]."
    a "很好，请跟我来，[family_name]先生。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1983
translate Chinese day14_docking_bc156241:

    # "The last walk on the {i}Conway{/i}. Your belongings clutched to your chest, your ears pinned back against the wind."
    "这是在{i}Conway{/i}上的最后一段路。你把行李紧紧抱在胸前，耳朵被风吹得向后贴。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1985
translate Chinese day14_docking_421b051f:

    # "You count the steps as you go. Past the empty tables, up into the blinding sun, toward the plank that leads to shore."
    "你一边走一边数着步子。经过空荡荡的桌子，走进刺眼的阳光里，走向通往岸边的跳板。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1987
translate Chinese day14_docking_6cd8dde6:

    # "58."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1989
translate Chinese day14_docking_f7095608:

    # "58 Steps with perhaps another five to cross back onto firm ground."
    "58步，也许再走5步就能重新踏上坚实的土地。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1991
translate Chinese day14_docking_31115766:

    # "Five"
    "五"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1993
translate Chinese day14_docking_f1537194:

    # "Four"
    "四"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1995
translate Chinese day14_docking_72fdaea5:

    # "Three"
    "三"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:1997
translate Chinese day14_docking_be22d38d:

    # "Two"
    "二"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2003
translate Chinese day14_docking_956e1fcf:

    # "Speaking of companionship—if you don't want to face this alone, you'll need to find someone soon."
    "说到同伴——如果你不想独自面对这一切，你得尽快找个人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2007
translate Chinese day14_docking_1147ca25:

    # "Wolf or Julian?... You can't quite get a solid grasp on Julian's view on the idea. Occasionally he appears to be open for it; other times, not at all..."
    "Wolf还是Julian？……你还不太能完全确定Julian对这个提议的看法。有时他似乎对此持开放态度；有时又完全不是……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2010
translate Chinese day14_docking_caaf3695:

    # "Wolf or Julian?... Despite your best efforts, you're still not sure you've convinced Wolf. But he might be your best chance."
    "Wolf还是Julian？……尽管你尽了最大努力，你仍然不确定自己是否已经说服了Wolf。但他可能是你最好的机会。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2012
translate Chinese day14_docking_1e32350a:

    # "But really... What other options are there?"
    "但是说真的……还有其他选择吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2014
translate Chinese day14_docking_17e35144:

    # "Sam's never coming—you don't need to be a genius to know that.{p}Rajeeyah? No, she hardly knows you.{p}Perce?...{w}Nah."
    "Sam绝对不会来——这点不需要天才也能知道。{p}Rajeeyah？不，她几乎不认识你。{p}Perce？……{w}算了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2018
translate Chinese day14_docking_a3c6225e:

    # "If anyone on this ship might agree to come along, it's Julian."
    "如果这艘船上有人可能同意跟你一起走，那就是Julian。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2022
translate Chinese day14_docking_7faaf7a5:

    # "Maybe Wolf's had time to think—and perhaps, just perhaps, he's changed his mind."
    "也许Wolf有了足够的时间考虑——也许，只是也许，他改变主意了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2035
translate Chinese day14_docking_feb6b223:

    # "But you're not liable to want for companionship, either."
    "但你也不一定非要找个同伴不可。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2036
translate Chinese day14_docking_91e24ff1:

    # "You wonder what the others will have planned?"
    "你想知道其他人会有什么打算？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2039
translate Chinese day14_docking_733c4933:

    # "Julian is as giddy as you are. Exploring a new city to both of you, particularly one so busy and unique, could certainly be a lot of fun."
    "Julian和你一样兴奋。对你们俩来说，探索一座新城市，尤其是如此繁忙而独特的城市，肯定会很有趣。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2040
translate Chinese day14_docking_1e526752:

    # "Maybe the kind of fun you'll have to answer for later, but so what? You're a young man, entitled to a bit of excitement, and you've talked your way out of worse already."
    "也许是那种你日后需要为此负责的“有趣”，但那又怎样？你是个年轻人，有权享受一点刺激，而且以前更糟的情况你都能凭口才脱身。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2042
translate Chinese day14_docking_59f6b0bd:

    # "You're sure Julian isn't going to let the opportunity go to waste, for starters. If anyone can make the most of a raucous harbor, it's going to be him. Maybe it's worth trying to follow his lead."
    "首先，你确信Julian不会浪费这个机会。如果说有谁能充分利用一个喧闹的港口，那一定是他。也许试着跟随他的脚步是值得的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2044
translate Chinese day14_docking_bd25437c:

    # "On the other hand, you did offer to help Rajeeyah. The surgeon will be as good of a guide as you could hope for, to say nothing of helping you to prove your use to the officers."
    "另一方面，你确实提出过要帮助Rajeeyah。这位外科医生会是你所能期望的最佳向导，更不用说还能帮你向长官们证明你的用处。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2045
translate Chinese day14_docking_091fd79d:

    # "...And probably keeping you out of getting into too much trouble."
    "……而且很可能可以让你避免惹上太多麻烦。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2047
translate Chinese day14_docking_e7576c1c:

    # "You should probably keep an eye on Wolf. Whatever he's been through, it's clearly left an impression. You're sure he's going to tell you he wants to be left alone—again. But you should be there for him, just in case."
    "你或许应该留意一下Wolf。无论他经历过什么，那显然在他身上留下了印记。你确信他又会告诉你他想一个人待着——又一次地。但你应该陪在他身边，以防万一。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2049
translate Chinese day14_docking_8c118e08:

    # "Wolf seems like he's probably a veteran of places like this. He might not be very good company, at least not at first. Of course, maybe dry land will relax him a bit, too."
    "Wolf看起来像是这类地方的常客。他可能不是个很好的同伴，至少一开始不是。当然，也许坚实的陆地也能让他稍微放松一点。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2050
translate Chinese day14_docking_96c59193:

    # "Or maybe not."
    "也可能不会。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2051
translate Chinese day14_docking_afeb2117:

    # "One thing is certain though... You hope the purser hands you your wages ahead of time."
    "不过有一件事是肯定的……你希望事务长能提前发给你工钱。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2055
translate Chinese day14_docking_982b6dcd:

    # "If he doesn't, well you always got Sam's advice. Hopefully you won't have to make a fool of yourself though."
    "如果他不给，嗯，你总还有Sam的建议。但愿你不必出洋相。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2057
translate Chinese day14_docking_de6ca6df:

    # "You chuckle to yourself at the thought of finally getting back on firm land and having absolutely nothing to show for it."
    "想到终于回到坚实的陆地上却身无分文，你不禁暗自轻笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2060
translate Chinese day14_docking_eef5cceb:

    # "You feel two furred hands settle on your shoulders, giving them a firm squeeze."
    "你感到两只毛茸茸的手搭上你的肩膀，用力捏了捏。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2061
translate Chinese day14_docking_86329e35:

    # "Mere moments after the black snout of Samuel slips into your vision."
    "片刻之后，Samuel黑色的口鼻部就滑入了你的视线。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2062
translate Chinese day14_docking_5ebb511d:

    # s "Made it after all, didn't ya?"
    s "总算到了，是吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2063
translate Chinese day14_docking_c663b2dc:

    # p "Sure did. As any proper sailor would."
    p "当然。就像任何合格的水手一样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2064
translate Chinese day14_docking_be5017f9:

    # "Samuel laughs."
    "Samuel笑了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2065
translate Chinese day14_docking_d1ea2692:

    # s "Hey now, not sure if I'd go {i}that{/i} far."
    s "嘿，我可不确定我会表现得{i}那么{/i}夸张。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2066
translate Chinese day14_docking_859b5a56:

    # p "What?!{w} And I thought you were on my side."
    p "什么？！{w} 我还以为你站在我这边呢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2067
translate Chinese day14_docking_9ddfe5cf:

    # s "I'm just pulling your ear, like.{w} Come on, let's get ready."
    s "我只是在逗你玩。{w} 来吧，我们准备一下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2070
translate Chinese day14_docking_60872101:

    # "You feel two scaled hands settle on your shoulders, giving them a playful squeeze."
    "你感到两只覆着鳞片的手搭上你的肩膀，顽皮地捏了捏。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2071
translate Chinese day14_docking_0fda5389:

    # "Mere moments after the green snout of Julian slips into your vision."
    "片刻之后，Julian绿色的口鼻部就滑入了你的视线。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2072
translate Chinese day14_docking_57d37428:

    # j "And that's my sailor making it to his first harbor."
    j "看，我的水手总算抵达他的第一个港口了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2073
translate Chinese day14_docking_0a66d76c:

    # p "Didn't do too bad, did I?"
    p "我表现得还不赖吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2074
translate Chinese day14_docking_87cc7b7d:

    # j "Not in my eyes. How's it feel?"
    j "在我眼里很棒。感觉怎么样？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2075
translate Chinese day14_docking_d219bf73:

    # "You reach up with your hand to gently tap against the tip of his nose."
    "你抬起手，轻轻点了点他的鼻尖。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2076
translate Chinese day14_docking_6fa607fc:

    # p "It's everything I hoped it would be."
    p "完全符合我的期望。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2077
translate Chinese day14_docking_a876f737:

    # j "You're easy to impress."
    j "你还真好满足。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2078
translate Chinese day14_docking_c49cdd69:

    # p "Shush you, let me have this."
    p "嘘，别说了，让我享受这一刻。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2079
translate Chinese day14_docking_853f1acf:

    # "Now it is your time to get a tap against the side of your snout."
    "现在轮到你的鼻子侧面被轻轻敲一下了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2080
translate Chinese day14_docking_63eebd3e:

    # j "Never, old man!{w} Come on, let's get ready."
    j "想都别想，老头儿！{w} 来吧，我们准备一下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2099
translate Chinese day14_docking_fbfc7ba6:

    # "Somehow, just the fact that you see land next to you when you peer overboard fills you with a quiet joy."
    "不知怎的，当你从船舷望出去，看到陆地就在身旁时，一种静谧的喜悦便充满了你的心。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2100
translate Chinese day14_docking_c9fd5877:

    # "A wonderful sight after more than a week of nothing but the deep blue stretching to the horizon."
    "在超过一周的时间里只能看到深蓝色海平面延伸至天际的景象之后，这真是美妙的风景。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2101
translate Chinese day14_docking_f0a1840a:

    # "With the lines secured, the {i}Conway{/i} rests peacefully at harbor. And, for the moment, there don't seem to be any pressing duties."
    "缆绳系好后，{i}Conway{/i}在港口平静地停泊着。而且，眼下似乎没有什么紧迫的任务。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2111
translate Chinese day14_docking_70dd4570:

    # "Some of the crew, similarly released from duty, have been making plans for Mogador. Of course, there is still work to be done—if you {i}volunteer{/i}—and surely Arthur would respect your eagerness to do so."
    "一些同样从任务中解放出来的船员已经在计划着去摩加多尔了。当然，还有工作要做——如果你{i}自告奋勇{/i}的话——而且Arthur肯定会尊重你这份热忱。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2128
translate Chinese day14_docking_2743acbe:

    # "Perhaps your best course of action is to inquire. Samuel is busy talking with Arthur, but Julian and Perce are standing with [him], and you make your way over to hear what's going on."
    "或许你最好去问问。Samuel正忙着和Arthur说话，但Julian和Perce正和[他]站在一起，你走过去想听听他们在说什么。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2135
translate Chinese day14_docking_539d9580:

    # "Julian notices your approach, and gives you a friendly wave. Momentarily distracted from [his] conversation with Arthur, Sam glances over and smiles as well."
    "Julian注意到你走近，友好地朝你挥了挥手。正在和Arthur交谈的Sam也暂时分神，瞥了你一眼并露出了微笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2137
translate Chinese day14_docking_a0dfdd13:

    # "Julian notices you approach, and gives you a friendly wave. He makes room for you to stand next to him while Sam continues talking. The maned wolf glances over, and gives you a brief nod of recognition."
    "Julian注意到你走近，友好地朝你挥了挥手。他为你腾出位置，让你能站在他旁边，而Sam则继续说着话。那只鬃狼瞥了一眼，向你微微点头致意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2141
translate Chinese day14_docking_accc8889:

    # "Julian nods to you when you approach, making room for you to stand next to him. Momentarily distracted from his conversation with Arthur, Sam catches sight of you, and perks up [his] ears."
    "你走近时，Julian朝你点点头，为你腾出位置站在他旁边。正在和Arthur交谈的Sam暂时分神，看到了你，并竖起了[他的]耳朵。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2143
translate Chinese day14_docking_7dd5f35e:

    # "The conversation seems to be rather perfunctory, about ship's business. Julian nods politely when you join them."
    "对话听起来颇为敷衍，无非是些船上琐事。Julian见你过来，礼貌地点了点头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2152
translate Chinese day14_docking_4d375200:

    # a "...him, too? I suppose you wanted to see what Mr. O'Connor was up to, Mr. [family_name]?"
    a "……他也要去吗？[family_name]先生，我想你是想看看O'Connor先生在做什么吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2154
translate Chinese day14_docking_cb7f2f75:

    # "He glares at you momentarily, but appears to catch his emotions with a deep sharp exhale."
    "他瞪了你一眼，却又猛地深叹口气，仿佛把情绪按了回去。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2163
translate Chinese day14_docking_4d375200_1:

    # a "...him, too? I suppose you wanted to see what Mr. O'Connor was up to, Mr. [family_name]?"
    a ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2165
translate Chinese day14_docking_b590c5ea:

    # p "Er. Yes, sir. He is my superior, after all."
    p "呃，是的，长官。毕竟他是我的上级。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2169
translate Chinese day14_docking_eccbb3e8:

    # pb "He has seniority, at least."
    pb "至少他资历更老。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2171
translate Chinese day14_docking_72171b56:

    # a "I suppose he can keep you out of trouble. Mr. Nomax has some work to do ashore, apparently. What that means is he'd like to explore the city, I presume."
    a "我想他能让你避开麻烦。Nomax先生显然有些岸上的工作要做。我猜这意味着他想去城里逛逛。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2175
translate Chinese day14_docking_66ff253e:

    # a "I've asked him to wait until someone I trust can accompany him. If you two don't mind getting straight from the bowels of the ship to the fleshpots of Mogador..."
    a "我让他等个信得过的人陪着再去。你俩要是不介意从船舱直奔摩加多尔的花街柳巷……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2179
translate Chinese day14_docking_c3ea33ff:

    # "Samuel raises [his] paw in a salute, returning Arthur's faintly wry smile with a broader one of [his] own. Perce nods, instead."
    "Samuel举起[他的]爪子敬了个礼，以更灿烂的笑容回应Arthur略带揶揄的微笑。而Perce只是点了点头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2185
translate Chinese day14_docking_629d915d:

    # s "We can manage, sir. Wouldn't want the chap to get into any trouble."
    s "我们能应付，长官。可不想让那家伙惹上麻烦。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2186
translate Chinese day14_docking_59898c13:

    # pb "If he tries to wander into a bar, he'll definitely need an escort."
    pb "如果他试图溜进酒吧，那肯定需要有人看着。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2187
translate Chinese day14_docking_67f92ca6:

    # s "Exactly."
    s "没错"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2191
translate Chinese day14_docking_a997bb51:

    # a "Don't get yourself arrested, Mr. O'Connor. Set a good example for your fledgling charges."
    a "别让自己被抓了，O'Connor先生。给你这些初出茅庐的部下做个好榜样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2195
translate Chinese day14_docking_ffe7ce36:

    # s "Wouldn't dream of doing anything but right by them, sir."
    s "长官，除了对他们负责，我绝不会做别的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2201
translate Chinese day14_docking_2381c335:

    # a "Don't... {i}let him{/i} stay out too late, either. We'll have work on the ship. I've asked the carpenter to sound her and see what other supplies we need."
    a "也别……{i}让他{/i}在外面待得太晚。船上还有工作。我已经让木匠去检查船体，看看我们还需要什么补给。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2205
translate Chinese day14_docking_1dd9b3b1:

    # a "And you two, Mr. [family_name], Mr. Preble. Do not forget when we are set to leave."
    a "还有你们两位，[family_name]先生，Preble先生。别忘了我们定好的出发时间。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2207
translate Chinese day14_docking_191bb72c:

    # a "It is easy for new sailors to get carried away with their momentary freedoms in port, and I do expect you both to show the same discipline I expect to see from everyone."
    a "新水手很容易在港口的短暂自由中忘乎所以，我确实期望你们两位能展现出我期望中每个人都有的纪律性。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2209
translate Chinese day14_docking_4f31e811:

    # p "Of course, Sir."
    p "当然，长官。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2211
translate Chinese day14_docking_cb97b4eb:

    # s "If you need bodies, sir, we'll not be too far. Julian and [name] will be right by my side."
    s "如果需要人手，长官，我们不会走远。Julian和[name]会一直在我身边。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2226
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_33762195:

    # "You scan the deck for those tell-tale green scales of his, the crew having scattered with there not being any pressing duties."
    "你在甲板上搜寻他那标志性的绿色鳞片，船员们因为没有紧急任务而四散开来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2244
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_d01966ed:

    # "Eventually a flick of a tail reveals him and you make your way over to the bow of the ship, where he watches out across the harbor."
    "最终，尾巴的一甩暴露了他的位置，你走向船头，他正在那里眺望着港口。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2252
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_83c66e3e:

    # "You reach out and lay your paws on his shoulders, giving them a playful squeeze."
    "你伸出手，将爪子搭在他的肩膀上，顽皮地捏了捏。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2254
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_066d3ea0:

    # "He tries to squirm his way out of it before turning around."
    "他试图扭动身体挣脱，然后转过身来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2256
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_42b01cbe:

    # p "Hey."
    p "嘿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2258
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_d645194b:

    # j "Hey..."
    j "嘿……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2260
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_a23f9b5a:

    # p "Morocco, eh?"
    p "摩洛哥，嗯？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2262
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_7be90abe:

    # "He just gives a vaguely affirmative tone in response."
    "他只是含糊地应了一声表示肯定。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2264
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_96e72483:

    # p "Not how I imagined it to look if I'm honest."
    p "老实说，这和我想象中的样子不太一样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2266
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_8453ef27:

    # j "Neither did I."
    j "我也是。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2268
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_c9bec678:

    # p "Wish I could appreciate it under better circumstances if I'm honest."
    p "老实说，真希望能在更好的境况下欣赏它。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2272
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_e58cbe6b:

    # j "As do I."
    j "我也是。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2276
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_7414be93:

    # "He takes a deep breath."
    "他深吸了一口气。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2278
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_22b0054f:

    # j "So you'll be leaving then?"
    j "那么，你要走了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2280
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_cced8db2:

    # p "I guess.{w} Just waiting for Mr. Hudson to tell me as much. Or perhaps I should just do it on my own volition."
    p "我想是吧。{w}就等着Hudson先生这么告诉我。或者也许我应该自己主动离开。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2282
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_255b8d43:

    # j "I've been thinking, [name]."
    j "我一直在想，[name]。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2284
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_e191c765:

    # "Your ears perk to attention."
    "你的耳朵因专注而竖了起来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2286
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_99e8b913:

    # "Has he?"
    "难道他？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2288
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_697f94c6:

    # p "About what?"
    p "想什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2292
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_28b52ae9:

    # j "Don't play dumb.{w} I mean that I've been thinking about coming along with you."
    j "别装傻。{w}我是说，我一直在想跟你一起走。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2294
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_6389e503:

    # j "Being away from..."
    j "离开……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2296
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_a8466640:

    # "He pauses and looks across the deck."
    "他停顿了一下，目光扫过甲板。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2298
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_35cbd15f:

    # j "Away from {i}this.{/i}"
    j "离开{i}这里{/i}。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2300
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_180cf7d8:

    # j "No more early mornings. No more taking orders. No more pressure."
    j "不再有清晨的早起。不再有命令。不再有压力。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2302
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_08a3cb3b:

    # j "Just the whole world."
    j "只有整个世界。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2304
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_cdd70cf8:

    # p "Just the whole world and us."
    p "只有整个世界和我们。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2306
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_b25f87eb:

    # p "So you {i}are{/i} coming?!"
    p "所以你{i}真的{/i}要来？！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2308
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_c518e6a7:

    # p "You don't have to decide right now, but I don't know how much longer I'll be around."
    p "你不必现在就决定，但我不知道自己还能待多久。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2312
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_4e375350:

    # j "I think I already have. I just... need to say it out loud, I guess."
    j "我想我已经决定了。我猜我只是……需要大声说出来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2316
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_319885ad:

    # "He leans forward, resting his arms on the railing, watching the dark waves slide beneath them."
    "他向前倾身，手臂靠在栏杆上，看着黑色的波浪在下方涌过。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2318
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_b9a53613:

    # j "All this time, I never thought I belonged. Not here, not in school, not back home.{w} Now the question is do I want to continue feeling like I don't belong?"
    j "一直以来，我从不觉得自己属于这里。不属于这里，不属于学校，不属于家乡。{w}现在的问题是，我是否想继续这种格格不入的感觉？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2320
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_3745b509:

    # p "And you know the answer."
    p "而且你知道答案。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2324
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_81166d01:

    # "He lets out a brief laugh. The kind that comes after too much thinking."
    "他短促地笑了一声，那种思虑过度后的笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2326
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_3532dffa:

    # p "What? You do."
    p "什么？你知道的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2328
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_058b01f8:

    # p "And it's the one that doesn't contain your family, or some higher-up ass with a uniform telling you what to do."
    p "那个答案里没有你的家人，也没有某个穿着制服、高高在上的混蛋对你发号施令。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2330
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_ef63200c:

    # p "There won't be any belonging or not belonging.{w} Just us."
    p "不会再有归属或不归属。{w}只有我们。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2334
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_9af8fd1f:

    # j "Us and the world."
    j "我们和世界。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2336
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_00c1d1a2:

    # j "A new adventure."
    j "一场新的冒险。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2338
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_8a47e8e3:

    # j "You know, when I first met you, I never thought this would be the path we would take. You looked like the typical eager young sailor. Ready to doff the cap whenever needed."
    j "你知道吗，当我第一次遇见你时，我从没想过我们会走上这条路。你看起来就像个典型的、热切的年轻水手。随时准备脱帽致敬。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2340
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_625de797:

    # p "And now?"
    p "那现在呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2344
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_bcb2dbf0:

    # j "Now...{w} more of a stray cat, perhaps?"
    j "现在……{w}或许更像只流浪猫？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2346
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_b17098fa:

    # "He straightens, breathing in the warm midday air."
    "他挺直身子，呼吸着正午温暖的空气。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2350
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_16393d70:

    # j "Alright then. When you go... I'm coming with you."
    j "那好吧。等你走的时候……我跟你一起。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2352
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_918f9ddd:

    # p "Yeah?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2354
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_ef4c13bc:

    # j "Yeah.{w} As you said, I can't keep doing what my father wants. We're an ocean away from him, and even my own family isn't worth being miserable, right?"
    j "是啊。{w}就像你说的，我不能一直做我父亲想让我做的事。我们和他隔着一个大洋，就连我自己的家人也不值得让我痛苦，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2356
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_1a3e6309:

    # p "Right."
    p "好吧"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2358
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_4ce85784:

    # j "I need to do what I want, or I'll never be happy."
    j "我需要做自己想做的事，否则我永远不会快乐。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2362
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_31f07a77:

    # "He pulls the corners of his muzzle into a smile."
    "他的嘴角扬起，露出了微笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2364
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_51e1dd7f:

    # p "Guess we'll find out what the world looks like without all this, huh?"
    p "我想我们会发现没有这一切的世界会是什么样子的，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2366
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_11608d52:

    # j "Guess we will."
    j "我想是的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2370
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_374cfcf9:

    # j "We shouldn't leave together though. It'll be too suspicious if I'm going off the ship with you, instead we should-"
    j "不过我们不应该一起离开。如果我跟你一起下船就太可疑了。相反，我们应该——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2372
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_c26a6129:

    # "He pauses and looks up at the sky for a moment to look for the position of the sun, before pointing in a direction across the town."
    "他停顿了一下，抬头看了看天空，寻找太阳的位置，然后指向城镇对面的一个方向。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2374
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_1db329f2:

    # j "The harbor looks to be on the southwestern side of the town. Let's meet at whatever northeastern gate is the closest to the sea, so right on the other side of the town."
    j "港口看起来在城镇的西南侧。我们在离海最近的东北口碰头，就在城镇的另一边。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2376
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_0594c81a:

    # j "Right around dinner time?"
    j "大概晚餐时间？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2378
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_a840a3c3:

    # j "It's as far away from the ship as we can go without leaving the town. Fewer chances of anyone will spot us that way."
    j "那是我们在不离开城镇的情况下能走到的最远的地方。那样被人发现的机会更小。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2380
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_b6809044:

    # p "I like that plan.{w} I will let Mr. Hudson know that I'm leaving soon. It's probably best if you wait a little longer."
    p "我喜欢这个计划。{w}我会告诉Hudson先生我很快就要走了。你最好再等一会儿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2382
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_7546e38a:

    # p "Perhaps tell the others that you are exhausted from bringing in the ship and need a bit of rest."
    p "也许你也可以告诉其他人你把船开进来累坏了，需要休息一下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2384
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_ca021bae:

    # j "I will."
    j "我会的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2386
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_ac74cddd:

    # p "You made the right decision, Julian."
    p "你做了正确的决定，Julian。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2388
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_a89365f8:

    # p "Just us."
    p "只有我们了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2390
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_bd072bb6:

    # j "Just us."
    j ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2397
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_54bbf803:

    # j "I guess I should say goodbye then. In case we won't see us anymore."
    j "我想我该说再见了。以防我们再也见不到。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2399
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_97a09a21:

    # "Silence stretches between you two and you fear to undo it."
    "沉默在你们之间蔓延，你害怕打破它。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2401
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_255b8d43_1:

    # j "I've been thinking, [name]."
    j ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2403
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_351b741c:

    # "Your ears flick to attention."
    "你的耳朵因专注动了动。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2405
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_d86d3fb1:

    # p "Thinking about what?"
    p "在想什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2407
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_209ed796:

    # j "About going with you."
    j "想跟你一起走的事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2409
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_bc8ffa92:

    # j "It sounds simple, doesn't it?{w} Just... walk off and never come back."
    j "听起来很简单，不是吗？{w}就这样……走掉，再也不回来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2411
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_6015b2eb:

    # p "It could be.{w} It could mean no more orders. No more being told who you're supposed to be."
    p "可能是的。{w}可能意味着不再有命令。不再有人告诉你你应该成为谁。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2413
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_2e77c18a:

    # j "No more doing what my father wants, or what Mr. Hudson wants, or what anyone else thinks I should be doing."
    j "不再做我父亲，或者Hudson先生想让我做的事，或者任何其他人认为我应该做的事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2415
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_2e1bcdb1:

    # "He grips the railing firmly enough that you can see his knuckles whitening."
    "他紧紧抓着栏杆，用力到指关节发白。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2417
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_a92d5e15:

    # j "I used to dream about that—packing a bag and disappearing before sunrise."
    j "我曾梦想过那样的场景——收拾好行囊，在日出前消失无踪。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2419
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_ed518258:

    # p "Then why not now? This could be your chance."
    p "那为何不就趁现在呢？这可能是你的机会。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2421
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_0d7d004f:

    # j "Because it's just not that easy."
    j "因为这没那么简单。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2423
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_7e520ac7:

    # j "Leave, and then what?"
    j "离开，然后呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2425
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_4a21fc2f:

    # j "Starve?"
    j "饿死吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2427
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_a1c95780:

    # j "The world doesn't have much use for me, all I'll become is the disappointment he always says I'll become."
    j "这世上没什么地方用得着我，我最终只会变成他口中那个没出息的家伙。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2429
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_ce982785:

    # j "Just another stain on someone's boots."
    j "只是别人靴子上的又一个污点。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2433
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_153b78be:

    # "He lets out a quiet, humorless laugh."
    "他发出一声轻轻的、毫无幽默感的笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2435
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_d537cdfa:

    # j "Every time I think about leaving, I hear his voice in the back of my head. Not even words, but just the presence of it."
    j "每次我想离开，我都能在脑海深处听到他的声音。甚至不是话语，只是那种存在感。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2437
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_15e43b4a:

    # p "And if you come with me then nothing of that matters anymore."
    p "而如果你跟我一起走，那这一切就都不重要了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2442
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_76915f8b:

    # "He leans on the railing again, watching the water roll beneath the ship. Once again there is a long moment where neither of you speaks."
    "他又靠在栏杆上，看着船下的水流。又一次，你们俩沉默了很长一段时间。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2444
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_be4cbf21:

    # p "Julian?"
    p "Julian?"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2446
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_f05cfff7:

    # j "You should go."
    j "你应该走。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2448
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_38d1077c:

    # p "You should too."
    p "你也应该走。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2450
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_bc345239:

    # p "The world is waiting for you just as it is for me."
    p "世界在等着你，就像它在等着我一样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2452
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_70c04a56:

    # "He gives a faint, uncertain smile."
    "他露出一丝若有若无、不确定的微笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2454
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_b5630f1c:

    # j "You always make it sound easier than it is."
    j "你总是把事情说得比实际更容易。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2456
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_ed9ab8d7:

    # p "It's not easy. But it's worth it."
    p "这不容易。但值得。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2458
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_678fb0c9:

    # j "Then promise me something."
    j "那答应我一件事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2460
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_c68f6f84:

    # p "What's that?"
    p "什么事？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2462
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_d9924299:

    # j "When you get wherever you're going, just think of me.{w} Perhaps eventually I'll be able to follow suit."
    j "当你到达你要去的任何地方时，想想我。也许最终我也能效仿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2464
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_9ee4eb1f:

    # p "No.{w} Because you'll be with me when we reach that place."
    p "不。{w}因为当我们到达那个地方时，你会和我在一起。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2470
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_150feedc:

    # "You reach for his arm, and pull him a little closer."
    "你伸手抓住他的手臂，把他拉近了一点。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2472
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_c8dd9b27:

    # p "I don't have to think about it—you just have to take the first step with me."
    p "我不必去想它——你只需要和我一起迈出第一步。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2474
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_e42981d5:

    # p "Just come."
    p "来吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2476
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_cd8a15bf:

    # p "Right now."
    p "就现在。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2480
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_79013134:

    # j "[name]..."
    j "[name]..."

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2482
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_c81fd04e:

    # "But you realize you're holding on tighter than you meant to."
    "但你意识到你抓得比你预想中更紧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2484
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_24012510:

    # p "That dream of packing your belongings? It can come true right now."
    p "那个收拾行囊的梦想？它现在就可以实现。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2486
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_c4e63f78:

    # p "You don't even have to want it the way I do—you just have to dare to try and the rest will follow."
    p "你甚至不必像我那样渴望它——你只需要敢于尝试，剩下的自会随之而来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2488
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_9d87f4f5:

    # p "Trust me."
    p "相信我。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2490
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_2385f36d:

    # j "[name], I shouldn't..."
    j "[name]，我不应该……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2495
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_8797e0ab:

    # "He straightens, taking in a long breath of the midday air and the sunlight almost appears to be washing him pale."
    "他挺直身子，深吸了一口午后的空气，阳光几乎把他洗得苍白。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2497
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_010cf1f9:

    # j "I..."
    j "我……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2503
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_3bc2e20d:

    # j "I think think it's best if I leave you and head back down. I am..."
    j "我想……我想我最好离开你，回到下面去。我……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2505
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_45f99c8f:

    # j "I am..."
    j "我还是有点兴趣的……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2507
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_a4033ac7:

    # "He swallows harder than usual."
    "他吞咽得比平时更用力。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2509
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_23bc70b0:

    # j "Terrible at saying goodbye."
    j "很不擅长道别。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2511
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_b62eac3e:

    # j "Especially to friends, [name]."
    j "尤其是对朋友，[name]。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2513
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_4e10fe44:

    # "Julian..."
    "Julian……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2515
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_2c4499a9:

    # "Please..."
    "拜托……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2519
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_6604b96e:

    # j "I could help you pack your belongings if you like."
    j "如果你愿意，我可以帮你收拾行李。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2521
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_d1da2236:

    # p "You could still come."
    p "你仍然可以来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2523
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_61f819a5:

    # j "Just stop.{w} Please."
    j "别说了。{w}求你了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2525
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_julian_4e10fe44_1:

    # "Julian..."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2543
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_8c37c1e9:

    # "You look around for the black canine but—as usual—Wolf has an uncanny ability to disappear into thin air."
    "你环顾四周寻找那只黑色的犬科动物，但——像往常一样——Wolf有着离奇消失的本事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2548
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_48464864:

    # "But then again, he is very predicable when it comes to choosing the spots he retreats to."
    "但话说回来，在选择退避地点方面，他又是非常可预测的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2551
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_d2f4833f:

    # "Somewhere below deck, you think while descending into the ship—the world taking a moment for you to actually see in the dark again."
    "在甲板下的某个地方，你一边下到船舱里一边思考——世界花了一点时间让你再次在黑暗中看清东西。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2559
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_26532082:

    # "You pass along some of the spots where the hammocks would be hung up in the evening, but no Wolf yet."
    "你经过了一些晚上会挂吊床的地方，但还没见到Wolf。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2561
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_1825674e:

    # "Where might he be?"
    "他会在哪儿呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2563
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_65e444af:

    # "To find him you have to think like Wolf.{w} Become Wolf.{w} Where would you go right now if you were him?"
    "要找到他，你必须像Wolf一样思考。{w}成为Wolf。{w}如果你是现在的他，你会去哪里？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2565
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_1a79704a:

    # "With everyone getting ready to leave up top he must—no doubt—be somewhere under deck, and whichever is the furthe-"
    "既然大家都在上面准备离开，他肯定——毫无疑问——在甲板下的某个地方，而且是最远——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2567
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_4ed9d252:

    # "You suddenly stop in your tracks."
    "你突然停下了脚步。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2576
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_2a762413:

    # "Never mind. He's just sitting right there at one of the tables looking out at the sea through the opened port hole."
    "算了。他就坐在其中一张桌子旁，透过打开的舷窗望着大海。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2578
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_42b01cbe:

    # p "Hey."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2580
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_d6b59c2b:

    # "He tries to ignore you, but can't hide the brief flick of his ear."
    "他试图忽略你，但无法掩饰耳朵短暂的抽动。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2582
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_5e9bd6c4:

    # p "How's the view?"
    p "景色怎么样？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2584
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_e3f10185:

    # w "Quiet and pleasant until just now."
    w "直到刚才都很安静宜人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2586
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_856e0bf8:

    # p "Don't be like that. We might not see each other again, and least you can do is be nice to me, you know?"
    p "别这样了。你知道吗？我们可能再也见不到了，你至少对我好点吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2588
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_43aae41e:

    # w "Have they told you to leave already?"
    w "他们已经叫你离开了吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2590
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_8a7f8a02:

    # p "Not yet."
    p "没呢"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2592
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_131c60e0:

    # p "Been thinking they might wait. To give me the opportunity to leave on my own accord to preserve my pride or something."
    p "我一直在想他们可能会先等，算是给我个机会让我自愿离开，好保全我的尊严什么的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2594
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_a36154f4:

    # w "And let me guess: you didn't yet because you want to try to convince me to come with you?"
    w "让我猜猜：你还没走是因为你想试着说服我跟你一起走？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2596
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_00088185:

    # p "No...{w} Well-"
    p "不……{w}嗯——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2600
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_5e0cbb76:

    # w "Not this again..."
    w "别再来一遍了……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2602
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_20930500:

    # p "I just wanted-"
    p "我只是想——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2608
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_ca0e3a8f:

    # w "Listen..."
    w "听着……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2610
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_8ebc0c90:

    # p "to aks if you're really-"
    p "问问你是否真的——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2614
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_cc97b07e:

    # w "Listen to me."
    w "听我说。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2616
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_c42e737e:

    # "He turns to face you at last. You swallow your sentence and listen."
    "他终于转过身来面对你。你咽下要说的话，听着。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2620
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_28567724:

    # w "I understand that you're afraid of what's ahead. And I know you're reaching for any paw that might pull you out of the muck you find yourself in."
    w "我理解你对前路感到害怕。我也知道你在寻求任何可能把你从泥潭里拉出来的援助之手。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2622
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_dec14789:

    # w "But as much as you might want that to be the case—there's nothing I could do to make this easier for you."
    w "但尽管你可能希望如此——我无法让这件事变得对你来说更容易。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2624
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_fd740fd5:

    # w "If anything it's the opposite."
    w "如果我能改变什么的话，那跟你的想法恰恰相反。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2626
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_d7dff376:

    # w "My presence would only make your life more difficult."
    w "我的存在只会让你的生活更艰难。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2628
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_915af8f8:

    # w "Believe me."
    w "相信我。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2630
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_aadb17fb:

    # p "I don't think it would."
    p "我不这么认为。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2632
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_8d4415b0:

    # w "That's because you don't know me."
    w "那是因为你不了解我。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2636
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_ce5a36e5:

    # w "{i}Actually{/i} know me.{w} Beyond being a sailor you met two weeks ago who you shared the occasional meal with."
    w "{i}真正的{/i}了解我。{w}不仅仅是作为一个你两周前遇到、偶尔一起吃饭的水手。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2640
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_a10a5085:

    # w "{i}Actually{/i} know me.{w} Beyond being a sailor you met two weeks ago."
    w "{i}真正的{/i}了解我。{w}不仅仅是作为一个你两周前遇到的水手。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2642
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_e9103a70:

    # p "Then tell me.{w} Let me know you. Let {i}me{/i} decide what that means for me."
    p "那就告诉我。{w}让我了解你。{w}让{i}我{/i}来决定那对我意味着什么。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2644
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_d13fe1d1:

    # p "Then I can still make the decision if you are burden or not. Though I struggle to see how you could possibly be one, Wolf."
    p "那样我仍然可以决定你是不是个负担。尽管我很难想象你怎么可能会是，Wolf。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2650
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_26234a9c:

    # "His chest rises in a deep sigh before he stands up, causing the strung-up table to sway as steps out over the bench. For a moment, you think he might walk past you—but he doesn't. He just stands there, caught in the dim light filtering through the porthole."
    "他的胸膛随着一声深深的叹息起伏，然后他站起来，导致固定的桌子在他跨过长凳时摇晃了一下。有那么一瞬间，你以为他可能会从你身边走过——但他没有。他只是站在那里，沉浸在透过舷窗射进来的昏暗光线中。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2652
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_737c6f75:

    # w "It is not your decision to make. I am doing this for your sake just as much as my own, [name]."
    w "这不是由你决定的。我这么做既是为了我自己，也是为了你，[name]。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2654
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_dd0627c4:

    # "The sharpness in his tone fades, replaced by a quiet finality."
    "他语气中的尖锐褪去，被一种平静的决绝所取代。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2656
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_fe6df65e:

    # p "You don't know what you're talking about."
    p "你不知道你在说什么。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2658
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_79944440:

    # w "No, {i}you{/i} don't know what you're asking for. Some people on this earth aren't meant for society..."
    w "不，是{i}你{/i}不知道你在请求些什么。这个世上有些人注定不适合社会……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2660
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_3573d757:

    # w "Because it never ends well for those who stay close."
    w "因为对那些靠近的人来说，结局从来不会好。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2662
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_5f815775:

    # p "What do you mean?"
    p "你什么意思？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2664
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_f21c74be:

    # p "Do you think you'd hurt me?"
    p "你认为你会伤害我吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2666
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_58e136fa:

    # p "Don't be ridiculous."
    p "别开玩笑了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2668
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_b4c2c0ed:

    # p "I'm not a child that needs to be shielded."
    p "我不是需要被保护的小孩。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2672
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_ef2b091c:

    # w "You do not want what follows my steps. You may think you do, or tell yourself that you don't care, or simply that you are different from everyone else, but you are wrong."
    w "你不会想要跟随我的脚步所带来的东西。你可能以为你想，或者告诉自己你不在乎，或者仅仅是你和别人不一样，但你错了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2674
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_1a841740:

    # "For a fleeting second his eyes soften, though the expression is gone almost as soon as it appears."
    "有那么短暂的一瞬间，他的眼神柔和下来，尽管那表情几乎一出现就消失了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2676
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_01db89c4:

    # "He takes a step back, shaking his head once."
    "他后退一步，摇了摇头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2678
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_6a35a262:

    # w "I will not be coming."
    w "我不会来的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2680
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_475babce:

    # w "Now turn and leave."
    w "现在转身离开吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2682
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_94e84c43:

    # p "But-"
    p "但是——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2686
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_45a554b7:

    # w "LEAVE!"
    w "离开！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2688
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_9ec170b3:

    # "The word echoes off the planks of the hull louder than he meant it to be. His ears pin back, and he exhales sharply through his teeth."
    "这个词在船体的木板上回荡，声音比他预想得还要大。他的耳朵向后压平，牙齿间发出尖锐的呼气声。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2690
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_222a0983:

    # "You hesitate, and for just a heartbeat you see his expression break."
    "你犹豫了，就在心跳般的一瞬间，你看到他的表情崩溃了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2692
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_9e844449:

    # "Regret."
    "懊悔。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2696
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_8148dc43:

    # "Then it's gone."
    "然后它消失了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2698
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_7cad7e6d:

    # "He turns away, staring again at the sun-bleached horizon beyond the porthole."
    "他转过身去，再次凝视着舷窗外被阳光漂白的地平线。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2700
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_131189a5:

    # "And you're left with nothing but the sound of the sea and your own pulse in your ears."
    "而你只剩下海浪声和自己耳中的脉搏声。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2702
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_50dceea9:

    # "Left with nobody but yourself."
    "只剩下你自己一人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2704
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_875ce35a:

    # p ". . ."
    p ". . ."

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2706
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_9636d10b:

    # p "I'll...{w} I will miss you, Wolf."
    p "我……{w}我会想念你的，Wolf。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2708
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_8fb2c04e:

    # "He doesn't turn to face you, but you can see his head move slightly as if he wants to say something.{w} But doesn't."
    "他没有转身面对你，但你能看到他的头微微动了动，仿佛想说些什么。{w}但终究没有。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2710
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_a13599c9:

    # p "I will."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2712
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_b48aa2d3:

    # p "That's all."
    p "就这样"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2718
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_a8ccfbb9:

    # w "You really can't take a hint, can you?"
    w "你还真是看不懂眼色啊，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2720
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_d59e3d4d:

    # p "I just wanted to talk."
    p "我只是想谈谈。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2722
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_78dc5be7:

    # w "Then talk to someone else."
    w "那就去找别人谈。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2724
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_6474c44a:

    # "He doesn't look at you, instead he's fixed on the small circle of daylight spilling through the porthole."
    "他没有看你，而是凝视着舷窗外洒进来的一小圈日光。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2726
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_f1ea25ac:

    # p "I thought maybe we could—"
    p "我以为或许我们可以——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2728
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_fd374254:

    # w "You thought wrong."
    w "你想错了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2730
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_fb8f6bf4:

    # p "You don't have to be like this, you know."
    p "你不必这样的，你知道吗。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2734
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_baa13f9a:

    # w "Like what?"
    w "怎样？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2736
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_9fc1bd0e:

    # p "Being so cold. Like you don't care."
    p "这么冷漠。好像你根本不在乎。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2740
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_64b327f7:

    # w "Whether I care or not doesn't matter. What should matter to you is that you stop wasting your time here."
    w "我在不在乎并不重要。对你来说重要的是，别再在这里浪费时间了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2742
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_713860a6:

    # p "You're not even going to say goodbye?"
    p "你甚至不打算说声再见吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2744
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_397c1e8a:

    # w "What would that change?"
    w "那又能改变什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2746
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_6e479b51:

    # p "It would at least be nice to hear from you."
    p "至少能听到你道别，感觉会好一些。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2750
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_45630002:

    # w "Goodbye then."
    w "那就再见吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2752
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_902ad9fd:

    # w "I wish you luck with everything that you're facing."
    w "愿你面对的一切都能顺利。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2754
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_4620cc2b:

    # p "Wolf, you really don't want to come?"
    p "Wolf，你真的不想来吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2758
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_0ec29599:

    # w "Enough."
    w "够了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2760
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_48f3449b:

    # "There's no anger in his words, but they still land as firmly as the door that has been slammed shut."
    "他的话语里没有怒气，却依然像一扇猛然关上的门那样斩钉截铁。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2764
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_0983a4a1:

    # "He turns his back on you again, tail flicking once before going still."
    "他再次背过身去，尾巴甩了一下，然后静止不动。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2766
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_027b5395:

    # "For a while you just stand there, unsure what to say to perhaps have him consider leaving with you, but his silence makes it clear: there's nothing left to reach for."
    "有一阵子你只是站在那里，不知道该说什么才能让他考虑和你一起离开，但他的沉默已经说明了一切：再没什么可争取的了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2768
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_875ce35a_1:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2770
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_34818f15:

    # p "I guess that is goodbye then, Wolf."
    p "我想这就是告别了，Wolf。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2772
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_8aa965f2:

    # p "I wish you would have come along. See the kingdom together. Figure out a way back.{w} Or perhaps not."
    p "我真希望你能一起来。一起看看那个王国。想办法回去。{w}或者不回去也罢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2774
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_33e0e802:

    # p "But I understand."
    p "但我理解。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2776
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_f336a987:

    # p "It just was a pleasant dream."
    p "终究只是一场美梦罢了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2778
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_6f9e2fa9:

    # "He doesn't turn to face you."
    "他没有转身面对你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2780
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_43e8339b:

    # p "Goodbye."
    p "再见。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2782
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_b671632f:

    # p "I wish you luck in your future as well."
    p "也祝你未来一切顺利。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2784
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_8eeafed3:

    # p "And happiness."
    p "还有幸福。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2786
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_c678a122:

    # "Your voice cracks a little as the weight of your words finally settles."
    "当话语的重量终于沉淀下来时，你的声音微微有些哽咽。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2788
translate Chinese day14_leave_decision_wolf_d2fef322:

    # p "I really do."
    p "我是真心的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2820
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_f9f3c95e:

    # "While you wouldn't mind tagging along with the others, you are drawn in by the prospect of a quieter ship."
    "虽然不介意跟着和其他人同行，但你也向往更清静的船上时光。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2822
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_8c529588:

    # "The rest of the crew deboards. {w}Not all, though. As you look at them vanish off the piers, you notice a few aren't tagging along."
    "其他船员都下船了。{w}不过，并非所有人。当你看着他们消失在码头上时，你注意到有几个人没有跟着走。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2824
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_7f6c3e7a:

    # "You guess some folks simply prefer the ship. Or aren't fans of crowds."
    "你猜有些人就是更喜欢待在船上。或者不喜欢人群。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2826
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_4bb67f1c:

    # "Which explains why Wolf is nowhere to be seen. He's probably enjoying the silence somewhere on board."
    "这也就解释了为何不见Wolf的踪影。他大概正在船上的某个地方享受着这份宁静。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2828
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_0b572b34:

    # "It's quite therapeutic to see them chatting about what wonders the nearest tavern has in store—nodding or waving your goodbyes when they see you off with a warm see-you-soon."
    "看着他们聊着最近的酒馆有什么新奇玩意儿，感觉很是治愈——当他们热情地跟你道别，说着“回头见”时，你点头或挥手回应。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2832
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_211aa84a:

    # "And, courtesy of Julian, a playful elbow in your ribs and a \"Knew you couldn't hold your alcohol!\" in your ear."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2834
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_e3ed9d61:

    # "You thought it might sting to watch them, but..."
    "你以为看着他们离开可能会让你感到刺痛，但是……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2836
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_bd56fcd5:

    # "You're quite content."
    "你相当满足。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2840
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_0a47765c:

    # "Well perhaps, your ribs sting a little, though not entirely unpleasantly. Growing pains of a budding friendship."
    "好吧，也许你的肋骨确实有点刺痛，不过倒也不完全是坏事。算是萌芽中友谊的成长痛吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2844
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_4880b664:

    # "You had some time to think about it all."
    "你有了一些时间来思考这一切。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2846
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_a32e58a2:

    # "One always has on a ship, that much you've learned."
    "在船上总是有时间思考的，这一点你已经体会到了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2848
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_de3bd8cb:

    # "Time, the one thing you have an almost endless supply of."
    "时间，这对你来说几乎是取之不尽的东西。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2850
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_732daef9:

    # "About what he told you that night. How he feels about you."
    "思考他那天晚上对你说的话。他对你的感觉。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2852
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_b8b56358:

    # "{i}'A good friend.'{/i}"
    "{i}“一个好朋友。”{/i}"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2854
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_5bbd72aa:

    # "You know that you want to hold up your side of that bargain."
    "你知道你想信守你那部分的约定。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2856
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_39acddcc:

    # "He deserves that much."
    "他值得你这样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2858
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_6d9a6930:

    # "As do you."
    "你也一样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2862
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_9400b8a7:

    # "Or something more, perhaps. But you're thinking metaphorically."
    "或许，不止于此。但你这是在打比方。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2864
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_37820ea3:

    # "They'll all be back soon, and you'll spend even more time together. {w}You've been spending time together since this whole journey started. Entirely uninterrupted."
    "他们很快就会回来，你们还会有更多时间在一起。{w}自从这趟旅程开始，你们就一直在一起。完全没有被打断过。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2866
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_842c6f84:

    # "For the first time, alone with the wind and sun, you feel you can truly and finally relax."
    "此刻是你第一次独自与风和阳光相伴，你感觉终于可以真正放松下来了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2868
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_5923c62f:

    # "You breathe in the warm, salty air. Soft waves carry the sounds of hustling and bustling on the piers to your ears. {w}It's close, yet it feels so distant."
    "你呼吸着温暖咸涩的空气。轻柔的波浪将码头上熙熙攘攘的声音送到你耳边。{w}近在咫尺，却又感觉如此遥远。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2870
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_094493e4:

    # "You run a finger on the gunwale. {w}The {i}Conway{/i}. You can't say that you've grown to know her, yet, but as far as relationships go, there might be something brewing here."
    "你用手指划过船舷上缘。{w}{i}Conway{/i}。你还不能说已经逐渐了解了她，但就关系而言，这里或许正在酝酿着什么。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2874
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_658c1160:

    # "Perhaps not something quite as intimate of a relationship as with Julian, but an alluring one just the same."
    "或许不像和Julian的关系那样亲密，但同样具有吸引力。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2876
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_66a3747a:

    # "The old lady has been your whole world during these weeks. At times, you feared she was your prison. Other times, you felt she was your home."
    "这几个星期以来，这位老淑女就是你的整个世界。有时，你担心她是你的牢笼。有时，你又觉得她是你的家。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2878
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_c61ac368:

    # "And as you stare a new world in the eyes, for whatever reason you find you're in no hurry to leave her behind."
    "而当你凝视着一个新世界时，不知为何，你发现自己并不急于离开她。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2880
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_84d1c53b:

    # "{i}There's no rush{/i}, you think to yourself as you lean on the gunwale. What's a couple more hours after these long weeks."
    "{i}不急{/i}，你靠在船舷上想。在漫长的几周之后，再多几个小时又算什么呢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2882
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_af6d9a9e:

    # "Plus, you think, it feels wrong to leave while there's still people on duty. Take, for example, your beloved first mate, down there on the pier."
    "另外，你想，还有人在值班时就离开感觉不太对。比如说，你亲爱的大副，他就在下面的码头上。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2884
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_7f0a2f98:

    # "From your vantage position, you can see Arthur engaged in conversation with someone you don't recognize."
    "从你这有利位置望去，能看见Arthur正和一个陌生面孔交谈。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2886
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_0e55c14a:

    # "Were you a betting man, you'd put money on him being a representative of the local port authority, but you can't be sure."
    "如果你是个赌徒，你会押他是当地港务局的代表，但你也不能确定。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2888
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_b67349a2:

    # "It's no agitated discussion, but they seem to be disagreeing on something. Arthur is behaving with an unusual level of politeness, but you know him well enough to tell when something isn't going according to his design."
    "这不是激烈的争论，但他们似乎在某个问题上意见不合。Arthur表现出了非同寻常的礼貌，但你足够了解他，能看出事情没有按照他的计划进行。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2890
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_710c7e20:

    # "People-watching. You smirk. {w}It's been a while since you've felt relaxed enough to do that without worrying about consequences for your idleness."
    "观察人群。你微微一笑。{w}你很久没这般放松地消磨时光，而不必担心偷懒的后果了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2896
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_d3c48ced:

    # "You lean further forward, trying to get a better look. Arthur is unhappy, that much is for sure. The other person, firmly apologetic."
    "你更往前倾了倾身子，想看得更清楚些。Arthur并不高兴，这一点是肯定的。另一个人则态度坚决地表示歉意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2898
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_4cf34a0e:

    # "You have no idea how long their conversation is going to last for. And you know better than to butt in when the first mate is debating official-looking stuff."
    "你不知道他们的谈话会持续多久。而且你很清楚，当大副在讨论这些看起来是官方事务的事情时，最好不要插手。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2905
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_d998a0ff:

    # "You lean further in, but voices don't carry that far. Perhaps... you could sneak down there and catch the tail end of it?"
    "你又往前凑了凑，但声音传不了那么远。也许……你可以悄悄溜下去，听听他们谈话的结尾？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2911
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_f2107cd0:

    # "Suddenly, you feel something tapping your back."
    "突然，你感觉有什么东西轻轻拍了拍你的背。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2918
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_4ace47ef:

    # r "Please relieve your stomach somewhere else. There's a whole seafront at your disposal."
    r "请到别处去缓解你胃部的不适。整个海滨都可供你使用。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2920
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_6bf8485a:

    # "It takes a few moments for the gears in your brain to start spinning. {w}Then you realise what it looks like when a seaman leans forcefully over the gunwale."
    "你脑子里的齿轮转了几圈才反应过来。{w}然后你意识到，一个水手用力趴在船舷上时看起来会是什么样子。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2922
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_fdb5b9e4:

    # p "Oh! No, I'm not actually..."
    p "哦！不，我其实并没有……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2928
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_c87bedbf:

    # "Your explanation goes unheard however, as the cheetah is already on her way off the ship."
    "然而你的解释没人听见，因为那只猎豹已经在下船的路上了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2934
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_01dab0f3:

    # "You look after her for a brief moment, before turning your attention back to the docks. Arthur is still over there, still talking to that person."
    "你目送了她片刻，然后将注意力转回码头。Arthur还在那里，还在和那个人说话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2948
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_4105d86a:

    # "But you still have the whole day ahead of you. And a quiet ship is even more relaxing than you expected."
    "但你还有一整天的时间。而且一艘安静的船比你想象的更令人放松。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2953
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_ec9d10bd:

    # "Suddenly, you feel a hand patting your back."
    "突然，你感觉一只手拍了拍你的背。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2960
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_8afa05b8:

    # r "Don't worry, it happens to a lot of sailors on their first trip."
    r "别担心，很多水手第一次航行时都会这样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2962
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_8f989c0d:

    # "You stare at her in confusion."
    "你困惑地盯着她。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2964
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_5c23d482:

    # r "Although I have to say, usually it takes firm ground for {i}mal de debarquement{/i} to make an appearance. You might be particularly sensitive to it."
    r "不过我得说，通常{i}上岸晕眩症{/i}需要踏上坚实的地面才会出现。你可能是对此特别敏感。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2966
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_6bf8485a_1:

    # "It takes a few moments for the gears in your brain to start spinning. {w}Then you realise what it looks like when a seaman leans forcefully over the gunwale."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2968
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_4fbb6ce7:

    # p "Oh! Oh, I'm... I'm okay, actually. I wasn't, uh, vomiting or anything like that."
    p "哦！哦，我……我没事，真的。我没有，呃，呕吐或者类似那样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2970
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_069d1348:

    # p "Just taking a look at the docks. But... thank you for your concern."
    p "只是在看看码头。但是……谢谢你的关心。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2974
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_07dc2536:

    # "The cheetah smiles warmly."
    "猎豹温暖地笑了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2976
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_651fdd02:

    # r "No worries. Just remember to take care of yourself."
    r "没关系。记得照顾好自己就行。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2980
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_7995a26c:

    # r "On that specific topic, there's some medical supplies I need to track down. We've come a little too close to disaster for my liking, and I'd rather be safe than sorry next time someone gets hurt."
    r "说到这个，我需要去找一些医疗用品。我们之前差点就出事了，我不喜欢这样，下次再有人受伤时，我宁愿稳妥些，免得后悔。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2982
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_bbdbe390:

    # p "Isn't that a little negative? We've been through everything mostly unscathed, maybe we can start looking at the glass as half full."
    p "这会不会有点消极了？我们这一路上基本都安然无恙，也许我们可以开始乐观一点看问题。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2984
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_c916f729:

    # r "That's exactly what I'm worried about. Overconfidence kills more sailors than storms."
    r "这正是我担心的。自大杀死的水手比风暴还多。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2986
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_6561a198:

    # r "I'm going to make sure we have some spares around just in case. Space shouldn't be an issue, at least, and I've been given a little room in the budget to work with since out next leg is going to be longer."
    r "我要确保我们备有一些多余的用品以防万一。至少空间应该不是问题，而且因为下一段航程会更长，预算给了我一点余地。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2988
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_e61327dd:

    # "Extremely professional, but never cold. She cares, and she's just making sure. She's not concerned."
    "极其专业，但从不冷漠。她在乎，她只是在确保万无一失。她并非忧心忡忡。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2990
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_da78fda5:

    # "And yet..."
    "然而……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2994
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_13401cbb:

    # r "Don't worry. I'm also planning to spend some time—and money—on myself."
    r "别担心。我也计划花点时间——还有钱——在自己身上。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:2996
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_693d4ac9:

    # r "Details are yet to be determined. I'll see if they're offering anything in town that piques my curiosity."
    r "细节还没定。我去看看镇上有没有什么能引起我兴趣的东西。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3000
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_1ec894cc:

    # r "Or if it all gets spent on tea eventually. If only it would last longer, but it's best done when the mint leaves are still fresh."
    r "或者最后全花在茶叶上也行。要是能存久点就好了，但薄荷叶还是新鲜的时候泡最香。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3002
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_974b0416:

    # r "But I'll take dried ones over nothing, and I assume our passenger might appreciate the company around a cup or two."
    r "但有干的也比没有强，而且我想我们的乘客可能会乐意一起喝上一两杯。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3006
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_e6c247c4:

    # r "He's been getting getting more used to it by now, isn't he?"
    r "他现在应该已经更习惯了吧，不是吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3008
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_8fb052e4:

    # p "Nomax?"
    p "Nomax?"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3010
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_5c9ff614:

    # "She nods."
    "她点了点头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3012
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_fd158008:

    # r "You spend some time with occasionally, don't you?"
    r "你偶尔会和他待一会儿，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3014
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_b7ce229c:

    # p "It's certainly not as bad anymore as it was when I first met him."
    p "当然，情况已经不像我刚认识他时那么糟糕了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3016
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_255904b1:

    # p "Wouldn't say he's enjoying his time here, but he said the bouts of sickness are getting less common."
    p "不能说他在享受这里的时光，但他说恶心的发作次数越来越少了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3018
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_f204ac5b:

    # r "Good, he had asked me one day if I had anything. But there's not a whole lot I can do beyond handing him some ginger to calm the stomach."
    r "很好，有一天他还问我有没有什么东西。不过除了给他点姜片压压胃，我也做不了太多。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3020
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_5053c796:

    # r "If he'd be on deck more maybe he'd have a better time..."
    r "要是他能多在甲板上待待，或许感觉会好些……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3022
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_4c25b1f2:

    # "She's projecting an air of nonchalance."
    "她正摆出一副若无其事的样子。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3024
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_4e9cddf8:

    # "But you can tell something's going on under the surface."
    "但你能感觉到水面之下暗流涌动。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3026
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_36d945b5:

    # "And she's trying hard to hide it."
    "而且她在极力掩饰。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3030
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_c9f0ee32:

    # "There's a weight hidden behind her eyes, barely noticeable as they dart between the houses facing the docks."
    "她的眼神背后藏着一份沉重，在她扫视码头沿岸的房屋时，这份沉重几乎难以察觉。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3032
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_2f1d4ad0:

    # "You remember the talk you had about Arezki. The conflicting emotions that no doubt are coming to the surface now that home is within touching distance."
    "你记得你们谈论过Arezki。如今家乡近在咫尺，那些矛盾的情绪无疑正涌上心头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3036
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_bad3ce55:

    # "But you can't tell exactly what it is. {w}You get the feeling it's something personal, rather than malicious."
    "但你无法确切知道那是什么。{w}你觉得那是私人的事情，而非恶意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3038
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_0850cc3d:

    # "Maybe you're just imagining it. Hard to tell."
    "也许你只是多心了。很难说。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3042
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_a0e754d8:

    # "Your train of thought is interrupted before it can leave the station."
    "你的思绪还未发车，就被打断了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3044
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_1863e8ff:

    # r "I can't help but notice you haven't joined the others."
    r "我不禁注意到，你没和其他人一起。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3046
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_e81777ee:

    # p "Oh, yeah. I'm not the only one though. I noticed Wolf hasn't left yet."
    p "哦，是啊。不过不止我一个。我注意到Wolf也还没走呢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3050
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_e17b1bce:

    # r "That make sense, Arthur mentioned he asked for extra work. Suits him, I suppose."
    r "这说得通，Arthur提到他主动要求了额外的工作。我想这正合他意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3052
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_31ee83cd:

    # "There's a slightly awkward pause, filled by the gentle rumbling of waves."
    "一阵略显尴尬的停顿，只有轻柔的海浪声填补其间。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3054
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_ed7b275a:

    # r "So... Any specific plans for our stay?"
    r "那么……我们停留期间有什么具体计划吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3056
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_22663041:

    # "Rajeeyah... She speaks the local language. If exploring is what you're interested in, there's probably no better person to guide you around the place."
    "Rajeeyah……她会当地语言。如果你对探索感兴趣，大概没有比她更好的向导了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3058
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_676efe39:

    # "Then again, you're not sure she'd be okay with that. You wouldn't want to impose yourself."
    "话又说回来，你不确定她是否愿意。你不想强人所难。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3060
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_3524c72d:

    # "Not to mention the optics of your and her role in that as well. You're not on the same rung of the ladder."
    "更不用说你们俩在那件事中的角色和观感了。你们不在同一阶层。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3062
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_9e584757:

    # "Still... Something in her demeanor tells you she'd rather not be alone today. {w}But, again, she's being surprisingly hard to read."
    "不过……她的神态仍透出些许不愿今日独处的意味。{w}但话说回来，她此刻的心思又出奇地难以捉摸。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3064
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p "好吧……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3076
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_37e76ead:

    # p "I wanted to catch Mr. Hudson for a moment. There was still a question I had for him."
    p "我想找一下Hudson先生。我还有个问题要问他。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3078
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_eed91b90:

    # r "That's... not a plan, [name]."
    r "这……算不上计划，[name]。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3080
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_1617fe6e:

    # p "I know. One step after another."
    p "我知道。一步一步来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3084
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_00221f26:

    # r "Very well. I will leave you to it in that case."
    r "好吧。那样的话，我就不打扰你了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3092
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_2ee2296b:

    # p "I think I'll be taking it easy. Just relaxing a little, maybe I'll get a paw on land later."
    p "我想我会放松一下。就稍微休息休息，也许晚点再踏上陆地。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3094
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_19039624:

    # p "There's a surprising calmness on board right now. I'd like to enjoy it fully."
    p "船上此刻有一种令人惊讶的宁静。我想好好享受一番。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3098
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_f1ff2ec2:

    # "The cheetah chuckles. There's no derision in her eyes. She understands your need for something even quieter than calm waters."
    "猎豹轻笑了一声。她眼中没有嘲弄。她理解你对某种比平静水面更安静的东西的需求。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3100
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_9f39fa15:

    # r "I can relate to that. I've had many moments in my life when I wished I could seal the world outside my room and dive into some of my favorite books."
    r "我能理解。我一生中有很多时刻希望能把世界关在房门外，沉浸在我最喜欢的几本书里。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3104
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_2b89fef1:

    # p "I'm... not much of a reader myself. But I get what you mean."
    p "我……我自己不怎么读书。但我明白你的意思。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3106
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_15e184b6:

    # p "It's just nice to be able to forget everything for a while and exist in the moment."
    p "能暂时忘掉一切，活在当下，这种感觉就很好。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3108
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_8b15bf37:

    # "The wind blows. Lazily, a seagull calls another in the distance."
    "风吹过。远处，一只海鸥懒洋洋地呼唤着另一只。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3110
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_70cbe0b6:

    # r "Well, hope you can make the most of it. I'll be off then."
    r "好吧，希望你能好好享受。那我先走了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3116
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_98eafa0a:

    # "Rajeeyah hops onto the gangway, steadying herself against the light swaying of the ship. Her tail swishes in the wind as she walks the brief distance separating the two of you from dry land."
    "Rajeeyah跳上舷梯，在船身的轻微摇晃中稳住身子。在她走过那段将你们俩与陆地隔开的短短距离时，她的尾巴在风中摆动。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3118
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_7c898bdf:

    # "You watch her vanish among the hustle and bustle of the docks."
    "你看着她消失在码头熙熙攘攘的人群中。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3123
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_a69f86d1:

    # "Dry land, you think. There it is."
    "陆地，你想。就在那儿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3127
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_823e62a0:

    # "Stalls, wharfs, other ships. Buildings in the distance, older buildings further still."
    "货摊，码头，其他船只。远处的建筑，更远处是更古老的建筑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3132
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_5d74cf73:

    # "You squint. Ruins, still right where you saw them when you first made port."
    "你眯起眼睛。遗迹依然就在你初次进港时看到的位置。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3134
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_a0bc5cc6:

    # "You scan the docks for Arthur, but he's nowhere to be seen now—and neither is his conversation partner."
    "你在码头上搜寻Arthur的身影，但现在哪儿也看不到他——他的谈话对象也不见了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3139
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_22cdfe53:

    # "You shrug. No big deal. Maybe you'll learn what that was about from the ship's gossip. Some folks have a hard time keeping their mouth shut."
    "你耸耸肩。没什么大不了的。也许你能从船上的闲言碎语中知道那是怎么回事。总有些人管不住嘴。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3143
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_ba45e881:

    # "You massage the Julian-elbow-shaped ache in your ribs."
    "你揉了揉肋骨处那Julian式肘击留下的疼痛。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3149
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_fb3ffae0:

    # "You still feel in no rush to hop off the ship. {w}You take a walk around the deck, crossing path with a few crewmembers on their way to a day of drinking or the last few duties that can't be cancelled."
    "你仍然觉得不用急着下船。{w}你在甲板上走了一圈，遇到几个正要去喝一天酒或是处理最后几项无法取消的任务的船员。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3151
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_a724d303:

    # "But as time passes, relaxation gives way to boredom and idleness turns to restlessnes."
    "但随着时间的流逝，放松让位于无聊，闲散变成了坐立不安。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3153
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_1d9085bf:

    # "You watch a seagull land on the bowsprit. It screeches disharmoniously, then leaves."
    "你看着一只海鸥落在船首斜桅上。它刺耳地尖叫了一声，然后飞走了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3157
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_f1fe82be:

    # "You kick a cleat. Stoutly, it refuses to budge."
    "你踢了一下系缆墩。它坚固地杵着，纹丝不动。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3159
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_22eb129a:

    # "Then a thought strikes you. Rajeeyah mentioned Wolf was still on the ship. {w}Hmm."
    "这时，你突然想起一件事。Rajeeyah提到Wolf还在船上。{w}嗯。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3161
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_e729ec12:

    # "Might as well see what he's up to. It's not like you have anything better to do."
    "不如去看看他在干什么。反正你也没别的事可做。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3163
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_3ae8bc0b:

    # "You cross the deck again, looking for someone who might know where he's passing the time."
    "你再次穿过甲板，寻找可能知道他消磨时间地点的人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3171
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_e8fc9f09:

    # sailschwartz "Sorry, buddy. No idea."
    sailschwartz "抱歉，伙计。不知道。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3179
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_ce98a61c:

    # sailmullein "The loner guy? Haven't seen him all morning, no."
    sailmullein "那个独来独往的家伙？整个早上都没见过他，没有。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3187
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_9ee2fd4f:

    # sailmussel "Oh, Wolf? Saw him talking with Samuel, maybe an hour ago? No clue where he is now."
    sailmussel "哦，Wolf？我大概一小时前看到他和Samuel说话？不知道他现在在哪儿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3195
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_c1ad577a:

    # b "Oh yeah! I think I know where he's holed up."
    b "哦对了！我想我知道他窝在哪儿了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3197
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_d59f023b:

    # "Bandile is sitting on a crate, just as chipper in an empty common area as he is behind the pot at supper."
    "Bandile正坐在一个板条箱上，在空荡荡的公共区域里，他和晚餐时守在锅后面一样兴高采烈。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3199
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_a000dbc2:

    # "When you got here, the hare was staring at a piece of paper with uncharacteristic seriousness."
    "你过来时，这只野兔正一反常态地严肃盯着一张纸。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3201
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_64b7c630:

    # "You can't tell what it's about, but you see a rather significant amount of lines on it."
    "你看不出上面是什么，但能看到相当多的线条。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3203
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_1110533c:

    # "Your arrival snapped him back to his usual cheeriness, but something's bothering him, and he can't hide that."
    "你的到来让他恢复了往日的开朗，但有什么事情困扰着他，而他无法掩饰。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3205
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_63719219:

    # b "Samuel needed a volunteer for anchor watch and Wolf put his name forward. Haven't seen him since, but he's bound to be on deck somewhere."
    b "Samuel需要一个自愿值锚更的人，Wolf报了名。之后我就再没见过他，但他肯定在甲板上的某个地方。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3207
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_d6d7130b:

    # p "Thanks, Bandile. {w}Say, uh... That letter. Is it bad news?"
    p "谢谢，Bandile。{w}对了，呃……那封信。是坏消息吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3211
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_9ed4277e:

    # "The question provokes a very sincere burst of laughter in response."
    "这个问题引来了他一阵极其真诚的爆笑作为回应。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3213
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_14e3a73e:

    # b "That depends! Here, what does this say?"
    b "那要看情况！给，看看这上面写的什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3218
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_75d056ee:

    # "You grab the paper. It's not a letter, there's scribbles written on it—with some rather elegant penmanship, although clearly laid out in a hurry. {w}And numbers, quantities, varieties, and..."
    "你接过那张纸。这不是一封信，上面是些涂鸦——笔迹相当优雅，虽然明显是匆忙写就的。{w}还有数字，数量，种类，以及……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3220
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_38a71aca:

    # p "It's a grocery list. {w}I mean, uh, provisions."
    p "这是张购物清单。{w}我是说，呃，补给品清单。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3222
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_d33a8ed2:

    # b "Good to know! I was left this as my orders for the day."
    b "太好了！这是留给我的今日任务。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3224
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_b4c228ee:

    # b "What's it say, exactly?"
    b "具体写的是什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3226
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_cf7190ae:

    # p "Nothing out of the ordinary, just says to procure a list of food items, your available budget, and some special requests from officers..."
    p "没什么特别的，就是采购一系列食物，你的可用预算，还有一些长官的特殊要求……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3228
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_c8ea8a4a:

    # p "..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3230
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_39aa4f72:

    # p "... Wait, you don't know how to read?"
    p "……等等，你不识字？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3234
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_725e4224:

    # "Bandile's normally cheerful face contorts into a look of hurt and shame."
    "Bandile通常欢快的脸扭曲成了受伤和羞愧的表情。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3236
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_a183bffb:

    # "But as soon as you stammer your way through an \"I'm sorry\", he explodes into a fit of laughter."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3240
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_77185151:

    # b "I can't! Hah, your face... That was too good. Wish we had a mirror, you should have seen it!"
    b "我不识字！哈，你的表情……太精彩了。真希望我们有面镜子，你真该看看自己的样子！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3242
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_6f86333a:

    # p "Yeah, that was really funny. Sure managed to fool me into thinking you were illiterate."
    p "是啊，真好笑。确实成功骗到我了，让我以为你是文盲。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3246
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_361c3d35:

    # b "Oh no, that part's real. I can't read."
    b "哦不，那是真的。我不识字。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3248
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_fd5f55ba:

    # p "Oh."
    p "哦。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3252
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_586b9f25:

    # b "Yeah. Never had anyone teach me, or any real need for it."
    b "是啊。从来没人教过我，我也不太需要。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3254
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_7b3c948a:

    # b "I do most of my cooking from experience. Prepare a dish enough times and your measurements go from numbers to \"this feels about right.\" "
    b ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3256
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_393455b1:

    # b "The rest is just tasting and patience.{w} And knowing how much spice your audience can tolerate."
    b "剩下的就是品尝和耐心。{w}以及知道你的食客能承受多少香料。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3258
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_9cf8519b:

    # p "So... what do you usually do if you get an order in writing, then?"
    p "那么……如果你收到书面订单，通常怎么办？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3262
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_2f5d92f6:

    # "The hare grins."
    "野兔咧嘴笑了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3264
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_a3aab2f1:

    # b "I find someone who can read and hand it to them."
    b "我找个识字的人，把单子递给他。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3266
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_70ccb41e:

    # "You wonder if the hare is even able to conceive of feelings like chagrin or shame. His grin is a stalwart statement that the universe can't even chip him."
    "你不禁怀疑这只野兔是否理解懊恼或羞愧这类感情。他的咧嘴笑是一种坚定的宣告：整个宇宙都无法撼动他分毫。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3268
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_b2be4c02:

    # b "Hah, I've actually been practicing! I have people teach me letters and such when they're available."
    b "哈，其实我一直在练习！有空的时候，我就找人教我认字母什么的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3272
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_59a78a0f:

    # b "I figured, being able to read shop signs should be worth it, right?"
    b "我想，能看懂商店招牌应该很值得，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3274
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_6eb605a8:

    # "Yet, for a moment, the grin flickers. You spy a completely different emotion, buried behind those deep brown eyes."
    "然而，有那么一瞬间，那笑容闪烁了一下。你窥见了一种完全不同的情绪，埋藏在那深棕色眼眸的背后。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3276
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_47cdc8c9:

    # b "Truth be told, I thought I'd be able to handle written orders by now. It's... taking longer than planned."
    b "说实话，我以为到现在我就能处理书面订单了。这……比计划的要花更长时间。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3278
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_79e96a98:

    # "But as soon as you take notice, he's back to his usual chipper self."
    "但你一注意到，他就恢复了往常那活泼的样子。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3282
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_0eb4fa02:

    # b "So! What's on our grocery list for the day, then? Just read it to me, I'll take care of the rest."
    b "那么！我们今天的购物清单上都有什么？念给我听就行，剩下的我来搞定。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3284
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_b077084c:

    # p "All right. It's, uhm..."
    p "好吧。是，呃……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3291
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_c7bb7870:

    # "It's a rather long list. Vegetables, pork, oatmeal, cheese, flour, a significant amount of numbers and quantities requested to make sure the crew survives the rest of the trip, you assume."
    "这是一份相当长的清单。蔬菜、猪肉、燕麦片、奶酪、面粉，还有大量的数字和数量要求，你猜是为了确保船员们能撑过剩下的航程。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3293
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_a9db2f36:

    # "You doubt the poor cook could memorise all of it. You can barely remember the start after skimming halfway through."
    "你怀疑这位可怜的厨师记不住所有东西。你才浏览到一半，就几乎记不住开头了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3295
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_940cd62f:

    # p "It's a lot. A couple dozen different things. Are you sure you can remember it?"
    p "东西很多。几十种不同的东西。你确定你能记住？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3299
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_b31cb7c2:

    # "Bandile reigns his cheerful energy in to think. {w}After a few seconds, he snaps his fingers."
    "Bandile收敛起欢快劲儿，思考起来。{w}几秒钟后，他打了个响指。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3303
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_6650f6e1:

    # b "You're on shore leave, right? Or... supposed to be, at least."
    b "你正在休假，对吧？或者……至少应该是？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3305
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_675d3507:

    # p "Yep."
    p "是的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3309
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_9aa0aa6b:

    # "He winks at you, a complicit look in his eye."
    "他朝你眨眨眼，眼中带着一种心照不宣的神情。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3311
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_8cdf17dd:

    # b "How about this: come help with my shopping. You'll do the reading and I'll do the buying."
    b "这样如何：来帮我采购。你来念，我来买。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3313
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_d8f90f78:

    # b "I can make it worth your while. Trust me, owing me a favour can be worth more than gold."
    b "我不会让你白忙的。相信我，欠我一个人情可能比金子还值钱。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3317
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_53c7b98c:

    # b "It's going to be fun! Two strapping young lads adventuring in a foreign land. Imagine the stories we could tell of... market stalls and bargaining?"
    b "会很有趣的！两个健壮的小伙子在异国他乡冒险。想象一下我们能讲的故事……关于市场摊位和讨价还价？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3319
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_8bec626b:

    # b "I kid, of course. Folks need their time off and I'll manage."
    b "我开玩笑的，当然。大家需要休息时间，我自己能应付。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3321
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_7e33d988:

    # b "Always did!"
    b "一直都是这样！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3325
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_be292152:

    # b "But, if you really have nothing you'd rather be doing..."
    b "但是，如果你真的没有更想做的事情……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3329
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_f5c03e88:

    # "There aren't many crewmembers left on board, but you're sure Bandile would be able to find someone."
    "船上剩下的船员不多了，但你相信Bandile肯定能找到人帮忙。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3331
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_524677e7:

    # "There isn't a ship on the seas where the cook isn't the most beloved member of the crew.{w} Well, as long as they are halfway decent at what they do."
    "在海上，没有哪艘船的厨师不是最受船员爱戴的成员。{w} 当然，前提是他们厨艺还算过得去。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3333
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_eed292bd:

    # "Which is a bar he surpasses with ease, even if there is only so much one can do when all you have is peas pudding and hardtack."
    "这标准他轻松就能超越——虽说手头只有豌豆糊和硬饼干，能发挥的余地十分有限。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3335
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_950a4537:

    # "But, there's is no chance that Bandile won't be able to find a member of the crew to help him."
    "不过，Bandile绝对不可能找不到船员来帮他。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3337
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_731e1af0:

    # "First choice over meals and snacks draws people in like bees to a honey jar."
    "优先享用正餐和点心的权利，就像蜂蜜罐吸引蜜蜂一样吸引着人们。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3339
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_b62b0012:

    # "If that's what he meant by making it worth your while."
    "如果这就是他所说的“让你觉得值得”的意思。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3341
translate Chinese day14_stay_on_ship_13545065:

    # "That said, you're here, you have nothing to do.{w} It could be a good opportunity to finally get to know him a little more."
    "话虽如此，你人在这里，又无事可做。{w} 这或许是个好机会，终于可以多了解他一点了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3369
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a0cb372d:

    # a "I have seen sailors when they're not cooped up, Mr. O'Connor. You don't need to lie to me."
    a "O'Connor先生，我见过水手们没被关在船上的时候。你不用骗我。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3373
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d1b58b0c:

    # s "Just preservin' their sacred honor, sir."
    s "只是在维护他们神圣的荣誉罢了，长官。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3374
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e46feaf2:

    # a "Mr. Blackborow—you'll join them?"
    a "Blackborow先生——你要和他们一起去吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3375
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8f63d522:

    # pb "Figured I would if you don't mind, aye."
    pb "我想是的，如果你不介意的话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3376
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_36fc638e:

    # a "You should take the opportunity. But first: a word, if you please."
    a "你应该抓住这个机会。但首先：请听我说一句。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3381
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_361fc357:

    # pb "Yes, sir."
    pb ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3385
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b0f34b5f:

    # "The jackal turns to you and the others."
    "那只豺狼转向你和其他人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3386
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_156f19b5:

    # pb "On second thought: I'll manage."
    pb "我又想了一下：我自己能行。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3387
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_0e211cde:

    # j "You don't want us to wait?"
    j "你不想让我们等吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3394
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b913638e:

    # "He shakes his head, and Samuel makes the decision for all of you. When he starts to walk away, you and Julian follow without another word."
    "他摇了摇头，Samuel替你们所有人做了决定。当他转身离去时，你和Julian一言不发地跟了上去。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3407
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d4528231:

    # "Nomax is already at the bottom of the gangplank. The painted dog is placing one foot in front of the other, carefully, walking in a measured circle."
    "Nomax已经走到了跳板底部。那只彩绘犬正小心翼翼地，一脚前一脚后，迈着有分寸的步伐绕圈走。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3408
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_0eaddc1e:

    # p "Is something the matter?"
    p "有什么问题吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3413
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_0ea76bbd:

    # "He turns to you, his tail wagging in delight."
    "他转向你，尾巴高兴地摇晃着。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3414
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_7b0d40bf:

    # n "I truly didn't know how much I'd miss this. When you put your foot down, it lands {i}exactly{/i} where you intended it to."
    n "我真的不知道我有多想念这个——当你落脚时，它{i}正好{/i}落在你预想的位置。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3418
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_ddd5b57d:

    # "He glances over his shoulder, and gives you a nod."
    "他回头瞥了一眼，对你点了点头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3419
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_cf375e7b:

    # n "Yes. Please, don't mind me. Just reacquainting myself with the feeling of dry land."
    n "是的。请别管我。我只是在重新熟悉陆地的感觉。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3420
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_07fceafe:

    # "For your part, your first few steps on Moroccan soil are decidedly jarring. Like the painted dog, you've become accustomed to the constant swaying of the ship."
    "至于你，在摩洛哥土地上的最初几步确实有些颠簸不适。像那只彩绘犬一样，你已经习惯了船只持续的摇晃。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3421
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c5f62d63:

    # "Unlike him, you experienced it on deck, in rough weather."
    "和他不同，你是在甲板上、在恶劣天气中经历这些的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3422
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_81a7d7a1:

    # "Clinging to sodden rigging."
    "紧紧抓住湿透的缆索。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3423
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_43a20b7b:

    # "Trying not to pitch from the tops headlong to the deck below."
    "努力不从桅楼一头栽到下面的甲板上。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3424
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_781b279f:

    # p "It is a bit... odd."
    p "感觉有点……怪。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3430
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_00fb1e52:

    # "Sam thumps you warmly on the shoulder."
    "Sam热情地拍了拍你的肩膀。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3431
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_2b537bc8:

    # s "That's you becoming a sailor, like. You'll get used to it quickly."
    s "这就是水手的命，你很快就会习惯的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3433
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b96ba8f2:

    # s "You'll get your balance back soon enough, don't worry."
    s "你很快就能找回平衡感的，别担心。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3434
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_59729a0a:

    # "The leggy wolf, you can't help but notice, does not seem to have required much adjustment at all."
    "你不禁注意到，那只长腿狼似乎完全不需要什么调整。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3438
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_27b49a41:

    # j "Sea legs, that's what. We're sailors now, y'know?"
    j "这就是“海腿”嘛。我们现在是水手了，懂吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3441
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e9b1ae5a:

    # "He hops to the dock, swaying lightly back and forth to test his balance before nodding-evidently satisfied."
    "他跳到码头上，轻轻前后摇晃测试自己的平衡，然后点了点头，显然很满意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3442
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f296fa94:

    # j "Hopefully we'll get 'em back just as easily. Always did when I was sailing, anyhow."
    j "希望我们也能这么容易找回来。反正我当年航海时总是这样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3444
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_1ba661c4:

    # j "Welcome to being a sailor, [name]."
    j "欢迎加入水手的行列，[name]。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3445
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a9437574:

    # "When he steps onto the dock, he takes a cautious step to judge his own balance. Evidently satisfied, the lizard nods."
    "当他踏上码头时，他谨慎地迈出一步来判断自己的平衡感。蜥蜴显然很满意，点了点头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3446
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f7a3ea6b:

    # j "There we go. Hopefully, we'll get them back just as easily."
    j "这就对了。希望我们也能这么容易找回来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3453
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_6baeb2be:

    # n "Is this all of us? There was a fifth, I thought..."
    n "就我们这些人吗？我以为还有第五个……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3454
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c9d74490:

    # s "Perce. He has other things to do."
    s "Perce。他有别的事要做。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3455
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4833579f:

    # "You look back towards the ship. Perce and Arthur are talking, although the conversation doesn't seem especially acrimonious. You see the jackal nod a few times."
    "你回头看向船。Perce和Arthur正在交谈，虽然谈话看起来并不特别激烈。你看到那只豺狼点了几次头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3456
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_2ac1e8a5:

    # n "'Other things'?"
    n "“别的事”？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3459
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e63b7f2d:

    # s "So's not to be around me, for one, I imagine."
    s "我想其中一件就是别待在我身边。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3465
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_2b352c85:

    # "[He] grins, at the expression Nomax gives [him]. Perhaps the tension between the two hasn't been as obvious to the painted dog. In any case, the maned wolf presently shakes [his] head."
    "[他]
  咧嘴笑了，对着Nomax做给[他]的表情。也许这两只之间的紧张关系对彩绘犬来说没那么明显。无论如何，鬃狼此刻只是摇了摇头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3468
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_08779cea:

    # s "No, it's nothin'. Just told us to go on ahead."
    s "不，没什么。只是让我们先走。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3474
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_5c3fca21:

    # j "His loss. Me, I intend to stretch my legs as much as I can."
    j "那是他的损失。至于我，我打算尽可能舒展我的腿脚。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3475
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_17f40e0e:

    # s "God, but you can say that again, to be sure."
    s "天啊，这话你可真说对了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3476
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_79d7bf42:

    # j "I intend-"
    j "我打算——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3480
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f4a9f748:

    # s "Don't push it."
    s "别得寸进尺。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3487
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f495658e:

    # "Samuel, like Julian, is in a good mood. As you make your way down the pier and towards the bustle of the docks themselves, [he] leads the way, continuing some earlier thought as [he] does so."
    "Samuel和Julian一样心情很好。当你们沿着码头走向繁忙的码头区时，[他]在前面带路，一边继续着之前的一些思考。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3488
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e731d3dc:

    # s "I bet you anything, if you asked Perce why he didn't want us to wait, he'd tell you: oh, the harbor towns are oh so boring. T'isn't so."
    s "我敢跟你打赌，如果你问Perce为什么不想让我们等，他会告诉你：哦，港口城镇都无聊透顶。才不是这样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3491
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_93be50a0:

    # p "No?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3492
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_5445cac2:

    # s "How could they be with every harbor being so different? Might find one of them markets—goods off a caravan, like. Don't have those back home."
    s "每个港口都千差万别，怎么待得腻？兴许能碰上那种集市——驮队运来的货，咱老家可没有。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3494
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_61c4789c:

    # p "Cloth, I believe. Rajeeyah said that her family is active in that trade, further north. They must come down here to sell them, at least."
    p "好像是布匹。Rajeeyah提过她家在更北边做这生意。至少得来这儿卖货吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3496
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_19425aa8:

    # n "Textiles. They're well known for those. The bazaars will be quite colorful, I'm sure."
    n "还有纺织品。他们以这个闻名。我敢肯定集市会五彩缤纷。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3497
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a4fd1db8:

    # j "Silk?"
    j "丝绸呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3498
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_683f6ebe:

    # s "Maybe not."
    s "可能没有。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3501
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a71a9295:

    # j "You'd look good in silk! Think about it! We could attire you quite foppishly. Maybe-"
    j "你穿丝绸会很好看！想想看！我们可以把你打扮得相当花哨。也许——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3505
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c4fa5cb9:

    # "Sam pauses, turns, and gives the lizard a weary glare."
    "Sam停下来，转身，给了蜥蜴一个疲惫的瞪视。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3506
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e89ad8a8:

    # s "I said don't push it, Julian."
    s "我说了别得寸进尺，Julian。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3508
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_ad5423c0:

    # p "Oh, I don't know, Sam. You might look very stylish."
    p "哦，我不知道，Sam。你穿起来可能很时髦。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3509
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4ba2d0e1:

    # s "Not you, too. I can find a drink on my own, sure, if I've to look after the both of you children this whole time..."
    s "你别也来了。如果整个时间我都要照看你们两个小孩子的话，我当然可以选择自己去找杯喝的……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3510
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_809920d7:

    # p "Wait until we see the clothes. Maybe you'll change your mind."
    p "等我们看到衣服再说。也许你会改变主意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3528
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_0cad93c9:

    # "The inner harbor throngs with people. Many of them are dressed in loose-fitting robes, attired—you assume—as the locals must be. Others have more familiar-looking clothes."
    "内港挤满了人。他们中许多人穿着宽松的长袍，你猜想这一定是当地人的装束。其他人则穿着你更熟悉的衣服。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3529
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d57ce7e0:

    # "A few look even look like soldiers, or constables perhaps, with shiny buttons that catch the summer light and blaze fiercely."
    "有几个甚至看起来像士兵，或者可能是警察，扣子闪闪发亮，反射着夏日阳光，格外耀眼。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3530
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_2565f09d:

    # "The languages, too, are a rich mixture. None of them are comprehensible to you, although you recognize a few snatches of what you take to be French."
    "连语言也是混杂的盛宴。你一句也听不懂，不过偶尔能捕捉到几个像是法语的片段。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3534
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e9a7471d:

    # "Samuel, fearlessly, taps a lady in the crowd seemingly at random. When she turns, Sam pantomimes raising a drink to [his] muzzle."
    "Samuel大胆地随机拍了拍人群中的一位女士。当她转过身，Samuel比划着把饮料举到[他]口鼻前的动作。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3535
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a18f70c1:

    # s "Where's the bar? Is there a bar here?"
    s "酒吧在哪儿？这里有酒吧吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3536
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f9c4a371:

    # s "Bar.{w} Drink."
    s "酒吧。{w} 喝。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3537
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_3eede575:

    # wolfe "{i}Atay?{w} Akhi, bayt alshay jahid fi almadina.{/i}"
    wolfe "{i}茶？{w}兄弟，城里有家茶馆不错。（此处为阿拉伯语，摩洛哥的官方语言，下同）{/i}"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3540
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_dc94d03d:

    # s "Er—no. Um..."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3541
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_190c3db5:

    # "[He] repeats the gesture again, pretending to lift a pint glass. The woman, a little perplexed, tries a second time."
    "[他] 再次重复这个手势，假装举起一个品脱杯。那位女士有点困惑，又试了一次。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3542
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d52326b7:

    # wolfe "{i}Atay, na'am? Tay?{w} Alshay bin na'na? Akhi-{/i}"
    wolfe "{i}薄荷甜茶是吗，还是就是茶?{w} 薄荷茶呢? 兄弟-{/i}"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3544
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_2d85f8a6:

    # n "{i}Nana{/i}? Ah! He's, ah-not a teahouse, right, Mr. O'Connor? You don't want tea?"
    n "{i}Nana{/i}？啊！他，呃——不是要茶馆，对吧，O'Connor先生？你不想喝茶吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3547
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_3ecccafd:

    # s "No. A bar. Beer—is that the word?{w} 'Beer'?{w} Alcohol?"
    s "不。酒吧。啤酒——是这个词吗？{w} “啤酒”？{w} 酒？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3548
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e6641e02:

    # "Recognition dawns in the woman's face. She echoes the word to Samuel, then gestures with her paw further down the docks, where you do seem to spot a cluster of people who are dressed rather more like the four of you."
    "那位女士脸上露出了恍然大悟的表情。她对Samuel重复了那个词，然后用爪子指向码头更远处，你确实似乎看到了一群穿着更像你们四个的人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3551
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_19293fff:

    # s "Thanks, mate."
    s "谢了，伙计。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3554
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_3608822e:

    # "You try your best to recall some of the words you've heard before coming into the harbor."
    "你尽力回忆进港前听到的一些词。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3557
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_ad3fd5ac:

    # p "{i}Shukran?{/i}"
    p "{i}Shukran?（谢谢？）{/i}"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3562
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_7ef133b7:

    # "The woman raises an eyebrow, although she seems more amused than anything. At least you haven't insulted her—you think."
    "那位女士扬起了眉毛，不过她似乎更多的是觉得有趣。至少你没有冒犯她——你这么想。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3563
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_0f633ec3:

    # wolfe "{i}Afwa'an{/i}."
    wolfe ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3575
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_6efda85e:

    # "Fortunately, Sam's lanky body and big ears make [him] easy to pick out in a crowd, and [he] hasn't gotten too far away."
    "幸运的是，Sam瘦长的身材和大耳朵让[他]在人群中很容易被认出来，而且[他]还没走太远。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3576
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_da70eb79:

    # j "How did you know what he was asking?"
    j "你怎么知道他在问什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3579
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8b821909:

    # n "Oh. Well. A lucky guess, in part, to tell you the truth. He said 'tay,' though. That's the word for 'tea' in many languages, as you know."
    n "哦。嗯。说实话，一部分是靠幸运的猜测。不过他说了“tay”。你知道，那是许多语言里“茶”的词。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3582
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_548f87d3:

    # j "Oh, sure. Who doesn't know that?"
    j "哦，当然。谁不知道这个？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3585
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_27fc0d8f:

    # n "But then he said {i}na'na{/i}, the word for 'mint' in Arabic, and mint tea is a local delicacy. I believe the most common cultivar is a cross between what you call spearmint and wintermint, though..."
    n "但然后他说了
  {i}na'na{/i}，阿拉伯语里“薄荷”的词，薄荷茶是当地的一种特色饮品。我相信最常见的栽培品种是你们叫做留兰香和冬薄荷的杂交种，不过……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3588
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_64f4b5a3:

    # "The painted dog trails off, and as you make your way through the thick crowd he catches himself only at the last minute from running into someone coming the other way."
    "彩绘犬的话音渐弱，当你们穿过密集的人群时，他在最后一刻才刹住脚，差点撞上迎面走来的人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3592
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c7da9a22:

    # n "Goodness—apologies!{w} No—that is to say—I realize I should try to find a sample for my collection. Perhaps not in steeped form."
    n "天哪——抱歉！{w} 不——我是说——我意识到我应该试着为我的收藏找个样本。也许不是以泡好的形式。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3595
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e3f23cca:

    # p "What was the rest of it? What else did he say?"
    p "剩下的呢？他还说了什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3598
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_eb0cfc36:

    # n "Oh! I assure you, [name], I have no idea. I just heard 'mint.'"
    n "哦！我向你保证，[name]，我不知道。我只听到了“薄荷”。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3600
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b181a66c:

    # j "Right. And the rest of it?"
    j "好吧。那其他部分呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3603
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9de44843:

    # n "I have no idea, to tell you the truth. I just heard 'mint.'"
    n "说实话，我不知道。我只听到了“薄荷”。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3605
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_99e81cd6:

    # n "I'd looked into it out of curiosity. It's the same word in Hebrew and Aramaic. I'd wondered if it was related somehow to 'ananas,' but it turns out that's simply a coincidence."
    n "我出于好奇查过。在希伯来语和阿拉姆语里是同一个词。我曾想知道它是否和“ananas”有关联，但结果发现那只是巧合。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3609
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e69c6a14:

    # p "What's 'ananas'?"
    p "“Ananas”是什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3613
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d701d36c:

    # s "It's a-{i}none of ye've{/i} noticed we're here, they're serving, and I'm standing like a bloody cactus with me throat still parched and nowt in me paw. And that's a crime, sure 'tis."
    s "这是一个——{i}你们都没{/i}发现我们到了这儿，人家正招呼着，我还跟棵仙人掌似的傻站着，嗓子干得冒烟，爪子空空？这可是罪过，千真万确。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3615
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b557c272:

    # s "First round's on me, 'cause... well, you've barely been with us. Even if you did manage to squeeze an advance from our purser, I doubt it'd be a lot."
    s "第一轮我请客，因为……嗯，你跟我们在一起没多久。即使你真从我们的军需官那里挤出了预支款，我猜也不会多。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3616
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_6218f3f6:

    # s "Like, but you can just owe me. And I wouldn't presume, Nomax. You'll have a drink, though? Beer?"
    s "不过，你可以先欠着。我不会强求的，Nomax。但你总要喝一杯吧？喝啤酒吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3617
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_42442786:

    # n "Wine, please."
    n "请给我来杯葡萄酒。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3618
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_292d1a5c:

    # s "And what do you want, [name]?"
    s "那你想要喝什么，[name]？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3621
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_bed866cb:

    # s "{cps=5000}And what do you want, [name]?{/cps}" nointeract
    s "{cps=5000}你想要喝什么， [name]?{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3633
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_7780ad99:

    # s "Wine?{w} Are you getting fancy on me?"
    s "葡萄酒？{w}你这是在跟我摆谱吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3635
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9b39c485:

    # s "You want me to ask for it to sparkle as well, like?"
    s "你是不是还想让我搞杯带气泡的，嗯？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3637
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4a681479:

    # "Samuel holds [his] expression for a while before breaking character with a soft laugh."
    "Samuel绷着脸好一会儿，才忍不住轻笑出声，打破了角色。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3639
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_94b2d3e3:

    # s "Pulling your tail, man. I'll see if I can stumble my way to getting some."
    s "逗你玩呢，伙计。我去看看能不能瞎撞大运弄到点儿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3645
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f1e9e6cb:

    # s "The fuck am I suppose to do with that?"
    s "这他妈的叫我怎么办？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3649
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_82c60689:

    # "Sam's lips pull into a subtle smirk."
    "Sam的嘴角勾起一丝不易察觉的坏笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3651
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a63938c3:

    # s "Fine, I'll get you 'anything'. I don't want to hear any complains though."
    s "行吧，我就给你弄“随便什么就行”。不过到时候可别抱怨。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3656
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_1f15005e:

    # "Samuel winks, and shoulders [his] way through the crowd. This part of the harbor {i}does{/i} feel more like being at home. You think you can even pick up a little conversation in your own tongue, though the accent isn't quite familiar."
    "Samuel眨眨眼，用肩膀挤开人群。港口的这片区域确实更有家的感觉。你觉得自己甚至能听到几句乡音，虽然口音听着不太熟。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3657
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_140e2f7f:

    # "Of course, back home you were still a kitten. The short voyage at sea hasn't changed {i}everything{/i}, but you do feel like a different person. And nobody here knows who you are to argue otherwise."
    "当然，在家乡时你还是个只小猫咪呢。短暂的航海生涯并未改变一切，但你的确感觉像换了个人。而且这儿没人知道你的底细，无从辩驳。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3670
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_92bb81e6:

    # n "Pineapple."
    n "菠萝。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3671
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3672
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d94523f6:

    # n "'Ananas' means pineapple. Not related to the Aramaic root, of course."
    n "“Ananas”就是菠萝的意思。当然，跟阿拉姆语词根没关系。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3673
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a5b024a9:

    # p "I don't know what a pineapple is, either."
    p "我也不知道菠萝是什么。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3674
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_12478121:

    # n "That's why you travel with a botanist! Well, actually, I've never seen one in person."
    n "所以你得跟个植物学家一起旅行嘛！好吧，其实我也没见过实物。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3676
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b1c36a5f:

    # n "It's a pineapple."
    n "那是菠萝。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3677
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a8f0a50f:

    # p "A what?"
    p "什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3678
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c1c21cdb:

    # n "The ananas is a pineapple."
    n "Ananas就是菠萝。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3679
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_7dc0e7dd:

    # p "Nomax, I don't think I quite follow."
    p "Nomax，我想我没太跟上你的意思。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3683
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a1fed569:

    # n "It's the same thin-..."
    n "这是同一个东——……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3684
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_34c4650b:

    # j "Guys, I think you two are talking past one another at this point."
    j "伙计们，我觉得你俩现在是在各说各话了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3688
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_5296f26a:

    # "Samuel reappears, four mugs clasped with remarkable deftness in [his] paws. [he] jerks [his] muzzle in the direction of a table with just enough room for you to squeeze in, if the existing patrons are willing to scoot over a bit."
    "Samuel重新出现，四只大酒杯被[他]用爪子异常灵巧地抓着。[他]用口鼻朝一张桌子方向努了努，那张桌子刚好够你们挤进去，只要现有的客人愿意挪一挪。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3701
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_61b7cf4c:

    # "Fortunately, between you, Julian's winning smile, and Samuel's approach, they do so relatively obligingly."
    "幸运的是，介于你们、Julian那迷人的笑容以及Samuel的交涉，他们还算比较配合地挪了位置。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3704
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_3a7b6cc0:

    # "Samuel sets the mugs down heavily and maneuvers [his] way to sit opposite you. You put yourself between them and Nomax, who takes the seat next to you carefully."
    "Samuel重重地放下酒杯，挪动身子坐到了你对面。你坐在了他们和Nomax中间，Nomax则小心翼翼地在你旁边坐下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3717
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_61b7cf4c_1:

    # "Fortunately, between you, Julian's winning smile, and Samuel's approach, they do so relatively obligingly."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3721
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_54b8d9a6:

    # "Julian takes the seat next to you, taking two of the mugs from Samuel to make it a little easier for the maned wolf to maneuver. [He] takes the seat opposite you, leaving Nomax on the outside."
    "Julian在你旁边坐下，从Samuel手里接过两个酒杯，好让那只鬃狼更方便挪动。[他]坐在了你对面，让Nomax坐在了外侧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3722
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_5a1f5bf6:

    # s "So, then. Cheers, all. Welcome to Mogador."
    s "那么，来。大家干杯。欢迎来到摩加多尔。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3726
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_297ed3a6:

    # "Judging by [his] expression, the beer is not what [he] was expecting. It's not really what you were expecting, either, although just being able to drink without worrying the next wave will spill it all over your shirt does much to make the experience more pleasant."
    "看[他]的表情，这啤酒显然不合预期。其实这也不是你所期待的，不过，能安心喝酒，不用担心下一波浪花把酒全洒在衬衫上可大大提升了这次体验的愉悦感。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3731
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_0de1c78a:

    # "Judging by [his] expression, the beer is not what [he] was expecting. The first sip of your wine isn't really what you were expecting, either, although just being able to drink without worrying the next wave will spill it all over your shirt does much to make the experience more pleasant."
    "看[他]的表情，这啤酒显然不合预期。其实你啜饮的第一口葡萄酒也并非跟你所期待的一样，不过，能安心喝酒，不用担心下一波浪花把酒全洒在衬衫上可大大提升了这次体验的愉悦感。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3735
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_270436cc:

    # "You look into your own mug and see it filled with some white liquid."
    "你看向自己的杯子，发现里面装满了某种白色液体。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3737
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_68f21914:

    # p "Milk?"
    p "牛奶？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3739
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_36dc10fb:

    # s "What? I got you 'anything'."
    s "怎么？我给你弄了“随便什么都行”。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3741
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_da8af315:

    # "You can't help but laugh as Samuel brings [his] mug to [his] lips without missing a beat."
    "你忍不住笑了出来，Samuel则毫不停顿地把杯子举到唇边。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3743
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_0b0c5cdf:

    # "Judging by [his] expression, the beer is not what [he] was expecting. Neither is your milk when you give it a try. It's taste is saltier than what you're used to, and has a strange creaminess to it."
    "看他的表情，这啤酒显然不合预期。你尝了尝你的牛奶，也不是你习惯的味道。它比你喝惯的咸一些，还有一种奇怪的乳脂感。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3745
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_326f184e:

    # "You almost think that it may have gone off, but the taste isn't quite that."
    "你几乎要认为它可能变质了，但味道又不太像。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3747
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_db0281a4:

    # s "How's your anything?"
    s "你的“随便什么都行”怎么样？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3749
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_950a31f7:

    # p "Strange..."
    p "奇怪……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3751
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9c9c31bc:

    # s "Good."
    s "不错"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3753
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4e6f372c:

    # p "It's not cow's milk, is it?"
    p "这不是牛奶吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3755
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_ef453836:

    # "Samuel just shrugs in response."
    "Samuel只是耸了耸肩作为回应。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3757
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_fae1b47f:

    # s "How would I know? Guy there didn't understand a word. I just made animal noises in the hopes he'd figure it out."
    s "我怎么会知道？那家伙一个字都听不懂。我就学动物叫，指望他能明白。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3759
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_be61aada:

    # s "The beer is different as well though."
    s "不过这啤酒尝起来也不同。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3761
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c4bb106a:

    # s "I think somebody told me them are dry cities, on this coast. Can't imagine that's true, though."
    s "我记得有人跟我说过，这片海岸的城市是禁酒的。但很难想象这是真的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3767
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_74b2bb6f:

    # n "Is it not? I had heard the same thing."
    n "不是吗？我也听说了同样的事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3771
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_7b3aebfe:

    # s "With sailors, man? {w}You show me a port with sailors passing through it that claims to be dry, so, and I'll show you a port with a still in every privy, shed, carriage-house an' anything else that locks."
    s "有水手的地方，伙计？你指给我看一个声称禁酒却有水手来往的港口，我就能指给你看一个每间厕所、棚屋、马车房，但凡能上锁的地方都藏着酿酒器的港口。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3775
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a6991104:

    # n "I defer to your experience, Mr. O'Connor."
    n "O'Connor先生，我尊重您的经验。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3776
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_59fb77b6:

    # s "They'll find a way to get drunk in Mogador easy as they do in the most rum-soaked harbor in the West Indies. See if one or two of our boys don't need the lash by the time we weigh anchor..."
    s "他们在摩加多尔找酒喝会跟在西印度群岛最浸透朗姆酒的港口一样容易。等着瞧吧，等我们起锚时，看我们的人里会不会有一两个需要挨鞭子……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3777
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_899109e5:

    # p "What exactly {i}are{/i} we going to be doing while we're here?"
    p "我们待在这里期间，具体{i}到底{/i}要做什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3786
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_eef59f78:

    # j "Besides keeping Mr. Nomax company."
    j "除了陪Nomax先生之外。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3794
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_0af43557:

    # s "Well, we're waiting to take on some cargo. Bandile an' Raj, they'll be wanting to look for supplies, too, and all them's needing to be loaded. By hand, like, too, mark my words. Sure didn't see a crane."
    s "嗯，我们在等着装货。Bandile和Raj他们也要去找补给，所有这些都得装船。而且，听好了，都得用手搬。我肯定没看到起重机。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3795
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c2603c90:

    # s "But not right now. It's fine to expect a bit of relaxing, sure."
    s "但不是现在。期待放松一下当然没问题。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3796
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_918f9ddd:

    # p "Yeah?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3797
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_34487dec:

    # s "Aye."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3799
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_73ff1d3d:

    # "[He] leans back, closing [his] eyes to enjoy the gentle stretch the chair provides [his] back, then stares down into [his] mug and takes another healthy pull."
    "[他]向后靠去，闭上眼睛享受椅子给背部带来的舒缓拉伸，然后低头盯着杯子，又豪饮了一大口。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3800
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8680b5a8:

    # s "Don't need so many sailors for a watch in port. Bit of mending for the rigging and the sails, an' if the carpenter wants help, I suppose. Truth is, {i}Conway{/i} ain't the most glamorous ship an' this ain't the kindest voyage."
    s "驻港值勤用不着这么多水手。修修索具帆布，或者木匠要帮手的话搭把手。我说真的，{i}Conway{/i}算不上多体面的船，这趟也不是什么美差。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3804
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_408066ee:

    # s "The gentlemen know it's easier to let the crew stretch their legs than to try and stop us."
    s "绅士们都知道，试图阻止我们不如让我们上岸活动活动腿脚。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3814
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b0e53025:

    # j "I heard that as well. My father said that port calls are the worst time for a captain."
    j "我也听说过。我父亲说过，靠港停泊是船长最头疼的时候。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3815
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_db1f5e1a:

    # p "Why?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3816
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_27703975:

    # j "Imagine being out there for a month or two, with nothing but blue sea around you."
    j "想象一下在外面待上一两个月，周围除了蓝海什么都没有。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3817
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_35e52a5c:

    # j "If you've been at sea for a while... everyone's tired of it, stressed... sick, a lot of them. If you let the rates touch dry land, they're not going to come back. A lot of times you have to do the opposite."
    j "如果你在海上待了一段时间……每个人都厌倦了，压力大……很多人都生病了。如果你让水手们踏上陆地，他们就不会回来了。很多时候你不得不反其道而行之。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3818
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_96857dd9:

    # p "The opposite?"
    p "反其道而行之？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3819
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_3384d9f1:

    # j "Send a boat ashore with a party to round up replacements."
    j "派一艘小艇上岸，带一队人去搜罗替补人员。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3829
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_1351adde:

    # s "No surprise there. All the backbreaking work of being a sailor {i}and{/i} you get your sorry arse shot at? Not for me, to be sure."
    s "没什么好奇怪的。当水手既要做所有累断腰的活儿，{i}还{/i}可能挨枪子儿？这肯定不适合我。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3830
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_cefbc6e1:

    # s "I may be an idiot wanting to be a sailor, but I'm not stupid enough to seek hire in the Navy."
    s "我可能是个想当水手的傻瓜，但还没傻到去海军找活干。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3839
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_88029f2b:

    # j "No, not me either."
    j "我也不想去。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3840
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_5227521e:

    # "Sam gives him a wry look."
    "Sam给了他一个揶揄的眼神。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3850
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_93cf950d:

    # s "Ah, what are you talking about? You'd be an officer, anyway. Get a nice uniform out of it."
    s "啊，你在说什么呢？你怎么说也是长官，能混身漂亮制服穿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3851
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8866c7ab:

    # j "I doubt it. That's why I'm on a merchant ship, anyway."
    j "我可不指望。要不我怎么在商船上混呢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3852
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_41a21407:

    # s "Fancypants father wouldn't buy you a commission?"
    s "你那讲究的老爹不肯给你买个军衔？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3853
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_04f0bc78:

    # s "You said he wanted nothin' more than see ya in a strapping uniform among the gents."
    s "你说过他最大的愿望就是看到你穿着笔挺的制服，跻身绅士之列。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3863
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_ab6f826d:

    # j "{i}I{/i} didn't want it."
    j "{i}是{/i} 是我不想。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3864
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8b6e5da5:

    # s "Mm. Well, you remember that when the press-gang comes for you. Could've been an officer and a gentleman."
    s "嗯。好吧，等强征队来找你的时候，记住这话。你本可以成为长官和绅士的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3866
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3867
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_5d712e60:

    # s "Could've been an officer, at least."
    s "至少也会是个长官。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3871
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e0abfba9:

    # "Julian leans over to look into your mug and you watch as his expression sours."
    "Julian凑过来看你的杯子，你看着他的表情变得难看。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3875
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b9389580:

    # j "Ah bloody-...{w} I forgot you got that stupid milk..."
    j "啊，该死的——……{w}我忘了你拿的是杯蠢牛奶……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3877
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8b00e880:

    # j "Now I can't even steal some as payback for all those insults."
    j "现在我想偷喝点作为所有那些侮辱的报复都不行了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3883
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_1d6b672c:

    # s "You still could."
    s "你仍然可以。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3885
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_5224bd71:

    # p "Yeah, it tastes odd but I wouldn't call it bad."
    p "是啊，味道是怪，但我不觉得难喝。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3887
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a9c00ed9:

    # p "Just different."
    p "只是不太一样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3889
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_1f6d2e33:

    # j "Stealing milk just doesn't have the same flair to it..."
    j "偷牛奶可没那种报复的感觉……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3893
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_bd908eb1:

    # "Julian leans over to look into your mug. Then he grabs it, for a moment, and steals a drink."
    "Julian凑过来看你的杯子。然后他一把抓过去，偷喝了一口。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3897
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_3466e33e:

    # j "That's payback! For you all insulting me!"
    j "这是报复！为了你们所有人侮辱我！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3905
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8f43820b:

    # s "{i}This{/i} beer? Was it worth it?"
    s "就{i}这{/i}啤酒？值吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3908
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_569c4634:

    # j "No, not really."
    j "不太值。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3912
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_99276b1d:

    # s "Was the wine worth it?"
    s "那葡萄酒值吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3915
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_11f75765:

    # j "Just as strange as the beer unfortunately."
    j "可惜，跟啤酒一样怪。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3923
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_0bc8e258:

    # j "Yes, yes. I have a hard life, I know. I'm getting to like this, though. Now, Mogador...{w} Mogador should be a lot of fun."
    j "是是是。我知道，我命苦。不过我开始喜欢这个了。现在，摩加多尔……{w}摩加多尔应该会很有趣。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3924
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_695093c3:

    # s "And hard work."
    s "而且会很辛苦。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3925
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_eb16931b:

    # "Julian takes Samuel's teasing, offered over the rim of [his] mug, in stride."
    "Julian对Samuel的隔杯调侃泰然处之。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3929
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_6219d22e:

    # j "We're working hard right now. Aren't we, sir? We're helping you..."
    j "我们现在就在努力工作啊。不是吗，先生？我们在帮你……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3945
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_3e7505ab:

    # n "Oh."
    n ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3946
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e159088e:

    # "Nomax blinks, as if he hadn't been expecting to be drawn in to the conversation."
    "Nomax 眨了眨眼，仿佛没料到会被拉进谈话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3952
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_2ccd9263:

    # n "Well, I... I'm traveling on the ship to collect samples, as you know. The local flora and fauna that might be valuable—that's what my patron wants."
    n "嗯，我……我乘船旅行是为了采集样本，你们知道的。当地可能会存在有价值的动植物——这是我的赞助人想要的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3956
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f13e9f64:

    # n "It's intended that my work commence when we reach our destination. However, since I've not been to any of these places, I hope I might make every stop useful."
    n "原本计划是等我们到达目的地后，我的工作才开始。不过，既然我没到过这些地方，我希望我能利用好每个停靠点。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3957
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d6f53e4b:

    # p "Useful?"
    p "利用？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3961
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f01d2284:

    # n "Yes. Perhaps I might find some unexpected new plant or medicine that might be profitable back home. Even a new variety of mint! Certain classes crave novelty, it seems."
    n "是的。也许我能发现一些意想不到的新植物或药物，在家乡可能有得赚。甚至是一种新的薄荷！某些阶层似乎渴望新奇事物。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3965
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_181b9af7:

    # s "So you're just going to... wander into every shop and see what's for sale, then? How do you even start?"
    s "所以你就打算……逛遍每家店铺，看看有什么卖的，是吗？那你怎么开始呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3969
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_038e8d73:

    # n "I have some of my books. The diagrams in them are quite scientific... any apothecarist would be able to make sense of them. They might fill in gaps, for all I know."
    n "我带了一些书。里面的插图非常科学……任何药剂师都能看懂。据我所知，它们或许能填补一些空白。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3970
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a037509e:

    # n "This is my opportunity to feel... well, productive, I suppose."
    n "这是我感受……嗯，我想是，有所作为的机会。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3987
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_efdbd7e2:

    # j "You know... isn't that a good point?"
    j "你们知道吗……这不是个好机会吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3991
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a5d42d2b:

    # n "What is?"
    n "什么机会？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3992
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_ef0c5b5a:

    # j "We're not earning our pay when the ship's in port. And I don't have a patron, at least. You don't, [name]. You, Sam?"
    j "船在港口时我们可没薪水拿。至少我没有赞助人。你没有，[name]。你呢，Sam？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3993
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a140146f:

    # s "Are you scheming, Julian?"
    s "你在打什么算盘，Julian?"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3996
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_1e92b381:

    # "He finishes his beer and sets it on the table without looking. You follow the lizard's attention, over to where a different group has gathered. They seem, from what you can tell, to be playing some kind of game."
    "他喝完啤酒，看也不看就把杯子搁在桌上。你的目光跟着那只蜥蜴的注意力，转向另一群聚集的人，他们似乎在玩某种游戏。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:3999
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_99809e91:

    # j "I would never 'scheme,' Sam.{w} But I do know what language they're speaking."
    j "我从来不“打算盘”，Sam。{w} 但我确实知道他们在说什么话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4003
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4dc40d3c:

    # s "You do?"
    s "你知道？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4007
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8b7fd06a:

    # j "'Dice,' I'm pretty sure. Everyone speaks that."
    j "我敢肯定是“骰子语”。人人都懂这个。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4008
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4d38f03a:

    # "He gives you the kind of conspiratorial look that almost lets you picture the sight of dice in his hands. It is also the kind of look that tells you the idea of browsing apothecaries for interesting herbs must be terminally boring to him."
    "他朝你投来一种密谋般的眼神，几乎能让你想象出他手里攥着骰子的样子。那眼神也告诉你，对他来说，逛药铺找有趣草药的想法肯定无聊透顶了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4009
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d0ee7ada:

    # "The group of gamblers looks quite cosmopolitan—other sailors, mainly. Young, like the two of you. Julian clearly sees the prospect for excitement. You suspect that it's also an opportunity to see a rather different side of this new city..."
    "那群赌徒看起来相当国际化——主要是其他地方的水手。年轻，就像你们两个一样。Julian显然看到了找乐子的前景。你怀疑这也是个能见识这座新城市另一面的机会……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4010
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_ddb7c5fb:

    # j "I think it's time I make an introduction."
    j "我想是时候去打个招呼了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4021
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c0022aad:

    # p "I haven't even finished my beer yet. I'll try to find you later, though."
    p "我的啤酒还没喝完呢。不过，我晚点会试着去找你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4024
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9dc0c300:

    # p "I haven't even finished my wine yet. I'll try to find you later, though."
    p "我的葡萄酒还没喝完呢。不过，我晚点会试着去找你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4028
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_3fbbb9d8:

    # p "I haven't even finished my milk yet. I'll try to find you later, though."
    p "我的牛奶还没喝完呢。不过，我晚点会试着去找你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4034
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a07fd2e7:

    # j "What? Lost your taste for some games?"
    j "怎么？对玩几把游戏没兴趣了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4036
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_fb95b29d:

    # p "It's not that. Just want to stick with them for a little longer."
    p "不是。我只是想再和他们多待一会儿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4040
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_7f32fe30:

    # j "Or are you just scared of doing so badly that you lose your pants again?"
    j "还是说，你只是怕又输得连裤子都不剩？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4044
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8b24c4ab:

    # j "He ever told you-"
    j "他跟你提过——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4046
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4c4656f8:

    # s "You have, when we were out in the burning seas. Or have you forgotten already?"
    s "提过，在那片沸腾的海上。怎么，你忘了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4048
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_929037c8:

    # j "Oh, yeah..."
    j "哦，是啊……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4052
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_de8c3a69:

    # j "Have I ever told you two?"
    j "我告诉过你们两个吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4054
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f200b136:

    # p "You don't have to tell them-"
    p "你不用告诉他们——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4056
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_3845ad59:

    # j "Perhaps my greatest win ever, I tell ya."
    j "也许是我有史以来最棒的一次胜利，我跟你说。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4058
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9417ab0b:

    # j "And such a perfect idea, too."
    j "而且也是个绝妙的主意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4062
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c55aafa1:

    # "He chuckles to himself."
    "他自顾自地轻笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4064
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4e06c015:

    # j "Just flicked the dice and got the perfect view. Lemme tell ya, if ya can, would recommend winning a bet against him."
    j "就那么一弹骰子，就看到了完美的点数。我跟你说，如果可以的话，我推荐你跟他赌一把赢了他。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4066
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_435dbe17:

    # "You feel the heat bundle under the fur of your cheeks."
    "你感觉到脸颊的毛发下涌起一股热意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4068
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_115812c2:

    # p "Don't give them any ideas."
    p "别给他们递话茬。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4070
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8d5a6a4a:

    # n "I'm not a gambling man. So the gentleman doesn't have to worry about me at least."
    n "我不是个赌徒。所以这位绅士至少不用担心我。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4072
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_bba19234:

    # s "I will keep it in mind."
    s "我会记住的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4074
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_6605798f:

    # p "Alright, I think they might be starting without you, Julian. Better get your tail over there rather than getting further into the details."
    p "好了，我想他们可能不等你就开始了，Julian。你最好赶紧过去，别在这儿细说个没完了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4076
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9c3ebc4f:

    # p "I might catch you later."
    p "我可能晚点再来找你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4080
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c94ea9a7:

    # j "Oh, sure, once I've already run them out of money."
    j "哦，当然，等我先把他们的钱赢光。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4090
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4538c7ea:

    # s "Or got yourself stabbed."
    s "或者你自己被捅一刀。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4093
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_781edee2:

    # "Julian sticks out his tongue and leaves the three of you. You can't help but notice that the boisterous young lizard puts his boyish charisma to full effect. Whether they understand what he's saying or not, the others make room for him immediately."
    "Julian吐了吐舌头，离开了你们三个。你不禁注意到，这只喧闹的年轻蜥蜴将他那孩子气的魅力发挥得淋漓尽致。不管他们听不听得懂他说的话，其他人立刻给他让出了位置。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4096
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d3de4353:

    # p "So, do you think you'll be able to find what your patron's looking for?"
    p "那么，你觉得你能找到你赞助人要的东西吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4104
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_46679935:

    # "The painted dog, whose attention had been lingering on Julian, turns back to you and Samuel."
    "那只花斑犬的注意力刚才还停留在Julian身上，现在转回到你和Samuel这边。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4108
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_2776a444:

    # n "I don't really expect so, to be honest. Most of the plants and herbs in North Africa are already quite well known. Still! You never know when you might discover something new."
    n "说实话，我并不真的指望能。北非的大多数植物和草药已经相当广为人知了。不过！你永远不知道什么时候会发现新东西。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4109
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_76e966af:

    # p "Even if you don't know what you're looking for?"
    p "即使你并不知道自己在找什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4113
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_134761f9:

    # n "{i}Especially{/i} if you don't know what you're looking for. I'm not terribly adventurous, but I do plan to sample the local culture where I can. As long as I'm here..."
    n "{i}尤其是{/i}在你不知道自己在找什么的时候。我不是个非常爱冒险的人，但我确实计划在力所能及的地方体验当地文化。既然我在这里……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4114
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_25a71968:

    # s "Not just the bar, you mean?"
    s "你的意思是，不只在酒吧里？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4118
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b7b18fbd:

    # n "No, no. This is a fascinating city: quite new, and yet some of it is... well, as old as Carthage, I believe. I shall at least try some of that tea. And a bath, depending on how comfortable I feel with the language..."
    n "不，不。这是座迷人的城市：相当新，但其中有些部分……嗯，我相信，和迦太基一样古老。我至少会尝尝那种茶。还有洗个澡，这些都取决于我对当地语言的掌握程度让我感觉有多自在……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4125
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_da723e5e:

    # s "Cor. {i}I{/i} want a bath."
    s "天哪。{i}我{/i}想洗个澡。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4126
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d3ef15a7:

    # n "You should avail yourself! It's supposed to be a land of bathhouses. A habit they learned from the Romans, I think."
    n "你应该好好利用这里！这里应该是个澡堂遍地的国度。我想是他们从罗马人那里学来的习惯。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4127
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_75eabe5e:

    # s "Guessing you don't know the word for that one?"
    s "我猜你不知道那个词怎么说？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4131
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c1c26b1b:

    # n "I do not. Rajeeyah said it at dinner some nights ago, though, so with any luck I'll recognize it."
    n "我不知道。不过，Rajeeyah几天前吃晚饭时说过，所以运气好的话，我应该能认出来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4132
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_cc9430e4:

    # "The maned wolf is captivated by the idea. Perhaps not unsurprisingly so."
    "鬃狼被这个想法迷住了。也许这并不令人意外。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4134
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8872e5b4:

    # s "A nice bath... warm, too, must be..."
    s "洗个舒服的澡……还得是热水，一定……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4135
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d1f64b1f:

    # s "No, {i}is{/i} one of the greatest things to do when getting back on land."
    s "不，{i}绝对是{/i}回到陆地上后最棒的事情之一。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4136
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_12f7da32:

    # p "It being warm would be nice. I wasn't expecting the desert to be so brisk."
    p "要是热水就好了。我没想到沙漠会这么冷飕飕的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4139
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_57e14a2e:

    # s "It's the ocean that's brisk. Even this far south... why do you think I keep tellin' you and the others not to fall in? Concerned for your comfort, I am. I—oh."
    s "冷飕飕的是大海。即使到了这么南边……你以为我为什么老告诉你和其他人别掉进去？我可是在关心你们舒不舒服。我——哦。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4143
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_bdbd5257:

    # p "Hm?"
    p "嗯？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4145
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_acc8355e:

    # "Perce's voice provides the answer both to why Sam cut [himself] off, and why [his] expression has changed."
    "Perce的声音解答了为什么Sam突然打住话头，以及为什么[他]的表情变了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4149
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_40d8232c:

    # pb "Smart lads. Found a bar already and you've, ah... lost the little prince, have ya?"
    pb "聪明的小伙子们。你们已经找到酒吧了，而且，啊……把那位小王子弄丢了，是吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4150
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_ca288a2d:

    # p "Julian found a dice game. He was... well, he was over there a minute ago; they might've moved on."
    p "Julian发现了一个骰子局。他……嗯，他刚才还在那边；他们可能已经挪地方了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4154
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_2b4c217d:

    # pb "How's the beer? They know how to make it?"
    pb "啤酒怎么样？他们酿得好吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4157
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_aa8bc1bf:

    # s "You can find out, if you want. [name], do you mind?"
    s "你可以试试看，如果你想的话。[name]，你介意吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4158
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_dd491bf9:

    # p "I don't mind, no, but... you said yourself that-"
    p "我不介意，但是……你自己说过——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4161
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d8e0cec8:

    # s "Did Julian finish his? Maybe you can try."
    s "Julian喝完了他的吗？也许你可以尝尝。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4162
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_76945c43:

    # "Perce picks up the cup to check."
    "Perce拿起杯子检查。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4163
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b1f6e33b:

    # p "I think he finished his."
    p "我想他喝完了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4165
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e1d61294:

    # "Judging by his expression it must be empty, but he tries to get out whatever drops remain in it anyway."
    "看他的表情，杯子肯定是空了，但他还是试图把里面剩下的几滴弄出来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4167
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9553d7ad:

    # "Judging by his expression it must be empty, his expression sours even further when he goes to check yours."
    "看他的表情，杯子肯定是空了，当他去检查你的杯子时，他的表情变得更难看了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4169
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_aa2065bd:

    # pb "Milk? {w}Really?"
    pb "牛奶？{w}真的假的？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4171
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_fb6bafd1:

    # "There is a palpable disappointment to his sigh as he goes for Julian's empty cup, and tries to get out whatever drops remain in it anyway."
    "他叹了口气，失望之情显而易见，然后他拿起Julian的空杯子，试图把里面剩下的几滴弄出来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4176
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_335f753b:

    # s "Oh. Right."
    s "哦。好吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4177
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f2105670:

    # "[He]'s already started going through [his] pockets, and you suspect no amount of protest is going to get you out of sparing the maned wolf the difficulty of unfolding [his] lanky body from behind the table."
    "[他]已经开始翻[他]的口袋了，你怀疑无论怎么抗议，都无法让这只鬃狼免于费劲地把[他]那瘦长的身躯从桌子后面挪出来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4178
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_cf816279:

    # p "I don't even know what the local currency is..."
    p "我连本地货币是什么都不知道……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4181
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_1375041f:

    # s "They'll take whatever's got precious metal in them. So... let me count 'em out—these ya do owe me for. Don't think I'll forget just 'cause I like ya."
    s "只要是含贵金属的东西他们都收。所以……让我数数——你确实欠我这么多。别以为我喜欢你就会忘了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4182
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_892f6149:

    # "Samuel flashes you a grin before handing over the coins."
    "Samuel咧嘴朝你一笑，然后把硬币递了过来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4185
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_5162a1a1:

    # s "They'll take whatever's got precious metal in them. This ought to do for it. And don't think I'm givin' this to you, either. Keep track of that up here."
    s "只要是含贵金属的东西他们都收。这个应该够了。也别以为我是白给你的。记在这里。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4186
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8c74028d:

    # "The maned wolf taps [his] head, then gives you the coins."
    "鬃狼敲了敲[他]的脑袋，然后把硬币给了你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4192
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e37b4b55:

    # "You shoulder your way through the gathered crowd, setting the mugs down on the countertop. When you have the bartender's attention, you point to them, hold up four fingers, and place your money where he can see it."
    "你挤过聚集的人群，把杯子放在柜台上。当酒保注意到你时，你指了指杯子，竖起四根手指，并把你的钱放在他能看到的地方。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4196
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_03c72b7d:

    # "He counts the coins, then shakes his head. You put on the sternest expression you can, stabbing your finger at the coins. Finally, grumbling, he takes your money, and the mugs, and disappears. When he returns, they've been refilled."
    "他数了数硬币，然后摇了摇头。你摆出你能做出的最严厉的表情，用手指戳着那些硬币。最后，他咕哝着收下你的钱和杯子，消失了。等他回来时，杯子已经被重新斟满。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4198
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4eab65fe:

    # "With what was in them before, you hope, and nothing else."
    "你希望里面装的是之前那种东西，而不是别的什么。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4202
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9490b3e3:

    # "On second though... maybe you should have tried to explain to not refill yours with that milk again..."
    "转念一想……也许你该试着解释一下，别再用那种牛奶给你续杯了……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4204
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8b19326e:

    # "Too late now."
    "现在太迟了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4208
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_7172b45d:

    # "At least it looks and smells the same. Samuel wouldn't have set you up for failure, would [he]? Gathering the drinks and reflecting on how easily [he] carried them, you're given pause to appreciate the maned wolf's skill."
    "至少看起来和闻起来都一样。Samuel不会坑你，对吧？你端起饮料，回想[他]之前拿得多么轻松，不由得停顿了一下欣赏起鬃狼的本事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4209
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_411ed85a:

    # "When you return to the table, Perce is shaking his head and giving a dismissive wave of his paw."
    "当你回到桌边时，Perce正摇着头，用爪子做了个打发的手势。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4210
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_64b89fed:

    # pb "...yet, but they'll smooth it over."
    pb "……还没，但他们会搞定的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4214
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_ffee3cce:

    # "You put the mugs down, and Perce takes his with a nod of thanks. He also downs a solid quarter of the mug with the first pull."
    "你把杯子放下，Perce接过他的，点头表示感谢。他第一口就喝掉了足足四分之一杯。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4215
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_433c6451:

    # pb "Shit, but what can you expect? Anyway. Arthur's no fool, Sam."
    pb "妈的，但你能指望什么呢？不管怎样，Arthur不是傻瓜，Sam。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4219
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d72351dc:

    # s "It's not about who's a fool, it's about who can speak the language needed to fix it."
    s "这不是谁是不是傻瓜的问题，是谁能用管用的语言把事解决。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4228
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8b10bedd:

    # n "Mr. Blackborow was explaining that the animals we're supposed to be loading are nowhere in appearance. Absconded with, it would seem."
    n "Blackborow先生解释说，本该装载的牲口至今踪影全无。看起来像是被卷跑了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4229
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_8ec61e1b:

    # pb "They didn't get a 'sconded,' whatever that is. They got stolen."
    pb "不管那词是什么意思，它们不是被“卷”跑的。它们是被偷了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4233
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c87d3e68:

    # n "Er... yes. Resold to someone else."
    n "呃……是的。转卖给其他人了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4236
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_5d01f8fa:

    # s "Well, on the bright side, you'll have more time to collect those samples."
    s "好吧，往好处想，你会有更多时间收集那些样本了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4240
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4d63a533:

    # n "A good way to appreciate the positive side of our situation, yes. And we should {i}definitely{/i} have that bath, in that case."
    n "真是个欣赏我们处境积极一面的好方法。那样的话，我们{i}绝对{/i}该去洗个澡。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4251
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f8e7977a:

    # pb "You too? Heard Raj saying something about that. I was gonna offer to go with, but it turns out ya can't."
    pb "你也去？听Raj说过这事。我本来想提议一起去，但结果发现你不能去。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4252
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f80918ea:

    # p "Can't?"
    p "不能？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4256
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_85091cb8:

    # pb "There's one for the sailors, see? But they put all the bitches in a different one, so you can't look. What's the point, right?"
    pb "有水手专用的，明白吗？但他们把所有的小妞儿都安排在另一个澡堂，所以你看不到。那还有什么意思，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4257
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d31db7cd:

    # "Perce rolls his eyes, and takes another long drink of his beer."
    "Perce翻了翻白眼，又长长地喝了一口啤酒。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4261
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_5d5c22bd:

    # pb "Might try anyway, though. Never know what they'll let you do for a bit of coin. You know a good one, mate?"
    pb "不过，我可能还是想试试。你永远不知道给点钱他们会允许你做什么。你知道有什么好地方吗，伙计？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4265
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_fc053e79:

    # n "I do not, no."
    n "我不知道。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4269
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_42a8177f:

    # pb "Well, when you find out. Reckon I'll stay on the ship, for the most part. Keeping busy. But I can make an excuse for the right reason."
    pb "好吧，等你打听了。我想我大部分时间会待在船上。找点事做。但如果有合适的理由，我可以找个借口出来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4270
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_78a439a9:

    # p "Keeping busy? Did there turn out to be much to do?"
    p "找点事做？原来有很多事要做吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4271
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d961b7bf:

    # pb "Not yet. That's why I'm out here. And not for you, probably."
    pb "还没有。这就是为什么我在这儿。而且可能不是为了你们。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4272
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_81d10924:

    # p "When the cargo arrives, though."
    p "不过，等货物到了就会有很多事了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4276
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_4c4a4ba6:

    # "The jackal shrugs, finishing his drink. He looks around, captivated in the same fashion Julian was by the activity elsewhere in the docks."
    "豺狼耸耸肩，喝完了他的酒。他环顾四周，和Julian一样被码头别处的活动吸引住了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4279
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9bfb5f21:

    # pb "Ah! There he is."
    pb "啊！他在那儿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4283
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_f3d8562e:

    # "He pushes the chair back and gets up, neck outstretched to get a better look out the door."
    "他把椅子往后一推站起来，伸长脖子想更好地看清门外。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4285
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_09438d15:

    # "Perce tries to flag down whoever he saw, but seems to fail in his attempt. His muzzle shapes into an annoyed snarl."
    "Perce试图招呼他看到的那个家伙，但似乎没有成功。他的口鼻扭曲成一个恼怒的咆哮状。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4287
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_eb3258bc:

    # pb "Fucking hell, is that son of a bitch blind or what?"
    pb "他妈的，那混蛋是瞎了还是怎么的？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4289
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_2f76a232:

    # pb "You, how about we take a little walk after him?"
    pb "你，咱们跟在他后面溜达一圈怎么样？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4291
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_6ece47e1:

    # "He points at you and gestures you to get up out of your chair."
    "他指着你，示意你从椅子上起来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4293
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_7171d29e:

    # p "Me?"
    p "我？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4295
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a560859e:

    # pb "I ain't seeing anyone in your lap.{w} Of course you."
    pb "我可没瞧见你腿上坐着谁。{w} 当然是你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4299
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_dd37b36b:

    # "...Or, given the way he licks his muzzle, not the {i}exact{/i} same fashion. It's something altogether more predatory."
    "……或者说，鉴于他舔舐口鼻的样子，并非{i}完全{/i}相同。那姿态全然更具掠食性。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4303
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b644d9d0:

    # pb "Sure. Anyhow. When you come back aboard, Sam, check in with whoever's standing watch. Maybe we'll know more about whoever sconded our livestock."
    pb "行吧。总之。Sam，等你回船后，跟值班的人报个到。或许我们能多知道点是谁偷走了我们的牲畜。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4304
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_61b85b44:

    # pb "Think I'll see what else Morocco has to offer while I have the time."
    pb "趁我有空，我想看看摩洛哥还有什么可消遣的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4309
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b256ae7a:

    # "Neither Nomax nor Samuel entreat the jackal to stay, though you doubt he would've done so anyway. Perce thanks you for the drink and ambles off, disappearing into the crowd."
    "Nomax与Samuel都没有挽留这只豺狼，尽管你怀疑他反正也不会留下。Perce谢过你的酒，便慢悠悠地走开，消失在人群里。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4310
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9467901e:

    # "There is a certain kind of sailor, you decide, who would fit in at any port. Weather-worn and salty, with jagged edges like driftwood."
    "你断定，有那么一种水手，在任何港口都能混得开——饱经风霜、带着咸腥得海水气息，像浮木一样棱角分明。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4311
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_c7e5f0e3:

    # "You wonder if that's what your own future looks like."
    "你不禁思忖，自己未来是否也将是这般模样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4320
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e01ca199:

    # "Nomax breaks the silence that has descended by clearing his throat."
    "Nomax清了清嗓子，打破了随之降临的沉默。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4321
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e3cc505b:

    # n "There is plenty of the city left to see, and I should try to feel... accomplished. More than at being able to walk steadily, that is."
    n ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4326
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_e106c6b2:

    # "Samuel nods, rather than answering aloud. Something in [his] mood has changed, subtly, even with Perce's departure."
    "Samuel没有出声回答，只是点了点头。即便Perce走了，[他]的情绪也发生了微妙的变化。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4328
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_75a91c08:

    # s "You want to be going now, then?"
    s "那么，你现在想走了吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4332
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_866448c4:

    # n "Don't feel you need to chaperone me, of course, Mr. O'Connor! I'd appreciate the company, but not enough to impose."
    n "O'Connor先生，不用觉得你需要陪着我！有伴固然好，但也不需强求。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4333
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_b8c9432e:

    # s "Aye. I might stay. Keep my paws up, like."
    s "嗯。我可能留下，保持警觉。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4343
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_0579f902:

    # p "That does sound like a nice idea..."
    p "那听起来确实是个好主意……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4344
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_2dec6e63:

    # n "Spoken like two men who've spent the last two weeks hard at work. Thank for the experience, though... I'll see you back aboard {i}Conway{/i}?"
    n "这话说得像两个刚埋头苦干了两周的人。不过还是得谢谢这段经历……我们{i}Conway{/i}上见？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4345
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_9b9289d2:

    # p "Good luck with your discoveries."
    p "祝你们探索顺利。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4351
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_d2d6a175:

    # "The painted dog nods graciously, stands, and straightens his coat delicately. On dry land, his bearing is impeccable, if not quite regal."
    "这只彩绘犬优雅地点点头，站起身，仔细地整了整外套。在干燥的陆地上，他的仪态无可挑剔，即便算不上是皇家风范。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4355
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_69598920:

    # s "One of our more pleasant passengers, that one is..."
    s "他是我们比较讨喜的乘客之一……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4356
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_6858efae:

    # p "I like him, yes. I'm glad the seasickness passed. You think he'll actually be able to find a good bath?"
    p "是啊，我喜欢他。我很高兴他的晕船过去了。你觉得他真的能找到个好澡堂吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4360
translate Chinese day14_morocco_bar_party_a3377081:

    # s "Maybe."
    s "也许吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4368
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_e79897f0:

    # "Sam's ear flicks impassively."
    "Sam的耳朵漠然地抽动了一下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4369
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0716469a:

    # s "Who knows?"
    s "谁知道呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4372
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2e39d5e4:

    # p "Did you still want to go to one?"
    p "你还想去吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4376
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_8b3739e2:

    # s "I do want that, aye, but I don't see how. Not without raising some awkward questions."
    s "我确实想去，嗯，但我不知道怎么办。很难不惹出些尴尬的问题。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4377
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_9856c65a:

    # p "You could talk to Rajeeyah."
    p "你可以找Rajeeyah谈谈。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4378
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_966d5a99:

    # "Having said that, you realize that is exactly the kind of thing likely to raise those questions. Another idea occurs to you, though, before the maned wolf can turn [his] skeptical expression into anything else."
    "话虽如此，你意识到这恰恰就是那种可能引发问题的事情。不过，在这只鬃狼把[他]怀疑的表情转化成其他任何东西之前，你又想到了另一个主意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4382
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_45867e02:

    # p "Well... what if {i}we{/i} went?"
    p "嗯……如果{i}我们{/i}一起去呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4383
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_a45c12a1:

    # s "You and me, like?"
    s "你是说你和我？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4384
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b829462f:

    # p "The three of us. I could offer to go with you, and just say we're asking Rajeeyah to help translate."
    p "我们三个。我可以提议陪你去，就说我们请Rajeeyah帮忙翻译。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4386
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0c1ab56a:

    # s "You think she'd do that?"
    s "你觉得她会答应吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4387
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_26597358:

    # p "I think she'd understand if you asked.{w} I've helped her out a bit, too... I'm sure she'd be willing to return the favor."
    p "我想如果你开口，她会理解的。{w} 我也帮过她一些忙……我肯定她愿意还这个人情。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4391
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_51805316:

    # s "Hm. You're probably right."
    s "嗯。你大概是对的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4396
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b751c433:

    # s "I guess that's not a bad idea..."
    s "我想这主意不坏……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4397
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ad36012f:

    # "[He] leans back, sticking out [his] elbows and rubbing the back of [his] neck with [his] paws."
    "[他]向后靠去，胳膊肘支开，用爪子揉着后颈。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4398
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_a6868cff:

    # s "What would you do, though?"
    s "不过，那你会干什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4399
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_9fbcf37c:

    # p "I don't know. Explore the city, I suppose? See if Nomax still wants help, maybe."
    p "我不知道。我想，逛逛这座城市？也许看看Nomax是不是还需要帮忙。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4401
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1b5e4e45:

    # p "I guess Rajeeyah would want to stay at the bathhouse, but I offered to help her when she's ashore, too..."
    p "我猜Rajeeyah会想待在澡堂里，但我也答应过她上岸时要去帮忙……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4402
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_cdd1fddd:

    # p "I can find ways to occupy myself, Sam."
    p "我能找到事情打发时间的，Sam。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4403
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_a423761a:

    # s "That's right kind of you. Might... could be I'll take you up on that one, then."
    s "你真是好心。可能……也许我会接受你这个提议。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4408
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_dcaa5de1:

    # "[He] frowns into [his] nearly empty mug, and then finishes it off, buying [himself] some time to assemble [his] thoughts."
    "[他]对着[他]几乎空了的杯子皱起眉，然后一饮而尽，借此给自己一点时间整理思绪。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4409
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_8c860eb6:

    # s "Damn it all if he don't get to me, though. Cocky bastard."
    s "可那混蛋要是没惹到我该多好。狂妄的杂种。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4410
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_7dae7b78:

    # p "Perce?"
    p "Perce？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4411
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_3b9ec34b:

    # s "Well, I weren't talkin' about the other dog, now, were I?"
    s "哎，我刚才说的可不是另一条狗，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4412
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b594696c:

    # "Sam pantomime's the shape of Nomax's spectacles, making circles of the fingers on each paw and bringing them to [his] long muzzle."
    "Sam用爪子比划着Nomax眼镜的形状，在长嘴前圈起手指。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4413
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_5265c450:

    # p "Don't bark at me because of him."
    p "别因为他朝我嚷嚷。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4417
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_421f08f4:

    # s "Sorry, I didn't mean to sound at you like that."
    s "抱歉，我不是有意那样对你说话的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4423
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_38ff58f7:

    # p "Obviously not. My apologies.{w} Perce is a... jerk. I guess I shouldn't speak badly of someone more experienced, but..."
    p "显然不是。我道歉。{w}Perce就是个……混蛋。不过我不该对前辈说三道四，可是……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4427
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_31ede4eb:

    # s "I'd call him worse. To his face, even, I would."
    s "我会用更糟的词儿叫他。甚至当面，我也会。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4428
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_13d77328:

    # s "I already try my best to stay away from him when I can."
    s "我已经尽量躲着他了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4429
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_44f30ad4:

    # s "Would advise you to do the same."
    s "建议你也一样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4430
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_59064a27:

    # "You nod your understanding."
    "你点头表示理解。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4431
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_528ab6a6:

    # s "Not that I can make you. Just, y'know."
    s "倒不是我能强迫你。只是，你懂的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4432
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2f7c43d9:

    # p "I understand, Sam."
    p "我明白，Sam。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4433
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_49a6cf84:

    # p "Glad I wasn't placed under his supervision instead."
    p "幸好我没被安排在他手下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4435
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1c18b626:

    # "Samuel wrestles a smile out of [himself]."
    "Samuel勉强挤出一丝笑容。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4437
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_81081f9b:

    # p "It's just his personality. Maybe it's best to... try and ignore it."
    p "他就是那种性格。也许最好……试着别理他。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4441
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d697ecfc:

    # s "Believe me, I fuckn' tried that."
    s "相信我，我他妈试过了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4442
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_f29b6c61:

    # s "Trying to stay as far away from his as I can as well so that I don't have to look at his mug."
    s "我也尽量离他远远的，这样就不用看见他那张脸。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4443
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_cf75ed32:

    # s "But what are you gonna do when all you have are 4 decks?"
    s "可当你的全部天地就是四层甲板时，你又能怎么办？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4444
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_66a24e59:

    # s "I'd never wish harm on a sailor, I would. But the time where he was out after being an idiot and getting his hand caught?"
    s "我从不愿有水手出事，真的。但他那次犯傻把手弄伤后待在外面的那段日子？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4446
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_47ff6619:

    # s "Paradise. That's how it felt sometimes."
    s "简直是天堂。有时候感觉就是那样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4450
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4ed8986a:

    # p "Well. I guess he's a sailor through-and-through, though. He did help me when I was worried about getting left in Mogador."
    p "嗯。不过，我想他到底是个彻头彻尾的水手。当我担心会被落在摩加多尔时，他确实帮了我。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4451
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_8631bdf2:

    # s "Helped you? I just bet."
    s "帮你？想也知道。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4455
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1f349b80:

    # "In broad strokes, you explain how you sought his help when you needed alcohol for a bribe. Samuel rolls [his] eyes, clearly unimpressed that you would've gone to Perce in the first place."
    "你大致解释了当初为了弄到行贿用的酒，是如何寻求他的帮助。Samuel翻了翻白眼，显然对你一开始就去找Perce很不以为然。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4456
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6dd4cf02:

    # s "And he wanted something, of course. And you with nothin' to offer but them soft eyes and a willing muzzle. Eh?"
    s "他当然想要点回报。而你除了那温顺的眼神和听话的嘴，没什么可给的。嗯？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4457
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4459
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4517e7ac:

    # s "Fuck me, don't tell me you actually went for it. You bend over for him, then?"
    s "操，别告诉我你真答应了。那你为他弯腰了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4462
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_14eae017:

    # p "I didn't have many options..."
    p "我当时没多少选择……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4464
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0deed033:

    # p "No, Muzzle.{w} But it wasn't that bad. I mean... sailors..."
    p "不，多少张嘴。{w} 但也没那么糟。我是说……水手嘛……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4467
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4934a4d8:

    # p "No, Muzzle."
    p "不，多少张嘴。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4469
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_29ca8283:

    # "Sam makes a face, [his] muzzle wrinkling, echoing the word bitterly."
    "Sam做了个鬼脸，[他]的口鼻皱起，苦涩地重复着这个词。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4470
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2610096b:

    # s "'Sailors,' aye. That be the problem {i}exactly{/i}, like."
    s "“水手”，是啊。那{i}恰恰{/i}就是问题所在。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4471
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6cb09fe0:

    # s "Hope you washed that thing at least."
    s "希望你至少把那玩意儿洗过了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4472
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_3f12c9ea:

    # "[He] says, pointing straight at your snout."
    "[他]说着，直指你的口鼻。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4473
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4ed9509f:

    # p "All I mean is that Perce is someone you can work with."
    p "我的意思只是，Perce是个你可以与之共事的人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4476
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_37252a9f:

    # p "He really does have a... way about him."
    p "他确实有……他的一套办法。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4477
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2444e2c3:

    # "In as broad strokes as you can, you explain how you sought the jackal's help for getting a bribe. Samuel listens with a look of increasing distaste, as though Perce's behavior hardly surprises [him]."
    "你尽可能简略地解释了当初是如何为了弄到贿赂品而寻求那只豺狼的帮助。Samuel听着，脸上厌恶的神情越来越重，仿佛Perce的所作所为丝毫不出[他]所料。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4479
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_f52b3dbe:

    # s "Aye, and of course he wanted something in return."
    s "是啊，他当然想要回报。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4480
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b4e650e4:

    # p "I didn't have a whole lot to offer."
    p "我没什么太多能给的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4481
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_f5e943c1:

    # s "What did it end up being? Let me guess..."
    s "最后是什么？让我猜猜……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4482
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_e02ac43c:

    # s "Yer muzzle?"
    s "你的嘴？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4483
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d9b01a98:

    # "Samuel reads you without you spillin a single sound."
    "Samuel没等你发出一点声音就看透了你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4484
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4765ce99:

    # s "Figured."
    s "料到了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4488
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ae918d04:

    # s "Sounds like him, alright."
    s "像是他的作风，没错。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4489
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6cb09fe0_1:

    # s "Hope you washed that thing at least."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4490
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_3f12c9ea_1:

    # "[He] says, pointing straight at your snout."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4491
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_397a2cd0:

    # p "I know. I thought I was doing what I had to do."
    p "我知道。我以为我只是做了必须做的事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4492
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ea7b8c45:

    # p "When you feel trapped... well, you try to survive, don't you?"
    p "当你感到走投无路时……嗯，你总得想办法活下去，不是吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4494
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_fb22ad58:

    # p "And he has Mr. Hudson's ear."
    p "而且Hudson先生听他的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4498
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_a58db247:

    # s "Nah. Not as much as he thinks. You don't agree?"
    s "算了吧。没他想的那么听。你不这么认为吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4499
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_5882614a:

    # p "When we were leaving the ship, they were talking. When he asked Perce to stay back."
    p "我们离船时，他们在谈话。就是Hudson先生让Perce留下那次。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4500
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_66ab53e0:

    # p "I've seen Mr. Hudson angry, that's all. It didn't look like a lecture."
    p "我见过Hudson先生发怒，仅此而已。那看起来不像是训话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4504
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_a8f63a39:

    # s "No?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4511
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_3c4b073d:

    # "Sam frowns, and the expression deepens the longer [he] muses on whatever's crossed [his] mind. Finally [he] gets up, motioning for you to stay put."
    "Sam皱起眉头，[他]越是沉思心中所想，表情就越是凝重。最后[他]站起身，示意你待在原地别动。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4514
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d4b1ba82:

    # "The maned wolf returns from the bar with two cups. These, by their size—and smell—contain something stiffer than beer."
    "鬃狼从吧台那边端着两杯东西回来。根据那杯子的尺寸——还有气味来判断——里面装的应该是比啤酒更烈的东西。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4517
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_8a358cee:

    # "The maned wolf returns from the bar with two cups. These, by their size—and smell—contain something stiffer than wine."
    "鬃狼从吧台那边端着两杯东西回来。根据那杯子的尺寸——还有气味来判断——里面装的应该是比葡萄酒更烈的东西。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4520
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6b1a2d15:

    # "The maned wolf returns from the bar with two cups. These, by their size—and smell—contain something stiff."
    "鬃狼从吧台那边端着两杯东西回来。根据那杯子的尺寸——还有气味来判断——里面装的是烈酒。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4526
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_59a2a8bd:

    # s "Wasn't a lecture, you said?"
    s "你说那不是训话？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4527
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_81cadb86:

    # p "I don't think so. Is this... rum?"
    p "我觉得不是。这是……朗姆酒吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4534
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_87c02e0a:

    # s "Don't worry. You may not get to yours.{w} Arthur weren't doin' his stern military-man look, like he were Julian's pa or something?"
    s "别担心。你的那杯可能轮不到你喝。{w} Arthur当时没摆出他那副严肃的军人面孔吧，就像他是Julian的爹什么的？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4538
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0a3765e0:

    # s "Want me to exchange it for milk again?"
    s "要我再去给你换成牛奶吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4540
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_53976138:

    # "You shake your head."
    "你摇摇头"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4542
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_87c02e0a_1:

    # s "Don't worry. You may not get to yours.{w} Arthur weren't doin' his stern military-man look, like he were Julian's pa or something?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4544
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_cde92cc7:

    # p "No."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4548
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_e2a9310c:

    # s "Fuck me."
    s "妈的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4549
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6ec2d678:

    # "Sam takes a drink of rum, makes a face, and forces it down before repeating the oath. You've never seen the maned wolf make an expression like this before, [his] irrepressible good mood faltering."
    "Sam喝了一口朗姆酒，做了个鬼脸，硬咽下去后又骂了一句。你从未见过鬃狼露出这样的表情，[他]那股抑制不住的愉快情绪动摇了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4550
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_52f60c5a:

    # p "What's going on?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4551
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_8d37fcf9:

    # s "You know where officers come from?"
    s "你知道长官是怎么来的吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4552
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1c248610:

    # p "I think I heard Konrad say that when they're emptying the chamberpots at a whorehouse, they sometimes find one."
    p "我好像听Konrad说过，他们在妓院倒夜壶的时候，有时能发现一个。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4553
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0ba2531c:

    # s "Did he?"
    s "他是这么说的？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4554
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_834a6662:

    # p "Well... No, sounds like something he'd say. Right?"
    p "嗯……不，这听起来像是他会说的话。对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4559
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_118c7612:

    # "The barest ghost of a smile flickers over [his] muzzle. Samuel nudges the other cup towards you with one of those elegant black paws of [his]."
    "[他]的嘴角掠过一丝几乎看不见的笑意。Samuel用[他]那只优雅的黑色爪子，把另一杯酒朝你这边推了推。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4560
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b90d588c:

    # "[His] shirt gets pulled back a little to show some of the tattoed lines that trail up along [his] arm."
    "[他]的衬衫往后拉了一点，露出一些沿着手臂向上延伸的纹身线条。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4561
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_abda4ea1:

    # s "Fine, fine. You've earned that for now."
    s "好吧，好吧。你暂时配得上这个。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4562
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2b5425cd:

    # p "What about officers?{w} I guess they... pay for it?"
    p "长官呢？{w} 我猜他们……是花钱买的？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4566
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_c2435ee9:

    # s "Sometimes they do, if they're rich enough for a ship. Otherwise, the way it's done is, they pick somebody they fancy out of all them sailors, and they grow 'em up. Like a farmer with his prize goose."
    s "有时是，如果他们富到能买得起一艘船的话。否则，通常的做法是，他们从所有水手里挑一个中意的，然后把他培养起来。就像农夫养他的冠军鹅。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4567
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d6ed5623:

    # p "Pick somebody to..."
    p "挑个人来……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4568
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_e47c5d14:

    # s "Train 'em. School the boy in the ways of the sea and all that, sure, so they can take over when the mate steps up a rung."
    s "训练他。当然，教那小子航海的各种门道，这样等大副升职了，他就能接替。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4569
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_10c85557:

    # p "And you think Mr. Hudson is picking... Perce?"
    p "所以你认为Hudson先生挑的是……Perce？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4570
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d743ba69:

    # s "Smart lad."
    s "聪明的小子。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4571
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2c720832:

    # s "Bastard.{w} {i}'Reckon I'll stay on the ship'{/i}, he is. I see what they be doing now, and no mistake."
    s "混蛋。{w} {i}“我想我还是待在船上吧”{/i}，他就是这种人。我现在看清他们在搞什么把戏了，错不了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4572
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2fe26eaf:

    # p "I thought you and Arthur were... close. He had you sail us into the harbor, didn't he? He trusts you, obviously."
    p "我以为你和Arthur关系……挺近的。是他让你开船带我们进港的，不是吗？他显然信任你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4573
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d4093de3:

    # s "He needs me is what he does."
    s "他是需要我，仅此而已。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4574
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0c221e19:

    # "[He] takes another sip of [his] rum, a rare look of anger flashing in the maned wolf's eyes."
    "[他]又抿了一口朗姆酒，鬃狼眼中闪过一丝罕见的怒意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4575
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_69802702:

    # s "That's all it is. But he don't need me to be an officer, clearly."
    s "就是这样。但他显然不需要我当长官。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4576
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0a05e3ab:

    # p "I... I might've misinterpreted, you know?"
    p "我……我可能误会了，你知道吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4580
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_931c9337:

    # s "You didn't. And... I..."
    s "你没有。而且……我……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4584
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_53ba00af:

    # "Raucous laughter from the next table over interrupts [his] thoughts, although Sam didn't seem close to finishing the sentence anyway. You glance around."
    "邻桌传来的喧闹笑声打断了[他]的思绪，虽然Sam看起来也没打算把话说完。你环顾四周。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4585
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d8f829c2:

    # p "Maybe we should... take a walk?"
    p "也许我们该……出去走走？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4588
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_aceaf4fa:

    # s "While we can? Sure."
    s "趁还有空的时候？当然。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4593
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_9b3327ef:

    # "Sam stands and, after staring at them for a second, grabs the two cups of rum."
    "Sam站起身，盯着那两杯酒看了一秒，然后将它们一把抓起。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4606
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4ba49e13:

    # "Most of the harborfront is quite busy, but not all of the berths are occupied."
    "码头区大部分地方都很繁忙，但并非所有泊位都停满了船。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4608
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_64e1c2fd:

    # "The two of you make your way down onto one of the empty piers in a quieter corner of this place. A stevedore wanders in your direction before a look from Sam convinces him that you don't have any business to transact."
    "你们俩走到一个较安静的角落里一条空荡荡的栈桥上。一个码头工人朝你们的方向晃悠过来，但Sam瞪了他一眼就让他明白你们没什么交易可谈。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4609
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_f3c6d877:

    # "Sam sits. If [he] stretched it out, the maned wolf's leg could touch the water that laps at the edges of the pier. As it is, [he] lets them dangle. [He] seems a little calmer."
    "Sam坐下。如果[他]把腿伸直，鬃狼的脚就能碰到拍打着栈桥边缘的海水。实际上，[他]只是让双腿悬空晃荡，[他]看起来平静了一些。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4610
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_c80ec9ec:

    # s "I understand, you know."
    s "我能理解的，你知道吗。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4611
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_94bbf8be:

    # p "I'm not sure I do."
    p "我不太确定我知道。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4612
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_27cdbb7d:

    # s "There's a difference between Perce and me, see. One that Arthur can't get past."
    s "Perce和我有区别，知道吗。一个Arthur无法忽视的区别。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4616
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4581fbfb:

    # p "He doesn't like people from Dublin?"
    p "他不喜欢都柏林来的人？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4620
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_046d4387:

    # s "The fuck kind of insult is that s'pposed to be?"
    s "这他妈算什么侮辱？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4621
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d27cc4fd:

    # s "I'm from down south, County Cork."
    s "我来自南边，科克郡。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4622
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0bdafa96:

    # "Samuel smiles at the joke, at least, even if faintly; evidently appreciating the friendly ear that comes with it. [He] looks at the two cups of rum, sizes them up, and hands you the more empty one."
    "至少，Samuel对这个玩笑报以微笑——尽管很淡；显然，[他]感激这份伴随玩笑而来的友善倾听。[他]看着那两杯朗姆酒，掂量了一下，把更空的那杯递给你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4626
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b9b1844f:

    # s "But he's got his own... past. His own secrets—I mean, I ain't gonna throw the first stone."
    s "但他也有他自己的……过去。他自己的秘密——我是说，我可不会做第一个扔石头的人。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4627
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_885a05f5:

    # p "But if he likes and respects you..."
    p "但如果他喜欢并尊重你……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4628
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_8bcbcd1c:

    # s "So he promotes me. What happens when it comes out he didn't even know his new mate weren't ever a cabin boy? And all for want of havin'... one too few dicks an' two too few balls. What then?"
    s "所以他提拔我。等到事情败露，大家发现他甚至不知道他的新大副根本就没当过船舱侍应生，那会怎样？而这一切都只因为我少了……一根鸡巴和两个蛋蛋。到时候该怎么办？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4629
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1940d7b2:

    # "Sam counts that off on the raised fingers of [his] free paw, then takes a drink to punctuate the pause that follows."
    "Sam用空着的那只爪子竖起的手指头数着，然后喝了一口酒，为接下来的停顿画上句号。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4630
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6214130e:

    # s "Can't be an officer yourself if you can't count to three. Or you're blind."
    s "连数都数不到三，或者瞎了眼，可当不了长官。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4631
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_fda86aec:

    # p "That could look bad for you if you were discovered, but why Mr. Hudson?"
    p "被发现对你来说可能很糟，可Hudson先生凭什么这么做？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4635
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_90e08cd3:

    # s "Some men... bad decisions, or bad luck, or both at once, they look around and they see they's at a point where they can't afford any more black marks."
    s "有些人……做错了选择，或者走了背运，或者两者兼具。等他们回过神来，发现自己已经经不起任何污点了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4636
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_a06d84aa:

    # s "Whether in the eyes of others, or for the wellbeing of their own soul."
    s "无论是在别人眼里，还是为了他们自己灵魂的安宁。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4637
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0ff9aa1b:

    # s "He... well, he's there."
    s "他……嗯，他就在那个位置上。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4638
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_71de963d:

    # p "Why? What did he do?"
    p "为什么？他做了什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4639
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b4a25e34:

    # s "He- ah, I don't know if it's my place to talk."
    s "他——啊，我不知道我是否适合谈论这个。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4643
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_94c9d5d9:

    # "Sam looks up at the sky, shielding [his] eyes from the sun, searching the tops of the moored ships."
    "Sam抬头望向天空，用手遮住眼睛避开阳光，扫视着停泊船只的桅杆顶端。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4644
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b35e0f79:

    # s "Perce is the safe choice. He's an arsehole, to be sure, but there are plenty arseholes on the seas and he's the safe choice."
    s "Perce是个安全的选择。他确实是个混蛋，但海上混蛋多的是，而他是个安全的选择。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4646
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4eee321c:

    # p "If you want to stage a mutiny, we should probably look for supplies while we're here. {w}A musket or something. Whatever pirates have."
    p "如果你想发动叛变，我们或许该趁在这里的时候找点补给。{w}火枪什么的。海盗有的那些玩意儿。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4647
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ae1d6796:

    # s "Cutlass."
    s "弯刀。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4651
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_c4e27c0c:

    # p "A cutlass, that's it."
    p "对，弯刀。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4652
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2b4d93e9:

    # "Sam laughs quietly. A moment later, the sound becomes a soft giggle."
    "Sam轻声笑了。过了一会儿，笑声变成了轻柔的咯咯笑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4653
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ea113cf1:

    # s "No, don't worry, it's not that bad. You'd be a terrible pirate. I'd have to show you which one's the pointy end and everything."
    s "不，别担心，没那么糟。你会是个糟糕的海盗。我还得告诉你哪头是尖的之类的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4655
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_438acca1:

    # p "But you're the better sailor."
    p "但你是更好的水手。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4656
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_c1f5dd70:

    # s "Maybe. Even if that's so, good luck convincing anyone to hire me on."
    s "也许吧。就算真是这样，说服任何人雇佣我也是痴心妄想。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4657
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_bbdc8c7e:

    # s "Even getting my position here was more luck and miracle than anything else."
    s "就连我得到现在这个职位，也更多是靠运气和奇迹。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4661
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_fbe7a546:

    # s "I tell you, though. When you came on, I wasn't sure I'd think too much of you. Good to be proven wrong about one thing this voyage."
    s "不过说真的，你刚上船那会儿，我还以为你也就那样。这趟航行能看走眼一回倒也不错。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4662
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b22b9484:

    # "[He] takes another sip of rum, and then sighs."
    "[他]又抿了一口朗姆酒，然后叹了口气。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4665
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_8e8defe0:

    # s "What I think it is... it's not quite as if Arthur be betrayin' me, or nothing. But sort of, like. I've been on that ship for five years now."
    s "我觉得事情是这样的……倒不完全是Arthur背叛了我，或怎么样。但有点那种意思_我在那艘船上已经待了五年了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4666
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_453e2b0d:

    # s "Sailed all over. Took all them new boys what came on under our wing, and I told 'em a few times, too: don't mind Arthur. He's a bit stern, but he do know his way around a ship."
    s "我四海为家，照顾所有新上船的小伙子，也跟他们说过好几次：别在意Arthur。他是有点严厉，但他确实精通航海。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4667
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_fb9919ff:

    # s "And—no. What it {i}really{/i} is, [name]—you know?"
    s "而且——不。{i}真正{/i}的问题在于，[name]——你知道吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4668
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_e74e9ca9:

    # p "I don't..."
    p "我不……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4671
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ddeb5b11:

    # s "If he up and favors Perce, and I guess we all know it—all know he's the golden boy, like..."
    s "如果他公然偏爱Perce，我猜我们都知道——都知道他是那个天之骄子，就像……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4672
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1e325feb:

    # s "Next time we're in a storm, and them sails be all stiff as whorehouse linens, and you can't see to the end of your nose for the rain, Arthur's gonna say: {i}Seaman O'Connor, sheet in and stand by to wear ship!{/i} 'cause he knows I can do it."
    s "下次我们遇到风暴，船帆硬得像妓院的床单，雨水打得你连鼻子尖都看不清时，Arthur就会说：{i}水手O'Connor，收帆准备转向！{/i}因为他知道我能做到。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4673
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_16b968ea:

    # s "He'll expect me to."
    s "他会指望我去做。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4674
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_79ec3d40:

    # p "And you will."
    p "而你也会去做。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4678
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d6efcc45:

    # s "I will."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4679
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_66b045f3:

    # "[He] says it as a point of pride, although with that admission the maned wolf's big ears flatten slightly. [He] returns to staring out towards the harbor."
    "[他]说这话时带着一种自豪感，虽然承认这一点让鬃狼的大耳朵微微耷拉下来。[他]又转头望向海港。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4686
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_fc285ef6:

    # p "Perhaps you shouldn't, Sam."
    p "也许你不该这样，Sam。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4690
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_dc1cd401:

    # s "Hm?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4692
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_67226517:

    # p "Well, seeing Arthur in that fashion, you know. Look at how he treated me—and now treats you."
    p "嗯，你看Arthur那副样子，你知道的。看看他是怎么对我的——现在又是怎么对你的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4694
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_65a1ce6c:

    # p "The lengths I had to go to to convince him of the mistakes in his own thinking..."
    p "我费了多大劲才让他认识到自己想法里的错误……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4700
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4023a6c1:

    # "You once again keep the actual details to yourself."
    "你再次将具体细节埋在心里。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4702
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1ee27940:

    # "To spare Samuel, you tell yourself."
    "你告诉自己，这是为了不让Samuel难过。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4704
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_eae81cf9:

    # "Samuel dips his head down, looking down at the lapping water."
    "Samue低下头，看着拍打着栈桥的海水。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4706
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_9a3a0ed6:

    # s "I don't know. I just think he isn't making the right call."
    s "我不知道。我只是觉得他做了错误的决定。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4708
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_413b5501:

    # s "Not with Perce."
    s "他不该选Perce。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4710
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_8b592c59:

    # p "Maybe there's something more to it?"
    p "也许背后还有别的原因？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4714
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_5c82e516:

    # s "Really?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4715
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ca415150:

    # s "Maybe there is. Maybe there's bloody well not, though."
    s "也许有。但也可能他妈的根本就没有。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4716
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4aba133d:

    # s "I've known him longer than you did, or haven't I?"
    s "我认识他的时间比你长，不是吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4721
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_fd2d2586:

    # "[He] pushes [himself] up and gets to [his] paws."
    "[他]撑起身子，站了起来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4723
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_7de62d3e:

    # s "I suppose I'm going to figure out where the others have gone and head back to the ship. Maybe there's something that needs doing back there."
    s "我想我得去弄清楚其他人去哪儿了，然后回船上。也许那边有什么事需要做。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4724
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b6d98da1:

    # p "You want me to come with you?"
    p "要我跟你一起去吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4725
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_83b03d05:

    # s "Don't want you get into trouble on yer own, more like. Come on, then. Let's go."
    s "更像是我不想让你一个人惹上麻烦。那就来吧。我们走。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4732
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ed4045e8:

    # p "You said you didn't know what to expect of me. For what it's worth, I've really appreciated being on the ship with you. I'm sure Julian has, too."
    p "你说过你不知道该怎么看我。不管怎样，我真的很感激能和你在船上共事。我相信Julian也是。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4733
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_8b79b3fe:

    # p "You're like a... I don't know.{w} You're like a big brother."
    p "你就像个……我不知道。{w}你就像个大哥哥。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4737
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_712bd03f:

    # s "Sister."
    s "姐姐。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4738
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4160081b:

    # s "Rather be yours than his, if I'm honest.{w} You {i}will{/i} make a good sailor. If you want."
    s "说实话，我宁愿当你的，也不愿当他的。{w}你{i}一定{/i}能成为一个好水手。如果你想的话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4742
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_55c2a57d:

    # "The genuine warmth in [his] voice stings. Feelings of your betrayal once again surfacing when you are faced with just how much trust Samuel places in you."
    "[他]声音里真挚的暖意刺痛了你。当你面对Samuel对你如此深厚的信任时，背叛[他]的感觉再次浮上心头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4744
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b5fe11ed:

    # "Trust that you squandered."
    "这份信任被你挥霍了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4746
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_f4f25e0c:

    # "[He] doesn't know that. But you do..."
    "他不知道这点。但你知道..."

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4748
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_23c8a44b:

    # "And you are beginning to think that that is worse."
    "而你开始觉得这更糟。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4750
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_90f3569c:

    # "You try to shake the feelings."
    "你试图甩开这些情绪。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4754
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b2b2b5aa:

    # p "Will you... you'll stay on the {i}Conway{/i}?"
    p "你会...你会留在{i}Conway{/i}上吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4755
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_dae56c88:

    # s "Oh. Sure, aye."
    s "哦。当然，会的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4756
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_36bbb989:

    # p "Then I do want that. You're a good example."
    p "那我确实希望如此。你是个好榜样。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4757
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_e5ac32a8:

    # s "Friend?"
    s "算朋友吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4758
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_68bf8a6a:

    # p "I hope so."
    p "希望如此。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4763
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_20b97372:

    # "Sam's mood is gradually lifting. [He] chuckles, finishing off [his] rum, then puts [his] arm around you in a brief, friendly hug, gripping your shoulder firmly."
    "Sam的情绪逐渐好转，轻声笑了笑，喝完朗姆酒，然后伸手短暂而友好地搂住你，用力握住你的肩膀。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4769
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_5ecb8b49:

    # s "Right! Reckon I'll call on that, then. Think I will talk to Rajeeyah about finding a good bath. If the offer's open, still."
    s "好吧！那我可要指望你这句话了。我想我会找Rajeeyah谈谈，找个好浴室。如果提议还算数的话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4770
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_443dacdc:

    # p "It is."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4771
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2068e5e5:

    # s "Well. Then let's go see."
    s "那么。我们去看看吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4774
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_c246d25e:

    # p "I don't think Arthur's foolish, Sam. He must have something in mind."
    p "我不认为Arthur是傻瓜，Sam。他肯定有自己的打算。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4778
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_a77770fe:

    # s "Maybe, but I doubt it. And I don't suppose it matters. I shouldn't complain too much."
    s "也许吧，但我表示怀疑。而且我觉得这也不重要。我不该抱怨太多。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4779
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_04c706c0:

    # p "I think you're entitled to a bit of complaining..."
    p "我觉得你有权抱怨几句..."

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4780
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_578139b8:

    # s "Nah. Coming up where I did, goin' to sea were already more opportunity than I could've asked for. Ought to try and enjoy it, I should."
    s "不。以我的出身，能出海已经是求之不得的机会了。应该试着享受才对，真的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4783
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_a1f53c3c:

    # p "And that bath?"
    p "那浴室呢？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4787
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1af64e70:

    # "[He] perks up [his] ears."
    "[他]竖起了耳朵。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4791
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_69f771a2:

    # s "Good on ya to not let me forget about it. Reckon talking to Rajeeyah would be a good idea. You don't mind?"
    s "幸好你没让我忘了这事。找Rajeeyah谈谈应该是个好主意。你不介意吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4792
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_f1c98617:

    # p "Not at all."
    p "完全不介意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4793
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_a2fde3fb:

    # s "Well. Then let's go then, eh? Make something out of this, after all."
    s "那，我们这就去吧？总得把这趟弄出点意思来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4797
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_53176f0c:

    # p "We all should."
    p "我们都该如此。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4799
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_46777bb4:

    # p "Often I feel we don't do it enough, but sometimes some complaining is justified as well."
    p "我常觉得我们做得不够，但有时抱怨也是情有可原的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4801
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_af93f4fc:

    # s "Mayhaps."
    s "或许吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4803
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_fd2d2586_1:

    # "[He] pushes [himself] up and gets to [his] paws."
    ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4807
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_7de62d3e_1:

    # s "I suppose I'm going to figure out where the others have gone and head back to the ship. Maybe there's something that needs doing back there."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4808
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b6d98da1_1:

    # p "You want me to come with you?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4809
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_83b03d05_1:

    # s "Don't want you get into trouble on yer own, more like. Come on, then. Let's go."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4820
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_032b08ac:

    # "You move your cup out of the way, and put your arm around the maned wolf."
    "你把杯子挪开，伸手搂住鬃狼。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4824
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_e23dbff5:

    # "Sam glances sideways in your direction, hesitating. After a moment, [he] leans against you. [He] sighs again, and puts aside [his] own drink."
    "Sam侧目瞥了你一眼，有些犹豫。片刻后，[他]靠在你身上。[他]又叹了口气，放下了自己的酒杯。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4825
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_96f36fd0:

    # s "Ah, what does it matter? She's just a ship. Pays better than it would be back home. Get to see the world. Meet new people... I been pretty lucky, all told."
    s "啊，这有什么关系呢？她不过是艘船。我比在家乡挣得多。能看看世界。认识新朋友...总的来说，我已经很幸运了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4826
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ce4d5e5d:

    # p "I don't think Arthur is foolish, Sam. He must have something in mind. Or maybe Perce will fall overboard."
    p "我不认为Arthur是傻瓜，Sam。他肯定有自己的打算。或者也许Perce会掉下船呢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4827
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1e131232:

    # s "I'm definitely not {i}that{/i} lucky."
    s "我肯定没{i}那么{/i}幸运。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4828
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0f7131bd:

    # "When [he] doesn't say anything else, you give the maned wolf a squeeze. After a moment, [he] returns it, slipping [his] long arm around you. For a minute or so, [he] stays quiet, leaving you to enjoy the warmth of [his] lanky frame against your side."
    "见[他]没有再说什么，你轻轻抱了抱鬃狼。过了一会儿，[他]也回抱了你，用修长的手臂环住你。有那么一分钟左右，[他]沉默着，让你享受[他]瘦长身躯靠在身旁的温暖。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4829
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_f053665c:

    # s "You were serious about asking Raj for help?"
    s "你是真的想找Raj帮忙？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4830
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_7f47660e:

    # p "Hm? Of course."
    p "嗯？当然。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4834
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_571d89ab:

    # s "Sure, then. Got that bath to look forward to."
    s "那好吧。总算有浴室可以期待了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4842
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_20a3b07e:

    # "[He] finally straightens, looking you up and down thoughtfully."
    "[他]终于直起身，若有所思地上下打量着你。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4846
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_9105bc6f:

    # s "Y'know... actually..."
    s "你知道...其实..."

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4847
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_061e5381:

    # p "Yes?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4848
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_fa6a27e2:

    # s "I got a different idea."
    s "我有其他的主意。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4854
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_bde88fd6:

    # "Sam glances over at you. After a moment, [he] returns the gesture, gripping your shoulder warmly and then giving it a fond thump."
    "Sam瞥了你一眼。片刻后，[他]也做出同样的动作，热情地握住你的肩膀，然后亲昵地拍了拍。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4858
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ea852cb0:

    # s "Thanks for listenin' to me complain, eh?"
    s "谢谢你听我抱怨，嗯？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4859
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_5d85be25:

    # p "Don't mention it. I think... I think it'll work out, you know?"
    p "别客气。我想...我想事情会解决的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4860
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_83d1c1a2:

    # s "Maybe. Maybe it will."
    s "也许吧。也许会。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4861
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_585a04e7:

    # p "You should try to enjoy your time here. You've got that bath to look forward to..."
    p "你应该试着享受在这里的时光。你不是还期待着那个浴室吗..."

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4869
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2906dfa3:

    # "Sam looks at you again, and then pushes [himself] away, gesturing with [his] paw to the space between you."
    "Sam又看了你一眼，然后推开自己，用爪子指了指你们之间的空隙。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4870
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_bb61e947:

    # s "'Cause we were that close, eh? That's when you realized I needed it?"
    s "是因为我们刚才靠得那么近吗？所以你才意识到我需要去浴室？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4871
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_10dd6fe3:

    # p "No! That's not what I meant!"
    p "不！我不是那个意思！"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4873
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d76005f0:

    # s "Sure. Guess it's not a bad idea, though, talkin' to Raj. What do you say—finish this and then go make sure the others ain't got into trouble? Head back to the ship?"
    s "好吧。不过我想找Raj谈谈也不是个坏主意。你说呢——喝完这个，然后去确保其他人没惹麻烦？回船上去？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4878
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_3585963d:

    # p "You don't seem as convinced about the idea now."
    p "你现在对这主意似乎没那么笃定了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4882
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_56883974:

    # s "I'm not."
    s "是的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4883
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4899e18b:

    # p "You were hoping to look at naked women too?"
    p "你也想看看裸体女人？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4887
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4506e550:

    # "Samuel snorts, tossing [his] head in a dismissive shake. [He] takes a while to compose an answer, though, despite how quickly [he] brushed the idea off."
    "Samuel嗤之以鼻，不屑地摇了摇头。不过，尽管[他]很快否定了这个想法，却还是花了一会儿时间组织回答。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4891
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b456338a:

    # s "How are you with... ah, hell. How are you with secrets, [name]? Keeping them, like? It be a small ship, if you follow, and there's plenty that spread on their own."
    s "你对...啊，见鬼。你对秘密怎么看，[name]？能保守秘密吗？如果你明白我的意思的话，这是艘小船，很多事情会自己传开。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4901
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_295e1136:

    # "Rarely has there been a more bold-faced lie."
    "这简直是明目张胆的谎言。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4903
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_76ccec6c:

    # "The maned wolf shakes [his] head again, this time more gently."
    "鬃狼又摇了摇头，这次更轻柔些。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4904
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_092e7c39:

    # s "Isn't anything the matter.{w} Not exactly, I mean."
    s "没什么事。我是说，不完全是。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4908
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_56fddc28:

    # s "Still worried we're gonna put you off the ship, are you?"
    s "还在担心我们会把你赶下船，是吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4912
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_561c26dd:

    # "That and of what you might have to do if it comes to it."
    "我担心这个，以及如果真到了那一步你可能不得不做的事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4914
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_7f9d56e3:

    # p "It hasn't exactly been smooth sailing."
    p "这一路确实不太顺利。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4918
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6c5e5caa:

    # s "I suppose not."
    s "我想是的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4919
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_5ac9e811:

    # p "If it's nothing dangerous, then... what are you worried about? What's the secret?"
    p "如果没什么危险，那...你在担心什么？什么秘密？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4925
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_e5ef00fe:

    # "[He] stares at you, and then laughs, tossing [his] head back."
    "[他]盯着你，然后大笑起来，仰起了头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4929
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_26441d9b:

    # s "How'd you guess so quickly? I thought we was bein' all discreet, like."
    s "你怎么这么快就猜到了？我还以为我们挺隐蔽的呢。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4930
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_c7fd73f4:

    # p "It's the way you look at her. I don't blame you! She's a good catch."
    p "是你看她的样子。我不怪你！她是个好对象。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4934
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6dc183ec:

    # s "Jealous?"
    s "嫉妒了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4937
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b6f498ae:

    # s "{cps=5000}Jealous?{/cps}" nointeract
    s "{cps=5000}嫉妒了?{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4943
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_be1d6091:

    # "Sam rolls [his] eyes, and you feel the maned wolf's foot nudge you in a playful kick beneath the table."
    "Sam翻了个白眼，你感觉到鬃狼的脚在桌子下顽皮地轻轻踢了你一下。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4944
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_5abbdf99:

    # s "Flattery won't get you out of scrubbing the deck. Nor payin' me back for them drinks, either."
    s "奉承可没法让你免去擦甲板的活儿。也还不了你欠我的酒钱。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4945
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b1a117d1:

    # p "So I should stop?"
    p "那我该停下？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4949
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_161454f0:

    # s "Didn't say that."
    s "我可没这么说。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4954
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_079418e8:

    # s "Well don't be. She's spoken for."
    s "那就别嫉妒了。她名花有主了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4955
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_2869ebc5:

    # "[He] scowls, although the irritation is mostly feigned, because after a moment [he] chuckles."
    "[他]皱起眉头，虽然恼怒多半是装出来的，因为过了一会儿他就轻声笑了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4959
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_e2472080:

    # s "No. Obviously that's not the secret I meant, [name]."
    s "不。显然那不是我要说的秘密，[name]。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4961
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_213f8d88:

    # p "No. I try not to get too jealous about things that aren't happening."
    p "不。我尽量不去嫉妒那些没发生的事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4965
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d85c418c:

    # s "You're the one who said it, not me. Anyway. No, of course it isn't that."
    s "这话可是你说的，不是我。总之。当然不是那件事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4970
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4a0ae5e5:

    # s "God, you're as bad as that jackal is. Don't none of you's think of anything else?"
    s "天啊，你跟那只豺狼一样坏。你们这些人就不能想点别的吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4971
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_34e1c7f2:

    # s "Anyway."
    s "总之。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4975
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4aba1c40:

    # s "Just Perce, that's all. I don't like him much."
    s "只是Perce而已。我不太喜欢他。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4979
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_e7192417:

    # s "{cps=5000}Just Perce, that's all. I don't like him much.{/cps}" nointeract
    s "{cps=5000}只是Perce而已。我不太喜欢他。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4981
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d62d640b:

    # p "Well, he does seem a bit..."
    p "嗯，他确实有点..."

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4982
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4edfdd37:

    # s "Of a prick? Aye."
    s "像个混蛋？没错。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4983
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_4f9ff424:

    # p "I was going to say that he's a little more coarse than the other sailors."
    p "我本来想说，他比其他水手更粗鲁些。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4984
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_a129be91:

    # s "Cocky, that's what."
    s "是狂妄自大。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4985
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b9bdd750:

    # p "It sounds like it goes a bit deeper than that, Sam."
    p "听起来不止如此，Sam。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4989
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_5f4f0d89:

    # p "Well... he's not perfect. But he did help me, back on the ship."
    p "这个...他并不完美。但在船上时，他确实帮过我。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4990
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_07ef88cc:

    # s "Help you?"
    s "帮你？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4991
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_13456c6e:

    # "In as broad strokes as possible, you explain to Sam how desperate you were to stay about {i}Conway{/i}. Desperate enough that, when the jackal said he had some alcohol to offer..."
    "你尽可能简略地向Sam解释了你当时多么渴望留在{i}Conway{/i}上。渴望到当那只豺狼说他可以提供一些酒时..."

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4992
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6ca78b5e:

    # "Sam narrows [his] eyes, and is clearly not convinced by 'broad strokes.'"
    "Sam眯起眼睛，显然对你"简略"的说法并不信服。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4993
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_92dad4b8:

    # s "And what'd he want in return, then?"
    s "那他想要什么回报？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4994
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_12cd3a24_1:

    # p "Well..."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4995
