    "鬃狼对此似乎并不特别意外。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4998
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_48f81161:

    # s "Fuck me, don't tell me you actually went for it."
    s "我的天，别告诉我你真的答应了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:4999
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_c6ebff86:

    # p "Well, I did... uh. But it—that was what I had to offer. You know?"
    p "嗯，我确实...呃。但那——那是我必须做的。你懂吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5000
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1e3491ce:

    # s "I don't."
    s "没"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5001
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_f836b525:

    # s "It's never come up between us. I guess I don't have the same budding camaraderie you do with the bastard."
    s "我们之间从没提过这个。我想我和那混蛋之间，可没有你那种萌芽中的情谊。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5002
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d315130d:

    # p "I wouldn't call it camaraderie. Just a transaction, that's all."
    p "我可不会称之为交情。只是一笔交易，仅此而已。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5003
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_fd83afd7:

    # "Samuel grunts."
    "Samuel咕哝了一声。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5004
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6cb09fe0_2:

    # s "Hope you washed that thing at least."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5005
