    # p "I don't really understand, I guess. Perhaps I'm missing the reason why. Doesn't seem like there's anything special about scrubbing a deck that you'd need to be a man for."
    p "我确实不太明白。也许是我没领会其中缘由。擦甲板这事怎么看也不像非得男人做。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5069
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_559e4ede:

    # s "Sailors be odd types, that's all. Claim they can look at the stars and taste a bit of salt water and tell you which Indies they're alee of. {w} Next day they're sayin': {i}oh, can't weigh anchor after a black tern crosses yer bow, be a bad omen{/i} or some rot like that."
    s "水手都是些奇怪的家伙，仅此而已。他们声称看着星星，尝一点海水，就能告诉你他们正驶向哪个印度群岛。{w}
  第二天他们又会说：{i}哦，黑燕鸥飞过船头后不能起锚，那是个坏兆头{/i}，或者类似的胡话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5070
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b8aa792f:

    # p "I guess."
    p "我想也是"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5071
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6df6b0f0:

    # p "Or Perce could just be an idiot."
    p "或者Perce可能就是个白痴。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5075
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_753e308a:

    # "Samuel's muzzle turns up in a toothy grin."
    "Samuel的口鼻上扬，露出一个露齿的笑容。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5076
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d910eb8e:

    # s "Don't let him hear you say that."
    s "别让他听到你这么说。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5077
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_6922359e:

    # p "I know when to keep my muzzle shut. But, you know..."
    p "我知道什么时候该闭上我的嘴。但是，你知道的……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5081
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_722ed750:

    # s "What?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5082
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_41d4e884:

    # p "If Rajeeyah is planning on going to a bathhouse, herself, she'd probably know one where Perce {i}definitely{/i} wouldn't be. We could go, if you want?{w} I mean, if you want company."
    p "如果Rajeeyah自己打算去澡堂，她可能知道一个Perce{i}绝对{/i}不会去的地方。如果你想的话，我们可以去。{w}
  我的意思是，如果你想有人陪的话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5088
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_8a53cb65:

    # s "Oh, I don't even know. It's an ancient belief. A lot of 'em have it. Either way, I don't care for it. And I don't care for how he treats the surgeon, neither."
    s "哦，我甚至都不知道。那是一种古老的信仰。很多人都有。不管怎样，我不在乎这个。我也不在乎他对待外科医生的方式。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5089
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1127cd49:

    # p "I can understand that. You know...{w} If she's planning on going to a bathhouse, herself, she'd probably know one where Perce {i}isn't{/i}. We could go, if you want? I mean, if you want company."
    p "我能理解。你知道……{w}
  如果她打算自己去澡堂，她可能知道一个Perce{i}绝对{/i}不会去的地方。如果你想的话，我们可以去。{w} 我的意思是，如果你想有人陪的话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5090
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_1cdac01d:

    # "Samuel pauses. It seems to take [him] longer to think over than you really would've expected."
    "Samuel停顿了一下。[他]思考的时间似乎比你预期的要长。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5097
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_44958b46:

    # s "Talking to Raj isn't a bad idea, no... s'pose I could do that now. We might as well head back to the ship, anyhow."
    s "和Raj谈谈不是个坏主意，不……我想我现在就可以这么做。反正我们也该回船上了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5098
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_5fa01069:

    # p "See if there's work to be done?"
    p "为了看看有没有活要干？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5100
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_91bbb60d:

    # s "Aye, and check on the others. See if Nomax has found anything of interest yet. Well—c'mon, then, [name]. Let's go."
    s "是的，也去看看其他人。看看Nomax有没有发现什么有趣的东西。好吧——那么，来吧，[name]。我们走。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5102
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_23ee7d6f:

    # s "Aye, and check on the others. See if Nomax has found his plants yet. Well—c'mon, then, [name]. Let's go."
    s "是的，也去看看其他人。看看Nomax找到他想找的植物没有。好吧——那么，来吧，[name]。我们走。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5109
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_0f6dbdf6:

    # p "Maybe there's something to it?"
    p "也许其中有些道理？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5113
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_5c82e516_1:

    # s "Really?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5114
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_ff4a2dbe:

    # s "Maybe there is. Maybe there's bloody well not, though. We've damned sure sailed more leagues with Rajeeyah on than we have with you."
    s "也许有。可也许他妈的根本就没有。我们跟Rajeeyah一起航行的里程可比跟你多太多了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5120
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_d6bf46d5:

    # "[He] pushes [himself] back from the table and gets to [his] paws."
    "[他]从桌边撑起身，站了起来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5121
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_7de62d3e_2:

    # s "I suppose I'm going to figure out where the others have gone and head back to the ship. Maybe there's something that needs doing back there."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5122
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_b6d98da1_2:

    # p "You want me to come with you?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5123
translate Chinese day14_continue_morocco_pub_83b03d05_2:

    # s "Don't want you get into trouble on yer own, more like. Come on, then. Let's go."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5135
translate Chinese day14_samuel_morocco_decision_93f8ec4b:

    # s "Well..."
    s ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5136
translate Chinese day14_samuel_morocco_decision_a97e1ec5:

    # "[He]'s choosing [his] words a lot more carefully than you've come to expect from the maned wolf. You wonder if you've said something wrong. Is there something you've missed between [him] and the surgeon?"
    "[他]的措辞比你对这只鬃狼预想的还要谨慎得多。你在想自己是不是说错了什么。你是不是漏掉了[他]和外科医生之间的什么事？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5137
translate Chinese day14_samuel_morocco_decision_b3aa62ad:

    # "Have you overstepped your own boundaries?"
    "你是不是越界了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5138
translate Chinese day14_samuel_morocco_decision_5dd219ab:

    # p "You don't have to go with me, either! I just meant..."
    p "你也不必跟我一起去！我只是说……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5139
translate Chinese day14_samuel_morocco_decision_a1193c5b:

    # s "T'isn't that.{w} It's a good thought. She'd have ideas, to be sure. And I tell you what, [name], you'd be good company."
    s "不是那个意思。{w} 这是个好想法。她肯定有主意。而且我告诉你，[name]，你会是个好伙伴。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5140
translate Chinese day14_samuel_morocco_decision_87076571:

    # p "Then let's plan on it? I feel as though I've missed something."
    p "那我们计划一下？我感觉我好像错过了什么。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5142
translate Chinese day14_samuel_morocco_decision_c468ef9b:

    # s "You haven't. There's just... something you should know, maybe."
    s "你没有。只是……也许有件事你应该知道。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5143
translate Chinese day14_samuel_morocco_decision_530bfbe3:

    # p "Something bad?"
    p "坏事吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5149
translate Chinese day14_samuel_morocco_decision_4906b09e:

    # "[His] ears flick, and [he] doesn't answer at first. With a quirky smile—is [he]... embarrassed? {i}Awkward{/i}, of all people?—Sam pushes [himself] back from the table and gets to [his] paws."
    "[他]耳朵抖了抖，起初没有回答。带着古怪的笑容——[他]这是……难为情？偏偏是[i]他{/i}觉得[i]尴尬{/i}？——Sam从桌边撑起身，站了起来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5150
translate Chinese day14_samuel_morocco_decision_25a78c90:

    # s "Let's go for a walk."
    s "我们去散散步。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5168
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_852ec2d0:

    # "You don't like the tone of his voice. You like the look in his eyes even less. The way he's beckoning you is worse than either."
    "你不喜欢他说话的语气。你更不喜欢他眼中的神色。他招手示意你的方式比前两者更糟。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5170
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_cde09446:

    # "But none of the others look like they're planning on intervening. You excuse yourself, get up, and follow the jackal as he heads around the corner."
    "但其他人看起来都没有打算介入。你道了声歉，站起来，在[他]拐过街角时跟上了那只豺狼。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5186
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_9ca2459c:

    # p "Where are we going?"
    p "我们去哪儿？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5188
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_8b1ad0ee:

    # pb "Know somebody with a room. And you owe me."
    pb "我认识一个有房间的人。而且这是你欠我的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5190
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_f05e3e26:

    # p "Wait... {i}now{/i}?"
    p "等等……{i}现在{/i}？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5194
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_21bd9f04:

    # pb "We agreed, didn't we?{w} Free access. Whenever."
    pb "我们说好的不是吗？{w} 随时使用。无论何时。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5204
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_6b99b224:

    # "It's true, you did agree to give the cocky jackal 'free access.' Maybe it's better for him to be calling that favor in now, rather than on the {i}Conway{/i}."
    "没错，你确实答应过那只傲慢的豺狼可以“随时使用”'。也许他现在就要求兑现这个人情，比在{i}Conway{/i}上要好。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5206
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_c0f7b9fa:

    # "And, if you're honest with yourself, it wasn't that bad the first time. If you have to settle things up with Perce, a few minutes during your first taste of freedom in Mogador seems like a good way to do it."
    "而且，扪心自问，头一回也没那么糟。若非得和Perce了结这事，趁刚在摩加多尔尝到自由滋味时花几分钟搞定，倒也不错。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5208
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_eb82f7b4:

    # p "Well... I did say that. No time like the present?"
    p "好吧……我是说过。那就趁现在？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5212
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_39167c50:

    # pb "{i}Exactly{/i}."
    pb "{i}正是{/i}。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5219
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_d103b928:

    # "His leering is not exactly reassuring. You don't have long to wait, though; your destination is literally around the corner, the same building as the bar."
    "他那色眯眯的眼神并不能完全让人安心。不过，你无需久等；你的目的地就在街角，和酒吧是同一栋建筑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5223
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_f5567a1d:

    # pb "Or were you hoping that I'd just forget about it?"
    pb "还是你希望我就这么忘了它？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5225
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_c89e43c8:

    # "You did, but you don't tell him."
    "你确实如此希望过，但你没告诉他。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5229
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_654adc15:

    # pb "And you know what they say about jackals, right?"
    pb "而且你知道人们怎么说豺狼的，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5231
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_8a3ccfe9:

    # "That they're slimy assholes?"
    "说他们是卑鄙的混蛋？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5233
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_05a9baad:

    # "Another thing you decide not to voice."
    "你决定这件事也闭口不谈。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5235
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_a5376c27:

    # pb "That were others see scraps, we see a feast."
    pb "在别人眼里是残羹剩饭，在我们眼里是盛宴。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5237
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_bf338bc4:

    # pb "And I plan to take the scraps of this day and turn it into a banquet fit for a king."
    pb "我打算把今天的残羹剩饭，变成一桌配得上国王的盛宴。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5239
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_1aca1faf:

    # pb "With your help of course."
    pb "当然，需要你的帮助。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5241
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_a6ddceb1:

    # "This is not how you envisioned your first taste of freedom in Mogador turning out. You halt, leading Perce to turn and snap his fingers at you."
    "这不是你想象中自己在莫加多尔初次尝到自由滋味的样子。你停下脚步，导致Perce转过身来，对你打了个响指。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5245
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_a74ccbf6:

    # pb "{i}Whenever{/i}, [name]. Are you planning on keeping your word, or not?"
    pb "{i}无论何时{/i}，[name]。你打不打算遵守诺言了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5252
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_5883bc40:

    # "What choice do you have? With Perce grumbling, you see where the jackal is taking you. As it turns out, you don't have far to go: it's around the corner, and appears to be the same building as the bar."
    "你还有什么选择？Perce嘟囔着，你看到了豺狼正把你带往何处。结果发现，你们不需要走很远：目的地就在街角，而且看起来和酒吧是同一栋建筑。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5262
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_21c9f740:

    # p "I haven't forgotten. Free access."
    p "我没忘。随时使用。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5264
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_a74ccbf6_1:

    # pb "{i}Whenever{/i}, [name]. Are you planning on keeping your word, or not?"
    pb ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5266
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_89d0d79d:

    # p "Listen, Perce. I might have something even better."
    p "听着，Perce。我可能有更好的东西。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5270
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_08252fc2:

    # "His brow furrows and you see the hint of his teeth peeking past his chops."
    "他的眉头皱起，你看到他牙齿的尖端从唇边露了出来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5272
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_e1354c45:

    # pb "Are ya planning to hand me a pound of gold as well?"
    pb "你还打算递给我一磅金子吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5274
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_390033a9:

    # pb "I'm not playing games here, so don't you try weaseling yourself out of this."
    pb "我可不会在这儿跟你玩花样，所以少在这儿耍滑头逃避。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5276
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_6220cd76:

    # pb "Your muzzle was plenty fine-"
    pb "你的嘴巴挺好——"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5280
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_46fe2c63:

    # "You bring a paw to stop him mid-sentence."
    "你伸出一只爪子，在他话说到一半时制止了他。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5282
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_7be3b516:

    # p "Just be quiet for like one moment and hear me out, will you?"
    p "就安静一下听我说完，好吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5284
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_3945eedc:

    # "With a quick tip of your head over your shoulder you point back in the direction you two came from."
    "你迅速用头朝肩膀后方示意，指向你们俩来的方向。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5286
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_a326742c:

    # p "Him. The guy who joined as a passenger."
    p "他。那个作为乘客上船的家伙。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5288
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_60f52c54:

    # pb "What about him?"
    pb "他怎么了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5290
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_7d4930ec:

    # p "What do you think of him?"
    p "你觉得他怎么样？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5294
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_8b9f8789:

    # "Perce just snarls in response."
    "Perce只是用咆哮回应。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5296
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_94c7d278:

    # pb "I told you I'm not playing games, get to the point or stop stalling. The {i}whenever{/i} means {i}right now{/i} as well."
    pb "我告诉过你我跟你玩花样，说重点，不然就别拖延了。{i}无论何时{/i}也包括{i}现在{/i}。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5298
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_752c1b4b:

    # p "What I mean is that I might be able to get him to do it in my stead."
    p "我的意思是，我或许能让他代替我做。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5300
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_ccdea7b3:

    # p "Muzzle's a muzzle, right?"
    p "嘴就是嘴，对吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5304
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_a41dc089:

    # pb "And you think I believe a word you're saying?"
    pb "你觉得我会信你说的任何一个字吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5306
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_451c6f7b:

    # p "You don't have to believe, because I'll show you. Give me a moment and I'll be right back with him."
    p "你无需相信，因为我会证明给你看。给我点时间，我马上带他回来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5308
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_7e84dd6c:

    # "You can see the gears in his mind turning as he weighs the new option against the possibility of you just wanting to dip and run."
    "你能看见他脑中齿轮飞转，权衡着这个新选择与你是否只是试图脱身逃跑的可能性。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5310
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_8c581061:

    # pb "Fine, but you better not be bullshitting me, you understand? We're still workin' on the same ship, remember?"
    pb "行，但你最好别耍我，明白吗？我们还在同一条船上共事呢，记得吧？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5312
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_6760ebb3:

    # "It's difficult to ignore..."
    "这一点很难忽视……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5314
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_0c7431a2:

    # "Relies on Nomax to play along, but you feel with a little tug of the leash you'll get him to play along."
    "虽然得靠Nomax配合，但你觉得稍加牵引就能让他乖乖听话。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5321
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_d8e18237:

    # "It doesn't take much to convince him, though you leave out the details of what you have planned."
    "说服他并不费力，尽管你省略了计划的具体细节。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5323
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_b2675c61:

    # "Just something vague about 'needing to talk to him' and that Sam should wait for you to return."
    "只是含糊地说“需要和他谈谈”，Sam会等你回来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5325
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_711be000:

    # "You fill him in on the more explicit details once you are out of earshot of the crowds, and being led by Perce to wherever you need to go."
    "在Perce带你去目的地的路上，远离人群的听力范围之后，你才向他透露更露骨的细节。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5327
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_e427f36a:

    # "Just as you hoped, Nomax was quick to succumb to your pulling of his leash and is following along obediently."
    "正如你所愿，诺马克斯很快屈服于你的牵引，顺从地跟随着。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:5330
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_1c63be80:

    # "A stairway in the courtyard leads to a dingy room with a cot, a table, and two chairs. On the table is a mess of paper, a bottle still half-filled with something among other things."
