# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7244
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_878d33e7:

    # p "You {i}gambled{/i} me?"
    p "你拿我{i}当赌注{/i}？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7246
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_02a74635:

    # pb "Wouldn't have been a problem if I'd won. Well, he'll get over it."
    pb "要是我赢了就没事了。算了，Tallet会想开的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7248
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_47c318d2:

    # p "That's not the point. I'm not yours to just..."
    p "问题不在这儿。我不是你的东西，怎么能随便……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7252
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_c8d26d94:

    # "You can't even think of the right words for it. Perce, for his part, only smirks."
    "你甚至想不出合适的词来形容。Perce只是得意地咧嘴。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7254
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_25f227dd:

    # pb "Don't make the mistake of thinking you're better than me, [name]. I've seen what you look like when you come crawling back."
    pb "别误以为你比我强，[name]。你爬回来时那副德性我可都看在眼里。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7256
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_7d35bbba:

    # pb "I kept {i}my{/i} word, didn't I?"
    pb "我遵守了{i}我的{/i}承诺，不是吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7258
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_c2c4b614:

    # p "I... suppose."
    p ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7260
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_671e90e9:

    # pb "With less complaining than it took for you to keep yours. Something to keep in mind..."
    pb "那时可比你履行承诺时抱怨得少多了。这点你最好记着……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7262
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_45f49fc2:

    # "You think back to his conversation while you were under the table, and a word the coyote used: superior."
    "你回想起自己在桌下时听到的对话，还有郊狼用过的一个词：上级。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7264
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_5ff3cf19:

    # p "Are you... are you being promoted?"
    p "你……你这是要升职了？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7268
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_9fdbaf20:

    # pb "No. Arthur needs someone to help out, that's what it is. We've all known that for a while."
    pb "不。Arthur需要人帮忙，就是这么回事。我们早就知道了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7270
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_324fe028:

    # p "And you're it?"
    p "所以人选是你？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7272
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_1680fc89:

    # pb "Maybe I am. Maybe you want to stay on my good side, eh, kitten?"
    pb "也许是的呢。也许你该学着讨好我，嗯，小猫咪？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7274
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_228e7e09:

    # pb "That mouth won't fix everything.{w} Though it does fix a lot."
    pb "光靠那张嘴可解决不了所有事。{w}虽然确实能解决不少。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7276
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_a9cebcdc:

    # pb "If you're ever in need again, you know where to find me. Would be better if you'd be a bitch to rut, but a true sailor makes do with what he's given."
    pb ""

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7278
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_698ce6de:

    # pb "'Sides, squint and ya kinda look like one on your knees."
    pb "再说了，眯起眼看看，你跪着的样子还真有几分像。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7280
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_12a157eb:

    # pb "If you'll excuse me, I'll have to stock up on some of the good stuff. Heard there's a place in town offering bottles for real cheap."
    pb "失陪了，我得去屯点好货。听说镇上有家店卖得特别便宜。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7284
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_0e4da8c9:

    # "He really does deserve a fist to his smug visage..."
    "他那张得意的脸真该挨上一拳……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7291
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_f56a81a0:

    # "Ignoring the jackal's leer, you head back to the {i}Conway{/i}. It's hard to imagine Perce, of all the crew, being in a position of authority."
    "无视豺狼猥琐的视线，你返回{i}Conway{/i}。实在难以想象，在所有船员中，居然是Perce能掌权。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7293
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_30924d43:

    # "For that matter, you thought that Sam had Arthur's favor. Perhaps it's worth asking the maned wolf, if you can find a delicate way to pose the question."
    "说到这个，你原以为Sam更受Arthur青睐。也许值得问问那只鬃狼，如果你能找到委婉的方式提出这个问题。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7295
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_disagree_526e2a0f:

    # "Either way, it seems that your time in Morocco is going to be more complicated than you expected..."
    "无论如何，看来你在摩洛哥的日子会比预想的更复杂……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7311
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_00489001:

    # p "Perce. I'm not your plaything. I'm definitely not his."
    p "Perce。我不是你的玩物。更绝对不是他的。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7313
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_f53f39e2:

    # pb "You already were. We proved that, kitten."
    pb "你早就是了。我们证明了这点，小猫咪。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7315
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_1eaff72b:

    # pb "Don't be difficult."
    pb "别这么难搞。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7324
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_3fe175ab:

    # "You swallow your nerves, steel yourself, and stand up straight."
    "你咽下不安，鼓起勇气，挺直身子。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7326
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_8e033af8:

    # p "What I owe you, I owe you. Not this."
    p "我欠你的，我会还。但不是用这种方式。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7339
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_075c6d14:

    # "You flex your fingers, and when your claws briefly extend you hear the coyote snicker. Goaded, Perce takes a step towards you, opening his muzzle to argue."
    "你活动手指，爪子短暂伸出时听到郊狼的窃笑。被激怒的Perce朝你迈了一步，张开嘴想要争辩。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7344
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_ac25645f:

    # "You catch his previously injured paw, and grip it just firmly enough to bring the jackal to a halt. He grits his teeth, growling darkly."
    "你抓住他先前受伤的前爪，用力恰到好处地握住，让豺狼停了下来。他咬紧牙关，发出低沉的咆哮。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7346
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_20b8773a:

    # pb "You don't want to make enemies, Mr. [family_name]."
    pb "你不会想树敌的，[family_name]先生。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7354
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_c07d2f69:

    # tallet "Leave him be."
    tallet "由他去吧。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7360
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_5051473d:

    # "Perce jerks his head, turning his attention to the coyote. The other sailor laughs again."
    "珀西猛地转头，注意力转向郊狼。那个水手又笑了起来。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7362
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_e3f81c65:

    # tallet "Or don't. If he claws you a good one, Perce, we're square. Love to see that."
    tallet "或者别听我的。要是他给你挠出个好伤口，Perce，咱俩就两清了。我倒真想看看。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7364
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_def0a629:

    # "His chuckle—or, perhaps, that the sailor himself isn't going to force the issue—defuses the situation."
    "他的轻笑——或者说，这水手本人不打算强迫的态度——化解了紧张局面。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7369
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_1b6f64c1:

    # "Perce wrenches his paw free, steps back, and shakes his head."
    "Perce猛地抽回爪子，后退一步，摇了摇头。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7371
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_8e9aaf94:

    # pb "Think I won't remember this?"
    pb "你以为我会忘了这事？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7377
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_36bdd73c:

    # tallet "You'll have others to blackmail, Perce. And you still owe me. I'm investing it."
    tallet "你会有别的勒索对象的，Perce。而且你还欠着我。这笔账我先记着。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7379
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_fe9bbbdb:

    # pb "Maybe I'll just tell Arthur to ban gambling."
    pb "也许我该直接让Arthur禁止赌博。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7383
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_9004417e:

    # tallet "You're a bastard and a jackanape, Perce. You're not an idiot."
    tallet "你是个混蛋，也是个无赖，Perce。但你不是傻瓜。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7385
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_5b498d73:

    # p "Why would Arthur care what you say, anyway?"
    p "Arthur凭什么在乎你说什么？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7389
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_98361304:

    # pb "Because he's a good judge of character."
    pb "因为他看人很准。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7391
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_eaf38c7c:

    # tallet "Who needs someone to mentor. Groom. We need good officers."
    tallet "而他需要有人来指导。培养。我们需要好长官。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7393
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_ffbf07b0:

    # tallet "Perce will have to do."
    tallet "只能靠Perce了。"

