    # pb "It's good to be reliable."
    pb "可靠是件好事。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7405
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_8d891f70:

    # "Perce puts a fair amount of venom on the last word, still unhappy with your reluctance. The idea of Perce in a position of authority..."
    "珀西在那个词上加了十足的讽刺，仍然对你刚才的抗拒不满。想到Perce掌权的画面……"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7407
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_9f840239:

    # "You can almost hear him doubling the price of his 'favor' again."
    "你几乎能听见他又把“人情”的价格翻了一倍。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7414
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_da14772a:

    # "When, grumbling, he says he has no more use for you and points towards the door, you make a hasty exit."
    "当他嘟囔着说你没用了并指向门口时，你匆忙离开了。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7416
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_7509e33e:

    # "The cooling air feels clammier than it did before. Nomax and Samuel are no longer at the table. They can't have gone far, though your first thought is that you should return to the ship."
    "凉爽的空气感觉比之前更湿黏。 Nomax和Samuel已不在桌边。他们应该没走多远，但你第一个念头是返回船上。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7418
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_f4d9c08a:

    # "You could've sworn that Sam and Arthur were close—much closer than Perce is. Didn't Arthur ask [him] to help guide the ship into harbor?"
    "你本来很肯定Sam跟Arthur的关系很密切——比密切亲近得多。进港时Arthur不是让[他]帮忙领航了吗？"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7420
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_b84d7db0:

    # "If the {i}Conway{/i} needs more officers, Sam would be the more reasonable option, as far as you can tell. But the other sailor didn't correct Perce's assertion."
    "就你所知，如果{i}Conway{/i}需要更多长官，Sam本是更合理的人选。但那个水手并没有纠正Perce的说法。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7422
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_8d3b0609:

    # "And, now that you think about it, it would explain the conversation you saw Perce having with the first mate. Maybe, if you can find a way to raise the subject delicately, Sam or Rajeeyah would know more."
    "而且，现在回想起来，这也能解释你之前看到Perce和大副谈话的事。也许，如果你能找到委婉的方式提起这个话题，Sam或者Rajeeyah会知道更多内情。"

# game/script morocco part1.rpy:7424
translate Chinese day14_perce_second_favor_reject_43c94beb:

    # "For now, all you know is that your time in the city is proving to be more complicated than you'd expected..."
    "目前你只知道，这座城市里的日子正变得比你预想的更加复杂……"

